	1.1.3 (p.54)

tadanu oṃ mucili svāhā / oṃ mohani svāhā / oṃ dattili svāhā / ity anena svapnamāṇavakena mukhaṃ vāmahastenaikaviṃśativārān abhimantrya bhagavato lokeśvarasyāgrataḥ pūjāpūrvakaṃ dakṣiṇadikśiraḥśāyī pūrvāsyaḥ śucibhūṣaṇaḥ śucipradeśe yathākāmaṃ svapet / duḥsvapne 'mṛtakuṇḍalimantrajāpāt paramārthataḥ sarvadharmananiḥsvābhāvyādhimokṣato vā punar vā svapnamāṇavakaṃ vidhāya devatābhir dattāyām aniṣiddhāyāṃ vā bhūmau vakṣyamāṇaṃ kuryāt / niṣiddhāyāṃ naiva /


	1.1.4 (p.55)

susvapne tu dvitīye śubhe dine pūrvāhne bhūsparśamudrayā vajraparyaṅkī vajrasattvayogavān / oṃ bhūḥ khaṃ iti mantreṇa śūnyām / hūṃ laṃ hūṃ iti vajraparamāṇumayīṃ bhuvaṃ vibhāvya / oṃ medini vajrībhava vajra bandha hūṃ ity adhitiṣṭhet /
savyakarendu-hūṃ-trayeṇa trir uccāritena tatkiraṇair aṅgulyagrahananais taddhvanibhiś ca bhuvaḥ saṃcodanād ardhaśarīreṇa sarvaśarīreṇa vā niḥsṛtāṃ pṛthivīdevatāṃ pītāṃ sakanakakalaśābhayakaradvayāṃ subhūṣaṇāṃ pādyācamanārghapūrvakaṃ puṣpādibhiḥ sampūjya /

	tvaṃ devi sākṣibhūtāsi sarvabuddhāna tāyināṃ /
	caryānayaviśeṣeṣu bhūmipāramitāsu ca //
