	1.1.5 (p.57)

tatra kūṭāgārodare kṛtagandhamaṇḍale svahṛdbījaraśmibhir maṇḍalacakraṃ dikpālādīṃś cānīya pādyācamanārghadānapūjābalipuraḥsaraṃ hūṃ-javajrajihvo dhṛtadhūpakaṭacchur ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan bhagavann ityādi sāṃnidhyaṃ kartum arhathetiparyantavakṣyamāṇagāthābhiḥ pratiṣṭhāśabdasthāne vihārādiśabdaprakṣepeṇa saṃnidhānaṃ buddhabodhisattvair devanāgādibhiś ca nabhaḥparipūrṇaṃ vicintya vakṣyamāṇavijayādikalaśān dānapativaśāt tadabhāve 'nyān apy antargatajīvamatsyān yathākramam avasthāpya karmakarān vighnāntakādisarvakṛddevatākārān nirmāya taiś caturasraṃ tiryag dvihastaṃ tadardham adho gartaṃ khānayet / tasya caiśānyāṃ tanmānaṃ tadardhaṃ vā vartulaṃ / tadubhayaṃ mṛdgomayābhyāṃ lepayet /
tataś caturasragarte 'rghabhājanenaiva vakṣyamāṇārghamantreṇārghaṃ dattvā yathākramaṃ vijayādikalaśair jalaṃ dadyāt / yathā caturasram āpūrya śrotasā vartulaṃ pūrayet /

