	1.1.6 (p.58)

tadanu śītalījīvamatsyopetaṃ dakṣiṇāvartajalam avalokya kṣīriṇaḥ pallavaṃ dattvā jāṃ-javajrajāṃ pītāṃ pītakṛṣṇasitamūlasavyavāmavaktratrayāṃ saptaphaṇāṃ ratnamakuṭāṃ ṣaḍbhujāṃ dakṣiṇakarābhyāṃ vajraśaradharām itarābhyāṃ cāpasapāśatarjanīdharāṃ svābhopāyāliṅgitāṃ vicitravastranāgālaṅkṛtāṃ viśvābje sūryāsanaprabhāṃ niṣaṇṇāṃ jāṃgulīm ātmānaṃ bhāvayan pañcadhā kamalāvartaṃ kṛtvā rasātalaparyantāvalokanena viśvavajramayīṃ bhuvaṃ vicintya pūgasrakcandanaiḥ prekṣakalokān sampūjya sabhṛtyaputrakalatrān indrādidaśadikpatīn aiśānyāṃ vicintya teṣām upari sarvakṛnmantreṇa sāṣṭaśatābhir mantritān vakṣyamāṇadaśakīlakān oṃ gha gha-ityādimantreṇa rakṣārthaṃ siddhārthaṃ ca khānayet.


	1.1.7 (p.59) % vāstunāgaparīkṣā

tato nirdalitavighnāśayo vāstunāgaṃ parīkṣet / yatra khalu bhūmau vihārādikaṃ kartavyaṃ tāṃ sopacārāṃ caturasreṇa māpayitvā tadbhūmer madhyadeśe vāstunāgasya śayanādilakṣaṇam avadhārya bhūsaṃskāraḥ kartavyaḥ / tatra sūryagatyā bhādrādīṃs trīṃs trīn māsān yathākramaṃ pūrvadakṣiṇapaścimottaradikśirasā dakṣiṇādimukhas tanmadhyabhūmau vāstunāgaḥ kila svapiti /
tam ālakṣya vajramuṣṭyā sūtram ādāyottarasādhakena sārdhaṃ pradakṣiṇagatir analānilāvasthitaḥ prākpratīcyuttarāvāgdiśaḥ sūtrayitvā sūryodayam ārabhya pradakṣiṇato gartāpūraṃ khānayet / nāgasya kroḍabhāge kroḍaṃ hastaikena parityajya dṛṣṭidaṇḍaṃś ceti kaścit /
yataḥ śirasi khānite pitāputrādayo vinaśyanti / pṛṣṭhabhāge tv ātmano nāśo deśatyāgo vā / pucche gomahiṣyādir naśyati / tasyāṃ bhuvi pāṣāṇe sati vāyuḥ syāt / asthiṣu śūlaṃ śarkarāsu mūkatvaṃ tuṣe 'ṅgāre ca jvaraḥ keśamūlakāṣṭhādau kṣudropadrava iti sthāṇumūladīvīkaṅkālāṅgārādikam apasārya pṛthvīvahniṃ tathāgatāṃs tatsthānādhipatiṃ dikpālān lokapālān kṣetrapālāṃś ca śāntikahomena saṃtarpya bhūpater dānapateś ca śāntikaṃ kuryāt / śeṣabaliṃ ca dadyāt / uttaratrāpi vidhiṣu / utsavaḥ śaktitaḥ kāryaḥ saṃghabhojyaṃ ca gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt /
śilpinaḥ karmakarāṃś ca toṣayed iti vihāragandhakūṭīcaityāvasathāśramārghavidhiḥ /

	1.2 Puṣkariṇyādyarghavidhi/ (p.62)

puṣkariṇīvāpīkūpādikaraṇe tu balipūjādipūrvakam anantaravad arghaṃ vidhāya oṃ vaṃ vajravaruṇa hūṃ ity anena vajravaruṇarūpiṇaṃ vairocanaṃ vicintya tatpariṇatam aṣṭanāgakulāvāsaṃ jñānāmṛtajalākulaṃ oṃ vajrasattva samayas tvaṃ iti paṭhann aṣṭāṅgopetavāriparipūrṇam ārasātalaṃ paśyed iti puṣkariṇyādyarghavidhiḥ /

	1.3 Pratimādyarghavidhi 
	1.3.1 (p.62)

pratimāpustakādikaraṇe tu balipūjāpuraḥsaraṃ śilpinaḥ kariṣyamāṇadevatāyāḥ kulādhiparūpān lekhakāṃs tv amitābharūpān hṛdi svasvabījena hṛtkaṇṭhamūrdhasu yathākramaṃ vajrapadmacakrastha-hūṃ-āḥ-oṃ-kāraiś ca vāmetarakarayoś candravajrābhyāṃ ca yuktān jhaṭiti vicintya hṛdādikaṃ spṛśan hūṃ āḥ oṃ ity adhiṣṭhāya pavitradārumṛtpāṣāṇadravyavastrādikaṃ śūnyatādhimokṣeṇa jhaṭiti hṛdbījena kariṣyamāṇadevatārūpaṃ vicintya bhagavann ityādi sānnidhyaṃ kartum arhathetyantaṃ paṭhet /


	1.3.2 (p. 63)
patre tu bhāvita-dhīḥ-kārakarānītaṃ vāgvajram akṣarākārapariṇataṃ vibhāvya svayaṃ ca oṃ vajrasattva hūṃ ity anena oṃ āḥ vighnāntakṛt hūṃ ity anena caikaviṃśativārān abhimantrya kūrcikādikaṃ lekhanīṃ ca prajñājñānātmikāṃ maśīṃ ca vajrāṇupariṇāmena jñānāmṛtākārāṃ punaś ca oṃ dhīḥ śrutismṛtivijaye sarvājñānapaṭalāpahāriṇi hrīḥ svāhā iti lekhanīṃ maśīṃ ca mantrayitvā teṣu samarpayet / 
śatākṣareṇa dṛḍhīkuryāt / śilpitoṣaṇasaṃghabhojyādikaṃ ca samācaret / sarvatra cātra bhāvitadevatānāṃ visarjanaṃ kāryāṃ / khaṇḍasphuṭitavihārādikaṃ punaḥ saṃskartukāmaḥ kṛtabalyupahārādikaḥ pratiṣṭhāsamayasamāropitadevatākāraṃ visarjya tathaiva saṃskārādikaṃ kuryād iti pratimādyarghavidhiḥ.

	2. Arghādidānalakṣaṇavidhi
	2.1 (p.65)

iha yathāyogaṃ vakṣyamāṇeṣu vidhiṣu
	hemarūpyaśilātāmradārumṛnmayamauktikaṃ /
	śaṅkhaṃ parṇapuṭaṃ pādyaprokṣācamanārghabhājanaṃ //
tatrānyatamabhājane yavakṣīrasitakusumakuśatilalājāsāmṛtasitagandhodakāni prakṣipya oṃ āḥ hūṃ iti mantreṇa svādhipatimantreṇa ca kuṇḍalimantreṇa ca saptavārān sāṣṭaśataṃ vā mantrayec chāntyartham / tiladadhipītapuṣpadarbhasāmṛtapītagandhajalaṃ prakṣipya tathā japet puṣṭyartham /

	2.2 (p.66)
tataḥ svavāmapārśve tadarghabhājanaṃ pādyabhājanaṃ ca prokṣaṇācamanabhājanaṃ ca dhārayet teṣām agre pratīcchakakevalapātratrayaṃ ca / 
tatra pādyabhājanasya jalaṃ savyena muṣṭinā puṣpam aṅguṣṭhatarjanīsaṃdaṃśenādāya līlayāṅgulīr bhrāmayan pātre vakṣyamāṇamantreṇa trir dadyāt tarjanīṃ madhyamām anāmikāṃ kaniṣṭhāṃ ca kramān muñcan /
dvitīyabhājanasya jalena savyakarasthakuśavittikāgragṛhītena triḥ prokṣayet dvitīye pratīcchake / sārvakarmikakalaśajalenābhyukṣaṇe 'py evam \
dvitīyabhājanasyaiva jalaṃ savyahastamuṣṭinā puṣpam aṅguṣṭhatarjanīsaṃdaṃśena gṛhītvācamanāya dvitīya eva pratīcchake vakṣyamāṇamantraṃ paṭhann adhomukhamuṣṭinā trir dadyāt krameṇa kaniṣṭhām anāmikāṃ madhyamāṃ tarjanīṃ ca muñcan /
tṛtīyasyārghabhājanasya jalādikam añjalinā gṛhītvā oṃ āḥ hrīḥ pravarasatkāraṃ arghaṃ pratīccha hūṃ svāhā iti paṭhan vajrāñjalivikāśena dadyāt trīn vārāṃs tṛtīye pratīcchake pūrvakarmatraye tv arghaṃ hitvā pādyaṃ prokṣaṇam ācamanam iti paṭhet.


	2.3 (p.67)

ayaṃ ca pādyaprokṣaṇācamanārghadānakramaḥ prāyaśo dṛśyate kvacid anyathā prokṣaṇantu yathāyogaṃ kvacid arghadānaṃ prathamaṃ kvacid arghadānam eveti yathāvasaraṃ yathāyogaṃ kuryāt /
tatra pādyam udakaṃ devatānāṃ pādayoḥ prakṣālanāya dīyamānaṃ cintayet. 
prokṣaṇaṃ sarvagātre / ācamanaṃ kare mukhe vā / argham agre śirasi vā. 
puṣpaṃ śirasi dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ cāgre naivedyam agre kare vā mukhe vā / gandhaṃ hṛdīti sarvavidhiṣv ity arghādidānalakṣaṇavidhiḥ /


	3. Pūrvasevāniyamaprayojanavidhi 

	3.1 (p.68)

tadanu niṣpāditavihārādeḥ pratiṣṭhārtham abhiṣekārthaṃ vādhyeṣitaḥ svasyānyasya vā siddhisādhanādyarthitayā mahāntaṃ sattvārthaṃ paśyan paraṃ samādāpyāpi maṇḍalalikhanāya sambhārajananīṃ pūrvasevāṃ vighnavināśinīṃ kuryāt /
	sarvajñamārgajño na hi siddhir asevayā /% first pāda unmetrical
	tasmān niṣadya nirdvandvaṃ satkramadvayatattvavit //
	bhāvayed devatācakraṃ khinnas tanmantram ājapet /
	cakreśasya japel lakṣaṃ lakṣaṃ vā svādhidevatāṃ //
	cakriṇām ayutaṃ ceti pūrvaseveyam ucyate //


	3.2 (p.69)

tāsāṃ cotpattyutpannakramadevatānāṃ bhāvanākramo mantrāś cānyatra yathāvidhi savistaram uttānitā iti / neha prapañcitāḥ / bahūnāṃ vakṣyamāṇarajomaṇḍalānāṃ pratyekaṃ saṃsthānavarṇavaktrabhujāyudhamantramātrakathane 'pi granthavistaraḥ syād ity alparucīnām apravṛttiśaṅkayā saṃsthānādimātram api no cakṣīmahi / niṣpannayogāvalyāṃ tv adhimātrabuddhīn adhikṛtyātratyamaṇḍaladevatābhāvanākramaḥ saṃkṣiptasāro 'smābhir bhaṇito 'vaśyam abhyasyaḥ / ata eva vajrāvalyā jyotirmañjarī-iva niṣpannayogāvalī parikaraḥ /


	3.3 (p.70)

evaṃ vistareṇa kṛtapūrvasevo jhaṭiti sarvākārasuniṣpannaṃ spharantaṃ saṃharantaṃ ca devatāmaṇḍalayogam āmukhīkartuṃ śaktaś cakrastha eva cakriṇām aniṣedhena samupacitasambhāratvenājñayā vā maṇḍalapratiṣṭhām śiṣyasaṃgrahādikaṃ ca kuryāt iti / pūrvasevāniyamaprayojanavidhiḥ /


	4. śiṣyasaṃgrahavidhi

	4.1 (p.71)

tatra pratiṣṭhāvidhaye mārgamāghaphālgunavaiśākajyeṣṭhāṣāḍeṣu caitrapūrṇimāyām iti kālacakra-uktes tu caitre vānyatroktes tu kārttike āśvine vā dvitīyātṛtīyāpañcamīsaptamīdaśamītrayodaśīpūrṇimāsu / somabudhabṛhaspatiśukravāreṣu rohiṇyāṃ dhanalābho bhavati mṛgaśirasi śāntir ārdrāyāṃ saubhāgyaṃ puṣyāyāṃ jaya uttarāyāṃ prajāvṛddhir hastāyāṃ siddhir anurādhāyām iṣṭaṃ jyeṣṭhāyāṃ sukhaṃ mūlāśravaṇayor āgamajñānam āṣāḍhāyāṃ putravṛddhir bhādrapadāyāṃ vṛddhiḥ / saumyagrahāśrite lagne śubhakāryaṃ bhavati / viṣkambhātigaṇḍaśūlagaṇḍavyāghātavajravyatīpātaparighavaidhṛtirahitā yogāḥ śubhakāryeṣu siddhihetavaḥ / karaṇāni ca viṣṭirahitānīti 


	4.2 (p.71)

śubhāni māsatithivāranakṣatrayogakaraṇāni svaparasiddhāntakrameṇa pratītyasamutpādavidhinā vā dvādaśasv api māseṣu śubhamuhūrtaṃ nirūpya śiṣyeṇa dvis trir vādhyeṣito maṇḍalalikhanārthaṃ / saced asambhṛtopakaraṇas tadā tannābhinyastaravimaṇḍalastha-hūṃ-kārakiraṇair hṛdgata-kaṃ-kārodbhūtaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ vikṛtarūpaṃ nagnaṃ lambavṛṣaṇam ūrdhvakeśaṃ piśācavat pāpaṃ nāsikāgreṇa niḥsārya taṃ ca hūṃ- kāraṃ hṛdi nītvā pariṇamayya vakṣyamāṇavajrahūṃkāramahākrodhaṃ vibhāvya bahir niṣkāṣya / oṃ sumbha nisumbha hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ gṛhṇāpaya gṛhṇāpaya hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ ānaya ho bhagavan vidyārāja amukasya sarvapāpaṃ nāśaya hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / ity uccārayan karasthajvaladvajreṇa niḥsāritapāpaṃ śūnyīkurvantaṃ cintayet /


	4.3 (p.74)

śiṣyacittavighnāṃś cāmṛtakuṇḍalinā nābher adhaḥ kīlākāreṇa oṃ vajrakīla kīlayāsya sarvavighnān bandha bandha hūṃ phaṭ iti vajrahūṃkārājñāpitena svayaṃ ca paṭhan kīlayitvā kīlaraśmibhir atiraudraiḥ sarvaduṣṭān nirdahya taṃ ca śiṣyaṃ saṃ-kāreṇa samantabhadrarūpaṃ vicintya hṛdi rakṣārtham a-kārajam indumaṇḍalam antyasvarodbhavaviśvavajrādhiṣṭhitaṃ vicintya śirasi candrastha-hūṃ-jātam ūrdhvaśiraskaṃ māmakyākrāntamadhyaṃ pañcasūcikaṃ vajraṃ vibhāvya tajjñānadevīhṛccandrasthavajravaraṭakāntargatamantramālotpannapītasūkṣmavajraraśmispharaṇaiḥ sarvāṅgam abhivyāpya kavacitaṃ dhyātvā oṃ āḥ śaṅkare śāntikare ghuṭa ghuṭa ghuṭṭini ghātaya ghātaya ghuṭṭini amukaṃ rakṣa svāhā hūṃ iti japan saṃrakṣayet kuṇḍalimantraṃ cāsmai japituṃ dadyāt / evaṃ kṛte 'sya vighnā na prabhavanty upakaraṇāni ca sukhena milantīti śiṣyasaṃgrahavidhiḥ /


	5. Bhūkhananavidhi

	5.1 (p.76)

tataḥ sambhṛtopakaraṇasāmagryā sahāyaiś ca nipuṇataraiḥ samanvitaḥ pūrṇimām ārabhyāparapūrṇimāṃ yāvat śuklāṃ pratipadaṃ vā pañcamīm aṣṭamīṃ daśamīṃ trayodaśīṃ caturdaśīṃ vā 'rabhya pūrṇimāyāṃ vā prātaḥ prabhṛti maṇḍalakarma kuryāt / maṇḍalapraveśadivase tv ācāryaḥ śiṣyeṇa sahānāhāro bhavet /


	5.2 (p.76)

tatra tu śubhavāranakṣatramuhūrtādau pūrvāhne savidyaḥ suvihitacakreśadevatāyogaḥ kṛtapūrvasevaḥ pūrvasyāṃ diśi maṇḍale likhyamāne bhūpater maraṇaṃ janatāyāś ca nānopadravaḥ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ yasyārthe maṇḍalaṃ sa mriyate / vāruṇyām ācāryaḥ / kauberyāṃ tatra praviṣṭa āgneyāṃ vṛṣṭiḥ / nairṛtyāṃ durbhikṣaṃ vāyavyāṃ vātavṛṣṭiś caityasamīpe mṛtyuḥ nāgādhiṣṭhitajalasamīpe jalaṃ vṛkṣacchāyāyāṃ bālasya mṛtyur iti jñātvā sarvaṃ parityajya pattananagaragrāmārāmavihārāgārāṇāṃ aiśānyāṃ diśi yatra vā manaḥ prasīdati tāṃ pūrvottaraplavāṃ praśastāṃ maṇḍalabhūmiṃ nirūpya 


	5.3 (p.77)

gandhādinā maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā maṇḍaladevatāḥ sampūjya baliṃ dattvā nabhasi visṛjya tāṃs tatrasthakṣetrapālādīn balyupahārādibhiḥ
	ye 'tra santi surā nāgā yakṣā rakṣāṃsi vāpare /
	yāce 'haṃ tān bhuvaṃ te ca maṇḍalārthaṃ sṛjanti mām //
iti trir abhyarthya svapnādinā tair dattām apratiṣiddhāṃ vā jñātvā 'paradinapūrvāhne śrīvajradharādīṃś ca gaganatalagatān prārthya manasā 'nujñāṃ dāpayitvā madhyāhne rakṣācakravighnakīlanabhāvanayā krūrahomena vā vighnān utsārya homapakṣe śiṣyarakṣārtham aparāhne āgneyadiggatakuṇḍe śāntikahomaṃ ca kṛtvā tāṃ ca bhūmiṃ oṃ āḥ vighnātakṛt hūṃ ityādisarvakṛnmantreṇa japtaiḥ sarṣapodakabhasmabhir abhyukṣya tatra ca vajraparyaṅkī pṛthivīdevatāṃ vakṣyamāṇarūpāṃ dhyātvā pādyācamanārghapūjāpuraḥsaraṃ ehy ehītyādinā tvaṃ devītyādinā vā trir anuyācya evaṃ kriyatām ity uktavatīṃ manasotthāpya gagane sthāpayet /


	5.4 (p.79)

tatas tāṃ bhūmiṃ nirvighnāṃ matvā baliṃ dattvā pūrvavad vāstunāgasya kroḍabhāge kaṇṭhamātraṃ vyāmamātraṃ jalāntaṃ śilāntaṃ  vā hīnamadhyottamasiddhibhedena jānukaṭinābhimātraṃ vā khānayet iti bhūkhananavidhiḥ /


	6. Tridhābhūmiśodhanavidhi

	6.1 (p.80)

tataḥ 
	sapāṣāṇe mahāvāyuḥ sāsthike śūlasambhavaḥ /
	saśarkare tu mūkatvaṃ satuṣāṅgārake jvaraḥ //
	sakeśamūlakāṣṭhādau kṣudropadravasambhava[ḥ //]
iti matvā bhasmāṅgārakeśatuṣapāṣāṇāsthiśarkareṣṭakākaṭallakādīn apanīya tayaiva mṛttikayā sugandhajalāktayā gartam āpūrya nyūnatāyām anyayāpi hūṃ-kāreṇa sarvakṛnmantreṇa ca japtagandhodakenāsicyākoṭyārdhahastonnatāṃ bhūmiṃ samāṃ kiñcit kūrmapṛṣṭhonnatām īṣatpūrvottarāvanatāṃ kuryāt /


	6.3 (p.81)

api ca 
	sarveṣāṃ śalyadoṣāṇāṃ śakto noddharaṇe yadi //
	hastaṃ dattvā japen mantraṃ saiva śuddhir mahīyasī // 
	harmyāśmatalagoṣṭhārṣavihārādau sarittaṭe //
	vināpi khananāc chuddhiḥ sthāne vā pūrvasaṃskṛte //
tat tu kevalam amṛtakuṇḍalinā duṣṭān utsārya tajjaptasarṣapodakabhasmabhir abhyavakiret / prāgdiśam ārabhya pañcagavyena tajjaptenopalepayet / gandhodakena ca prokṣayed enāṃ bhuvaṃ khanitākoṭitāṃ ca oṃ bhūḥ khaṃ iti  paṭhann ākāśīkuryāt tato hūṃ laṃ hūṃ ity anena vajramayīṃ vibhāvya oṃ medini vajrībhava vajra bandha hūṃ ity anena oṃ hana hana vajrakrodha hūṃ phaṭ ity anena ca oṃ āḥ hūṃ śodhaya śodhaya rakṣa rakṣa hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ ity anena ca mantrayed dhastaṃ dattvā 'dhitiṣṭhet /
tasyāṃ ca bhuvi yathāyogaṃ sarvakṛjjaptapañcaratnauṣadhivrīhigarbhitamadhyāyāṃ tajjaptagandhodakaliptāyāṃ balipādyādidānena nabhaḥsthabhūdevatām antarbhāvya kamalāvartaṃ oṃ āḥ hūṃ paṭhan kuryāt śatākṣaraṃ ca paṭhet /


	6.3 (p.83)

śūnyataikarasaṃ viśvam ity adhimokṣadraḍhimnā tu bhūmiṃ tathatāsvabhāvāṃ suviśuddhām adhimuñced iti niruttarā viśuddhiḥ / 
tato vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa pūrvādidiśo niścitya tanmaṇḍalasthānaṃ succhannecchāprasaracaturdvārakūṭāgārodaragataṃ caturdiktoraṇākṣavāṭāvṛtaṃ sarvato vicitraṃ sragdāmaghaṇṭāvasaktaṃ satketuvitānavitataṃ kārayed iti tridhābhūmiśodhanavidhiḥ /


	7. Bhūmiparigrahavidhi

	7.1 (p.84)

tatra puṣpābhikīrṇamaṇḍalabhūmimadhye niṣadya vajraṃ vajraghaṇṭāṃ ca dhārayan likhanīyamaṇḍalayogavān rakṣācakrādinā kṛtavighnaghāto dhṛtadhūpakaṭacchuḥ hūṃ-javajrajihvaḥ 
	samanvāharantu māṃ buddhā aśeṣādikṣu saṃsthitāḥ /
	ihāham amuko vajrī vartayiṣyāmi maṇḍalaṃ //
	āyātasarvabuddhādyāḥ siddhim enāṃ pradāsyatha // 
iti sambuddhādīn nimantryābhyarcya nabhaḥsthair vairocanādibhiḥ śiṣyaiś caturbhiḥ pūrvādidigavasthitair yathāyogaṃ vairocanādiyogibhir vajravajraghaṇṭādharair ekenāpi vā śiṣyeṇānukramatas tatra tatra gatvā
	sarvatāthāgataṃ śāntaṃ sarvatāthāgatālayam /
	sarvadharmāgranairātmyaṃ deśa maṇḍalam uttamam //
	sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇaṃ sarvālakṣaṇavarjitam /
	samantabhadrakāyāgraṃ bhāṣa maṇḍalam uttamam //
	śāntadharmāgrasambhūtaṃ jñānacaryāviśodhakam /
	samantabhadravācāgraṃ bhāṣa maṇḍalam uttamam //
	sarvasattvamahācittaṃ śuddhaṃ prakṛtinirmalam /
	samantabhadracittāgraṃ bhāṣa maṇḍalasārathe //
iti catasṛbhir gāthābhiḥ pratyekam adhyeṣayed ātmānam /
pañcavarṇayogāt sarvatathāgatamayaṃ vairocanādimahāśāntasamādhisambhūtaṃ sarvatathāgatādhyuṣitaṃ smṛtyupasthānādīnāṃ niḥsvabhāvatārūpaṃ śūnyatākaruṇābhinnamahāsukhasārādānadyotakatvād rajomaṇḍalam api maṇḍalaṃ / caturasratvādilakṣaṇayuktaṃ kṛśasthūlatvādidoṣarahitam / kāyāgraḥ kāyavajrasvabhāvo 'treti kāyāgram / śukladharmarūpeṇāvirbhūtam /evaṃbhūtajñānārthaṃ yā caryā tasyā viśodhakaṃ tad abhidyotakatvena vāgvajrasvabhāvam / sarvadharmasvarūpeṇa spharaṇāt mahācittaṃ vastutaḥ sarvāroparahitaṃ cittavajrasvarūpaṃ vineyadamyadamanāt sārathe bhāṣasvety artham āmukhayan /
sākṣād adhyeṣakābhāve tu dhyānato 'pi tathānuṣṭheyam ity āmnāyaḥ /


	7.2 (p.87)

tato maṇḍalacakrādispharaṇādipūrvakaṃ bhāvitamaṇḍalaṃ vajramuṣṭidvayasya tarjanīdvayaṃ prasārya lagnāgram adhomukhaṃ mūrdhni dhārayan hūṃ vajrottiṣṭha iti paṭhan nabhasi samutthāpya paryaṅkaṃ bhitvotthāya pūrvamukhaḥ samapadaṃ kṛtvā mūrdhny añjalinā tathāgatān namaskṛtya sattvān avidyāndhakāraparigatān mārair adhiṣṭhitān abhisamīkṣya mārān utsārayituṃ jhaṭiti vakṣyamāṇavajra-hūṃ-kāramūrtiḥ krodhāveśāt bhrūkuṭidaṃṣṭrotkaṭasāṭopaceṣṭādimān ma-kāreṇa sūryīkṛtasavyanetraḥ ṭa-kāreṇa candrīkṛtavāmanetraḥ hūṃ-kāreṇa kalpāntavahnīkṛtobhayatāro 'nayā vajradṛśā jagatsarvāsu dikṣu vīkṣetāhaṃkāraṃ cotpādayet /
	aham eva svayaṃ vajrī vajrasattvo 'smy ahaṃ svayam /
	ahaṃ buddho mahārājā ahaṃ vajrī mahābalaḥ // 
	ahaṃ yogīśvaro rājā vajrapāṇir ahaṃ dṛḍham //
iti.


	7.3 (p.89)

tataḥ pādatalabhāvitajvaladvajro yathāvasaraṃ salīlaṃ kamalāvartaṃ kurvāṇo vajram ullālayan vajraghaṇṭāṃ ca cālayan vajrapadenaivaiśānīṃ diśaṃ gatvā 
tām ārabhya pradakṣiṇataḥ śiṣyaiḥ saha maṇḍalabhūmau vajrapadair nṛtyan 
	netre hastau tathā śroṇau pāde pārśve pradakṣiṇe //
	valayet tālayogena avasavyetathā punaḥ //
	dhārānṛtyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā vallinā nartayet tataḥ /
	śīghratālais tathā nṛtyaṃ kṛtvā cakrasamaṃ bhraman //
apasarantu bhavanto ye kecid devāsurayakṣarākṣasapretapiśācāpasmārabhūtaḍākaḍākinyostārakamahallakamahallikānucarapariṣadgaruḍakimpuruṣamantrasiddhāḥ / atra pṛthivīpradeśe amukācāryeṇa mayā amukaśiṣyasyābhisambhodhiparipūraṇārthaṃ sarvasattvānuttarajñānalābhahetoḥ / śrī-amuka-maṇḍalam ālikhitavyaṃ tadaitāṃ mahāvajradharājñāṃ śrutvā śīghram evāpakrāmatha / yo nāpakrāmati tasyāham anena prajvalitahūṃkāravajreṇa dīptapradīptena mahatā jñānavajreṇa mūrdhānaṃ śatadhā vikirāmīti vā 
	śṛṇvantu sarvavighnaughāḥ kāyavākcittasaṃsthitāḥ /
	ahaṃ vajradharaḥ śrīmān ājñācakraprayojakaḥ //
	vajreṇādīptavapuṣā sphālayāmi trikāyajān /
	laṃghayed yadi kaścin me viśīryetātra nānyathā//
iti vā trir bruvāṇaḥ sphāritānantakrodhair vighnān utsārayet / maṇḍalabhuvaṃ cārasātalaṃ hūṃ-javajramayīm adhitiṣṭhet /


	7.4 (p.91)

atra bhramaṇakāle pratidvāram ātmano vāme sthitaśiṣyaghaṇṭāmadhye vajraṃ praveśayet tadvajraṃ cātmaghaṇṭāyām / evam agre savye pṛṣṭhe ca /
tatra ekasūcikaṃ vajraṃ hūṃ-jaṃ caraṇatale vicintya tena pādatalena tadvajraṃ bhūmāv ākārayan nṛtyan paribhramet / tadanu triśūcikaṃ tathā / tadanu pañcaśūcikaṃ tathā / tadanu viśvaṃ tathā / kin tu parāvṛtya bhramaṇenākārayan / imāni catvāri vajreṇāṅkitāni ākārayanti ca vajrāṇīti vajrapadāni / pratyekam ekavāraṃ pradakṣiṇata ālīḍhādibhiḥ karaṇaiḥ kartavyāni /


	7.5 (p.92)

tatra vāmajaṃghām ākuñcya dakṣiṇaṃ caraṇaṃ pañcavitastyantareṇa salīlaṃ praguṇaṃ sthāpayed ity ālīḍhaṃ sthānakam /
dakṣiṇajaṃghām ākuñcya vāmaṃ tatheti pratyālīḍham /
ṣaḍviṃśatyaṅgulāyāmaṃ bāhyacaraṇāṅgulīkaṃ stabdhajānudvayaṃ vaiśākham /
vaiśākhapadam eva hastadvayāntaraṃ haṃsapakṣākāraṃ maṇḍalapadam /
parasparacaraṇadvayāṅgulyāśleṣāt samapadam /
eṣāṃ pañcakaraṇānāṃ pratikaraṇaṃ sampūrṇaṃ pradakṣiṇam ekaṃ kuryād ity eke /
pratikaraṇaṃ pradakṣiṇatrayam ity apare / nātra kaścin niyama ity anye /
caturaṅgulāntarapārṣṇidvayaṃ vāmapādaṃ praguṇaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇaṃ vitastyantareṇa tiryaggataṃ salīlaṃ vaiśālītārāpadavat kuryād iti jātapadam /
tathaiva dakṣiṇaṃ praguṇam vāmaṃ tiryaggataṃ kuryād iti pratyājātapadam /
samapadaṃ kṛtvā vitastitrayāntareṇa dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ vāmasyāgrato dhārayed iti vikaṭapadam /
tathaiva dakṣiṇaṃ praguṇam kṛtvā vāmaṃ dakṣiṇasyāgrato vitastitrayāntareṇa sthāpayed iti prativikaṭapadam /
pādataladvayaṃ sampuṭaṃ niṣadyāpi kuryād iti sampuṭapadam /
dakṣiṇacaraṇena vāmapādam ākrāmed iti kūrmapadam /
ekapādam utkṣipyaikena bhramed ity ekapadam /
saptaitāni padāni sthānāniyamena kuryāt bhramarījālaṃ ca / śarīrasya samantataḥ savyāvasavyābhyāṃ bhramaṇād bhramarījālam /
eteṣv ālīḍhādiṣu trayodaśasu kriyamāṇeṣu yathāyogaṃ sāgarāndolaḥ parvatotkṣepo lalitākṣepaḥ krodhākṣepa iti caturaḥ pādanyāsān navākṣepān ṣaḍvajrotkarṣādīni trayodaśakhaḍgādyabhinayān kuryāt /


	7.6 (p.96)

tadanv ālīḍhena nṛtyaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇābhimukho vāmatarjanīṃ hṛdi vāmapārśvena bhūmau patitvā 'kāśaṃ nirīkṣayan savajradakṣiṇakareṇa sarvān mārān ākṣipet / 1 /
kamalāvartapūrvakaṃ nṛtyaṃ kṛtvā vajram utthāpya vāmatarjanyā tarjayan dakṣiṇahastena savajradaṇḍamudrām utkṣipya samapadasthaḥ salīlaṃ vajrapadenākuñcitaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ nikṣipet sārdhatāladvayaṃ vāmaṃ sthiraṃ kṛtvā pādau ca pakṣasthitau tato jānudakṣiṇam ākuñcya daṇḍamudrāṃ samutkṣipet / vāmatarjanyā tarjayan vāmodaram avanāmayet / vāmalocanaṃ nimīlya vadanaṃ bhrāmayen maṇḍale dṛṣtiṃ vinyasya bhṛkuṭiṃ kuryād ity ākampanākṣepaḥ / dakṣiṇakaṭibhāge saṃhāraḥ / 2 /
tathaiva vajram utthāpya samapadasthaḥ samapādaṃ sārdhatāladvayaṃ prasārya sthāpayet tryasrau ca pādau kuryāt agrataḥ karāghātaṃ kṛtvā daṇḍamudrām utkṣipya vīkṣet tarjanīṃ vāmastane nidhāyeti trāsanākṣepaḥ / vāmakaṭideśe saṃhāraḥ / 3 / 
tathaiva vajrotthānamudrāṃ kṛtvā samapadasthito daṇḍamudrām utkṣipya dakṣiṇākṣi nimīlya vāmacakṣuṣā stane tarjanīṃ paśyet vāmavajrapadaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇajānv ākuñcya pādam utkṣipya saroṣaḥ sahasā vāmena bhramec cakravat punas taṃ pādam ākuñcyārdhapratyālīḍhena sthāpayet sthiraṃ  pādau pakṣasthitau kṛtveti saṃkṣobhaṇākṣepaḥ / vajranṛtyaprayogeṇa dakṣiṇakaṭibhāge saṃhāraḥ / 4 / 
tathā vajrotthānaṃ kṛtvā samapadastho daṇḍamudrām utkṣipya tarjanīṃ stane vāmanetreṇa paśyed vāmajānv ākuñcya dakṣiṇaṃ vajrapadaṃ kṛtvā vāmam utkṣipya sahasaiva dakṣiṇena bhramet tataḥ sthāpayet pātitapādam ākuñcitaṃ sthitaṃ tryasraṃ ca kṛtvā dakṣiṇaṃ pakṣasthitaṃ kṛtvālīḍhena sthāpayed iti vimohanākṣepaḥ / nṛtyan vāmakaṭideśe saṃhāraḥ / 5 /
ayam eva vāmapādena parivartya punar agrataḥ karāghātaṃ kṛtvā daṇḍaṃ punar utkṣiped iti viśeṣeṇa kṣiprākṣepaḥ / 6 /
vimohanākṣepa eva vyāvṛtāsyākṣepaḥ / kin tu mukhaṃ prasārya ghaṇṭālālanākāreṇa jihvām avasthāpya cakravad bhramet / 7 /
tathaiva vajram utthāpya tālamātrāntaritaṃ pādadvayaṃ kṛtvā tryasraṃ kuryāt /dakṣiṇaṃ jānu kiñcid ākuñcayed vāmajānu nāmayet stanavāmodarabhāgaṃ ca nāmayet stane tarjanīṃ dordaṇḍavikṣepād anantaraṃ daṇḍe dṛṣṭinipātād bhramitānanaḥ kelīkilo nāmākṣepaḥ / dakṣiṇakaṭibhāge saṃhāraḥ / 8 /
sa eva mahākelīkilo yadā dṛṣṭir daṇḍe sthitā dakṣiṇaskandhadeśena svapṛṣṭe nīyate nimīlitavāmacakṣuḥ kruddhaḥ pādavikṣepaṃ kurvāṇaḥ / saṃhāraḥ pūrvavat / 9 /


	7.7 (p.98)
vāmaṃ garvaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇena hṛdi vajram utkarṣayed iti vajrotkarṣaḥ / 1 /
vāmavajramuṣṭyutthitatarjanyā hṛdi tarjanena dakṣiṇavajramuṣṭigṛhītavajraprahārābhinayād vajrākṣepaḥ / 2 / catasṛbhir aṅgulībhiḥ saṃkucitāgrābhir aṅguṣṭhapīḍanād vajramuṣṭiḥ / 
vaktrād ūrdhvādhaḥ karau prasārya vivṛtāsyanāsikāpuṭakapolanetrāṇi bhayāvahāni kuryād iti vajrabhairavaḥ / 3 /
dakṣiṇakareṇa vajraṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ paribhrāmya krameṇa bhūmau caraṇadvayaṃ nikṣepād vajrakuṇḍaliḥ / 4 /
vāmabhujaṃ prasārya tatkaramūle savajradakṣiṇakaramūlaṃ dhārayan nṛtyed iti vajranartanam / 5 /
vajranṛtyapūrvakaṃ garvādvayena vāmāvanataṃ śiraḥ kuryād iti strīmāyākaraṇaṃ / 6 /


	7.8 (p. 100)
garvādvayaṃ vajralāsyāmudrā / vāmavajramuṣṭikoṣād dakṣiṇavajramuṣṭim ākṛṣya 
khaḍgābhinayena dhārayed iti khaḍgābhinayaḥ / 1 /
hṛdi tarjayan dakṣiṇatriśūkavajrākṣepād vajrābhinayaḥ / 2 /
vajrabandhagṛhītamuṣalena vighnakuṭṭanāt muṣalābhinayaḥ / 3 /
sampuṭāñjalim ābadhyānyonyāṅgulyagrayojanād vajrāñjalis tathā mūle vajrabandhaḥ subandhanāt / hṛdi vajramuṣṭidvayasya kaniṣṭhike tarjanyau ca vajrabandhīkṛtya cakravat muñced iti cakrābhinayaḥ / 4 /
dakṣiṇavajramuṣṭitarjanīmadhyame salīlaṃ prasāryordhvaṃ dhārayet patākābhinayaḥ / 5 /
sampuṭāñjaliṃ padmavad vikāśayet padmābhinayaḥ / 6 /
dakṣiṇamuṣṭim aṅguṣṭhagarbhāṃ kṛtvā tarjanīṃ prasārya bāhum ūrdhvam uddaṇḍayed iti daṇḍābhinayaḥ / 7 /
dakṣiṇatarjanīm ākarṣābhinayena dhārayed ity aṅkuśābhinayaḥ / 8 /
dakṣiṇakarāṅgulīḥ prasāryākuñcayed iti phaṇābhinayaḥ / 9 /
vāmahastena dhanur ādāya dakṣiṇenākarṇāntaṃ guṇam ākṛṣya vāyudhāraṇaṃ kuryād iti cāpābhinayaḥ / 10 /
dakṣiṇatarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ śarākarṣaṇaṃ kuryād iti śarākarṣaṇābhinayaḥ / 11 /
tābhyām eva śarotkṣepaṇābhinayāt śarotkṣepaṇābhinayaḥ / 12 /
stutikaraṇābhinayena sampuṭāñjaliṃ hṛdi dhārayed iti praṇāmābhinayaḥ / 13 /


	7.9 (p. 102)
tad anu praṇāmābhinayaṃ kamalāvartaṃ ca kṛtvā vajrollālanaghaṇṭāvādanair vajrapadena nṛtyan maṇḍalabhūmimadhye praviśya niṣadyāsanāni daśābhinayān hūṃkārodgārapūrvakaṃ spharitānantakrodhair vighnān utsārayann ārasātalaṃ maṇḍalabhuvaṃ vajramayīṃ bhāvayet /
tatra vajraparyaṅkabhūsparśamudrābandhanād vajrāsanābhinayaḥ / 1 /
samādhimudrābandhanād dhyānābhinayaḥ / 2 /
dakṣiṇajaṃghorumadhye vāmaṃ pādaṃ nyasya tadupari vāmajaṃghorumadhye dakṣiṇaṃ nyased iti vajraparyaṅkaḥ / 3 /
dakṣiṇajaṃghāyāṃ vāmajaṃghāṃ kṛtvāvanataṃ jānudvayaṃ kuryād 
iti padmāsanam.
vāmorūpari dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ vinyasya vāmaṃ dakṣiṇorutale sthāpayet sattvaparyaṅkaḥ / 5 /
vāmacaraṇenārdhaparyaṅkam ābadhya tatsamīpe dakṣiṇajānūrdhvaṃ praguṇaṃ sthāpayed iti vīrāsanam / 6 / vāmārdhaparyaṅkaṃ kṛtvā tadupari dakṣiṇajānupatitaṃ saṃsthāpya dakṣiṇapādaṃ vāmorumūle uttānaṃ sthāpayed iti vīrāsanam iti kecit /
ṛju caraṇadvayam uccāsanastho dhārayed iti bhadrāsanam / 7 /
vitastyantaritaṃ pādadvayam āsane nyasyotkuṭukas tiṣṭhed ity utkuṭukāsanam / 8 /
dakṣiṇapādaṃ sattvaparyaṅkeṇa saṃsthāpya vāmaṃ salīlaṃ prasārayed iti salīlāsanam / 9 /
pādadvayaṃ sampuṭīkṛtyopaviśanaṃ svastikam / 10 /


	7.10 (p.104)
eṣu vajrapadādiṣu yathāyogaṃ vajradṛṣṭibhyāṃ purato vīkṣaṇam abhimukhaṃ pṛṣṭataḥ parāṅmukham iti vīkṣaṇadvayaṃ śṛṅgāravīrabībhatsaraudrahāsyabhayānakakaruṇādbhūtaśāntarasāṃś ca āmnāyamañjarīvivṛtān anutiṣṭhet / vajrapadādīṃś ca vīkṣaṇaparyantān ākṣepān māyājālaparamādyakrodhavijayāditantreṣu-uktān atra vivṛtān / 
aparijñānenāśaktyā saṃkṣiptakriyāvāñcchayā 'nicchayā vā vajrapadādīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ katipayānāṃ vā 'nanuṣṭhāne 'pi na prastutakṣatir vighnotsāraṇasya bhramaṇādibhir api siddher ity āmnāyavidaḥ / 


	7.11 (p. 105)
tato maṇḍalabhūmiṃ gandhopaliptāṃ puṣpadhūpādibhiś catuṣkoṇacaturdvāradhūpaghaṭikādibhir nṛttagītādibhiś ca sampūjya hastena saṃspṛśan maṇḍalādhipatimantraṃ sāṣṭaśataṃ śatāksaraṃ ca saptavārān parijapya tatraiva devatācakraṃ sphārayan saṃharaṃś ca śayīteti bhūmiparigrahavidhiḥ /


	8. Vighnakīlanavidhi
	8.1 (p. 106)

tataḥ prātar utthāya jagad vajrabhṛtpadaṃ prāpayituṃ nirvighnaṃ karomīti vicintya jhaṭiti śūnyatānantaraṃ raṃ-jātaravistha-hūṃ-javiśvavajrasthita-hūṃ-kāra-kiraṇajajvaladvajravisarair niḥsaṃdhyekakhaṇḍībhūtavajraprākārapañjaraśarajālavitānam adhaś ca jvaladduḥsahajvālaviśvakuliśamayīṃ bhūmiṃ vibhāvya tatmadhye jhaṭiti vajrasattvarūpātmaparāvṛttyā trailokyavijayāparanāmā vajrahūṃkāro viśvābjasūryasthabhairavakālarātryāv ālīḍhacaraṇadvayenākramya krudhyan kalpāntānalavajjvalan marīcisaṃcayaḥ kavalayann iva nikhilajagadvighnavṛndāni nīlapītaharitamūlasavyetaravyāttavaktratrayo daṃṣṭrotkaṭalalajjihvaḥ pratimukhaṃ sabhrūbhaṃgakuṭilaraktavartulatrinetraḥ ṣaṇmudro lalāṭasthapañcakapālamālāgalāvalambitagaladasraśiraḥśreṇībhūṣaṇaḥ samuṇḍamekhalaskhaladvyāghracarmāmbaro nīlānantavalayitordhvajvalatkapilakuntalas takṣakādināgarājakṛtamaṇḍano vajravajraghaṇṭānvitakarābhyāṃ vajramuṣṭidvayaṃ pṛṣṭhalagnaṃ kaniṣṭhādvayaṃ śṛṅkhalitaṃ tarjanīdvayaṃ prasṛtam iti trailokyavijayamudrayā svābhaprajñāsamāpannaḥ savyakarābhyām aṅkuśapāśau vāmābhyāṃ kapālakhaṭvāṅge dadhāno garja-hūṃ-kāramukharadiṅmukhaḥ svahṛdgata-hūṃ-kārāt prasṛtaraśmibhir daśadigvighnān ākṛṣya hūṃ-kāraspharitadaśakrodheṣu samarpayet /


	8.2 (p.108)
te ca krodhā dairghyeṇāṣṭādaśāṅgulānāṃ dvādaśāṅgulānām aṣṭāṅgulānāṃ vā yathākramaṃ ṣaḍcatuḥsādhikasārdhadvyaṅgulasthūlānāṃ khādirāṇām asthimayānām ayomayānāṃ vā navabhājanasthitānāṃ siddhārtharaktacandanābhyāṃ vilipya pañcaraṅgikasūtrair veṣṭayitvā pūjitānāṃ daśakīlakānām ekaikaṃ raktapuṣpasragbaddhaṃ bhāvayitvā nābher adha ekaśūlākāroparyātmarūpakīlakaṃ kalpāntajvalanam iva vāmavajramuṣṭinā dakṣiṇakareṇa pradhānacihnaparāvṛttamudgaram raktakusumasragbaddhaṃ gṛhītvā dīrghanādoccārita-hūṃ-jadaśakūpeṣu praveśya tān vighnān oṃ vajrakīla kīlaya sarvavighnān hūṃ iti vā / oṃ gha gha ghāṭaya ghāṭaya sarvaduṣṭān phaṭ phaṭ kīlaya sarvapāpān phaṭ phaṭ hūm hūṃ hūṃ vajrakīla vajradharo ājñāpayati sarvavighnānāṃ kāyavākcittaṃ kīlaya hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ iti voccāraṇapūrvakaṃ mastake kīlayantaḥ oṃ vajramudgarā-koṭaya hūṃ iti paṭhanta ākoṭayantīti vicintyaiśānīṃ diśam ārabhya pradakṣiṇaṃ maṇḍalasya bahir vajrāvalīto bahiḥ prabhāvalaye 'ṣṭadikṣu kīlanākoṭane kurvītācāryaḥ prathamam aśaktau tadanu dvārācāryāḥ /
uṣṇīṣasya kīlaṃ pūrvakīlāt pūrve / sumbhasya paścimakīlāt paścime kīlayet /


	8.3 (p. 110)
yadi nāma tattvasaṃgraha-ādiṣu bāhyaprabhāmaṇḍale kīlayed ity uktaṃ tathā 'pi sampratyācāryā maṇḍalagṛhād bahiḥ kīlanaṃ tadupari kṛtamṛtpiṇḍeṣu daśasu puṣpādibhiḥ pratisandhyaṃ kīlarūpakrodhān satkuryāc chattrair balidānaiś ceti vadanti kurvanti ca yasmād evam apy abhimatasiddhiḥ sutarām iti na virodhaḥ /
evaṃ kīlanākoṭanābhyāṃ vighnavṛnḍaṃ mahāsukhena tathataikarasaṃ cintayet / 
śeṣavighnāṃś ca dūrataḥ palāyamānān / tad evam ūrdhvam adhas tiryaṅ mahācakravāḍaparyantaṃ jagat sarvathā nirvighnaṃ dṛḍham adhimuñced ity ekaḥ kramaḥ / 

		8.4 (p. 111)

athavā oṃ āḥ hūṃ yamāntakṛt sarvaduṣṭendropendrān saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ prajñāntakṛt sarvaduṣṭayamān saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ padmāntakṛt sarvaduṣṭanāgān saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ vighnāntakṛt sarvaduṣṭakuverān saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ acala sarvaduṣṭeśānān saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ ṭakki sarvaduṣṭāgnīn saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ nīladaṇḍa sarvaduṣṭanairṛtīn saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ mahābala sarvaduṣṭavāyūn saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ cakravartin sarvaduṣṭārkacandrapitāmahān  saparivārān kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ āḥ hūṃ sumbha sarvaduṣṭavemacitripṛthivīdevatāḥ saparivārāḥ kīlaya hūṃ phaṭ / iti mantraiḥ kīlanākoṭane pūrvādiṣv indrādirūpavighnānāṃ kurvītānyat sarvaṃ pūrvavad iti dvitīyaḥ kramaḥ / 


	8.5 (p.112)
catuḥkoṇeṣv eva kīlacatuṣṭayāropaṇam āhuḥ kecit / dvāreṣv evety anyaḥ / 
krodhānām indrādīnāṃca varṇasaṃsthānādikam āmnāyamañjaryāṃ pratipattavyam / icchāyāṃ tu satyāṃ savistararakṣācakrabhāvanā ca / athavā vināpi khādirādikīlakair yathoktabhāvanayaiva kīlanākoṭane anuṣṭhāyottānahastaṃ vyāvṛtya oṃ vajra hūṃ iti paṭhan bhuvaṃ sthālayaṃs tathādhimuñced iti vighnakīlanavidhiḥ /


	9. Vasundharādhivāsanavidhi
	9.1 (p.113)

tad anu maṇḍalabhūmer madhye niṣadya kṛte gandhamaṇḍale vaṃ-bhavāṃ vasundharāṃ vibhāvya savyakaracandre hūṃ-trayaṃ vicintyāṅgulyagreṇa bhūmes trihananais taddhvanibhiḥ hūṃ-kārakiraṇaiś ca saṃcodanād utthitajñānasattvarūpapṛthivīdevatayā sahaikībhūtāṃ prītyābaddhahṛdayāṃ pītāṃ saumyāṃ sitāmbarāṃ vicitrābharaṇāṃ gṛhītakanakabhadraghaṭābhayavāmetarakaradvayām ekavaktrāṃ purataḥsthitām arghādipuraḥsaraṃ sampūjya sasambhramaṃ
	oṃ ehy ehi mahādevī pṛthivīlokamātare /
	sarvaratnasamāpūrṇe divyālaṅkārabhūṣite // 
	hāranūpuranirghoṣe vajrasattvaprapūjite /
	gṛhītvā idam arghaṃ maṇḍalakarma susādhaya //

hrī hī hī hī haṃ svāhā iti trir uccāryāvāhanasannidhāpanagarbham adhivāsayet / susādhayeti sāmarthyād visānnidhyam uktaṃ /


	9.2 (p.115)
athavā 
	tvaṃ devi sākṣibhūtāsi sarvabuddhāna tāyināṃ/
	caryānayaviśeṣeṣu bhūmipāramitāsu ca //
	yathā mārabalaṃ bhagnaṃ śākyasiṃhena tāyinā/
	tathā mārabalaṃ jitvā maṇḍalaṃ likhāmy aham //
iti trir uccāryādhivāsayet / sā caivaṃ kriyatām ity uktvā tatraiva līneti cintayet /
tato vajrabandhaṃ talīkṛtya tenāvaṣṭabhyatāṃ bhuvaṃ / oṃ vajrībhava hūṃ iti trir abhimantrya vajrabandhanirgatajvalad-hūṃ-kāravisarair ārasātalaṃ vajrīkṛtaṃ vibhāvya oṃ vajra dṛḍha tiṣṭha iti triḥ paṭhann adhitiṣṭhet / tataḥ svāyattā pṛthivī bhaved iti vasundharādhivāsanavidhiḥ /



	10. Kalaśādhivāsanavidhi
	10.1 (p.117)

tato maṇḍalabhūmiṃ sugandhaiḥ sapañcāmṛtais tryakṣaramantritair upaliptāṃ sapuṣpaprakarāṃ ca kārayitvā 'parāhne snātaḥ sugandhāṅgaḥ suraktavastraḥ sragvī surabhitānano hāranūpurakeyūrakarṇābharaṇakaṅkaṇaiḥ mekhalayāṅgulīyādyair alaṅkārair alaṅkṛtaḥ / yathākramaṃ oṃ hūṃ svāhā iti oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa hūṃ phaṭ ity ābhyāṃ saptajaptaraktavastramukuṭālaṅkṛto maṇḍalabhūmer madhye niṣadya pūrvābhimukhaḥ pakṣāntare tu maṇḍalasya pūrve paścimābhimukho niṣadya maṇḍalādhipatiyogavān devatāsthāneṣv amṛtacandanakuṅkumādibhir maṇḍalāni kṛtvā yathāsvaṃ samayacakraṃ vibhāvya tatrākāśasthaṃ jñānamaṇḍalam āvāhya praveśya pūjāstutyamṛtāsvādanāni vidhāya bhāvitamaṇḍalād bahiḥ pūrvādidiśi sthitān pakṣāntare tūttaradiṅmukha aiśānakoṇasthān kalaśān adhivāsayet /


	10.2 (p.118)

tatra śāntipuṣṭyor ghaṭasya garbho vṛttena ṣoḍaśāṅgulo 'dho garbhān mukhoṣṭhāntaṃ yāvad ucchrayo viṃśatyaṅgulo mukhād avadher lambamānāv oṣṭhau dvyaṅgulau grīvā ṣaḍaṅgulā mukham oṣṭhāntād oṣṭhāntam aṣṭāṅgulam aṣṭāṅgulānāṃ bhāgadvayaṃ kaṇṭharandhram ekabhāgenoṣṭhadvayāyāmaḥ /
vidveṣoccāṭanayor garbho vṛttena dvādaśāṅgulaś caturviṃśatyaṅgula ucchrayo 'ṣṭāṅgulā grīvā vakrā ṣaḍaṅgulam āsyam ekāṅgulāv oṣṭhau vaśyākarṣaṇayor yathā śilpinā ghaṭito ghaṭaḥ /
stambhane kharvo vṛttenocchrāyeṇa ca ṣoḍaśāṅgulaś caturaṅgulagrīvaḥ / ṣaḍaṅgulāsyaḥ sthūloṣṭho 'ṅguladvayena /
sarvakarmaṇi śāntyādikarmasūktāḥ kalaśā grāhyā / iti kālacakra-uktes tadaparatantreṣv akālamūlā lamboṣṭhā uccagrīvā mahodarāḥ kalaśā ity uktāv api ṣoḍaśāṅgulatvādikam api pratipattavyaṃ /
iha nāgabuddhipādair uktaṃ /
	sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vātha tāmraṃ mṛnmayam eva vā //
	yathālabdhaṃ ca saṃgṛhya sthāpayet kalaśaṃ vratī //
iti. 


	10.3 (p.121)

ataḥ sauvarṇādikalaśān uktalakṣaṇān śūnyīkṛtya vaṃkāreṇa bhāvitaratnarūpān śāntipuṣṭyarthaṃ taṇḍulaiḥ piṣṭaiḥ kaṭhinyā candanena vā dhavalitān likhitadevatācihnān sapañcāmṛtagandhāmbupañcaratnauṣadhībrīhigarbhān vilasatpallavānanān samālyavastrayugābaddhakaṃdharān vitānatale vakṣyamāṇarajomaṇḍalacihnanyāsakramato maṇḍalākāreṇa pṛthak sugandhamaṇḍalopary anurūpāsanāsīnān purato nyasya
	vastropari nyaset sūtraṃ suśuklaṃ vidhikovida[ḥ //]
iti nāgabuddhipāda-ādeśāt sāmnāyāt hūṃ-saptajaptasaptasitasūtraiḥ / oṃ vajraśikhara rūṭamaṭadiśāṃ bandha bandha hūṃ iti mantreṇa veṣṭayet / śāntyādikarmānurūpavarṇaiḥ pañcabhir iti tantrāntare /


	10.4 (p.122)

pañcaratnāni muktāsuvarṇapadmarāgapravālarājāvartāḥ / padmarāgālābhe rūpyaṃ tāmraṃ vā śaṅkhaṃ vā rājapaṭṭasthāne maṇir vā / kṛśavibhavatve vijayasārvakarmikakalaśau ratnagarbhau kāryau nānye ghaṭāḥ / tatrāpi vijayakumbho 'vaśyaṃ ratnagarbhaḥ kartavyaḥ /
pañcauṣadhyo bṛhatīkaṇṭakārīsitaraktadaṇḍotpalaśvetāparājitāḥ /
pañcabrīhayas tilayavamāṣadhānyagodhūmāḥ / dhānyasthāne mudgaḥ paṭhitaḥ kvacit /
āmranāgakeśarāśokāśvatthodumbarāṇāṃ / pañcānām anyatamasya pallavaḥ / nāgakeśarābhāve nyagrodhasya jambupallavo vā vastraṃ raktaṃ pītaṃ śvetaṃ vā /  haritaṃ nīlaṃ coktaṃ kvacit /


	10.5 (p.124)

vijayakalaśe dharmodayamadhyābjasthe yathāyogaṃ candre sūrye vādhipateś cihnaṃ bījaṃ vā / aparaghaṭeṣu padmasthe candre sūrye vā yathāsvaṃ cihnāni bījāni vā devatānāṃ /
yad āhur nāgabuddhipādaiḥ.
	sarveṣāṃ māṇḍaleyānāṃ bījaṃ cihnam athāpi vā //
	ghaṭapārśve likhed vidvān //
iti yatra maṇḍale yāvat yo devatās tāvantas tāsāṃ kalaśāḥ / atha vā garbhapuṭadevatānām eva / tatra kulamātṛīṇāṃ catvāraḥ / tathāgatānāṃ pañca / athavā tathāgatānām eva pañca / athavā 'dhipater ekaś catustathāgatānām ekaś catuḥkulamātṛīṇām ekaḥ / rūpavajrādiṣaṇṇām ekaḥ / krodhacatuṣṭayasyaika iti pañca / athavā nāyakasyaivaikaḥ /
eṣu pakṣeṣv adhikaḥ sārvakarmikaḥ kalaśaḥ kartavyaḥ / śiṣyādiprokṣaṇārthaṃ / kaiścid ayaṃ neṣyate / dvitīyasyāpi ghaṭasyābhāve vijayaghaṭe nāyakacihnaṃ / tasya vāme sārvakarmikacihnaṃ likhitavyam iti pakṣāntaraṃ / taccihnaṃ vighnāntakasya /
vairocanādīnām api catvāri cihnāni caturdikṣu  lekhyānīti pakṣe nāyakacihnaṃ vairocanacihnopari tatrastham eva mukhoparīti kvacid uktaṃ / locanādīnām api caturvidikṣv iti pakṣāntaram / 
athavā 
	pañcabuddhacaturdevīcatuḥkrodhaghaṭāḥ pṛthak/
	kuṇḍaler eka ekaḥ ṣaḍrūpavajrādicihnabhṛt //
iti pañcadaśeti/ 
uktapakṣebhyaḥ pakṣāntaram kenacid uktam asaṅgataṃ / evaṃ mañjuvajramaṇḍale viṃśatir daśa ṣaḍ dvāv ekaḥ pañcadaśeti kalaśasaṃkhyāvyavasthā /


	10.6 (p. 127)
piṇḍīkramamaṇḍale tu dvitīyapañcapakṣe tathāgatānām eko mātṛīṇām ekaś catūrūpavajrādīnām eko 'ṣṭabodhisattvānām eko daśakrodhānām eka iti viśeṣaḥ /
	svadikputradvayasyaikaḥ ṣaṭkrudhāṃ yoṣitām api /
	pṛthag garbhasthavighnāridvāḥkrudhām iti viṃśatiḥ // 
iti ceti kecit /
sampuṭa-uktavajrasattvamaṇḍale dvitīyapañcapakṣe garbhapuṭasthānām eko dvitīyapuṭasthānām eko digaṣṭadevīnām ekaḥ koṇāṣṭadevīnām eko dvārapālīnām eka iti viśeṣaḥ / tathāgatakulamātṛdvārapālīnāṃ pṛthak kalaśāḥ / dvitīyapuṭe digdevīnām eko vidigdevīnām ekaḥ / tṛtīyapuṭe dikṣu vāmasthānām eko dakṣiṇasthānām ekaḥ / koṇasthānām ekas tadbahiḥ koṇasthānām ekaḥ sārvakarmika eka iti viṃśatir iti ceti kaścit /
saṃvaramaṇḍale pañcacakrānāṃ pratyekam eka iti pañca / athavā garbhapuṭasthānām eva pañca / athavaiṣāṃ pañca catuścakrāṇāṃ catvāra iti nava / athavā garbhapuṭasamayacakrasthānāṃ trayodaśa cittacakre diksthānām eko vidiksthānām eka evaṃ vākcakre kāyacakre cety ūnaviṃśatiḥ / eṣu pakṣeṣu pratidaivataṃ nyāse 'py adhikaḥ sārvakarmikaḥ khaṇḍarohāyāḥ sthāpyaḥ /
etadanusārāt maṇḍalāntareṣv api yathāyogaṃ kalaśasaṃkhyā veditavyā /


	10.7 (p.129)

tatra prādhānyāt kṛtyabāhulyāc ca vijayakalaśasyopari oṃ vajrāmṛtodaka ṭhaḥ hūṃ ity anena tryakṣareṇa ca saptajaptajñānāmṛtīkṛtavajraparamāṇumayayathāptapañcāmṛtasugandhajalayuktaṃ hūṃ-mantritaṃ śaṅkhaṃ padmabhājanaṃ vā puṣpasragbaddhavajraṃ ca sthāpayitvā madhye oṃ tapte mahātapte svāhā ity ākṛṣṭamandākinījalarūpajale sāsanaṃ devatācakraṃ jhaṭiti vicintya svahṛdbījamayūkhair jñānamaṇḍalam ānīya purataḥ pādyam ācamanam arghaṃ ca dadyāt tac ca samayacakre praviśya mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya bodhicittarūpaṃ prāgbhṛtāmbhasaikarasībhūtaṃ cintayet / 
cihne ca samayadevatāṃ jñānadevatayaikībhūtāṃ / 
tato vajrāsaktapuṣpamālāntaṃ vāmamuṣṭyā hūṃ-mantreṇa gṛhītvā sāṣṭaśataṃ cakreśahṛdayamantreṇa oṃ vajrodaka hūṃ ity anena vā jalam abhimantrya tatra kuṇḍalimantritasitapuṣpatrayaṃ nikṣipet / aparaś ca kalaśo yo yasyā devatāyā sa tasyā mantreṇa sāṣṭaśatam ekaviṃśativārān vā saptaśo vā mantrayitavya uparivajrasya puṣpamālāntaṃ tathā gṛhītvā tathā puṣpaṃ ca nikṣepyaṃ /
tadanu vijayādighaṭān puṣpādibhiḥ sampūjya sārvakarmikavāriṇā tatpallavenaiva rakṣārtham abhyukṣyātra yāvan maṇḍalakāryāṇāṃ samāptis tāvad vighnān nivārayiṣyathety uktvā baliṃ ca dattvopaspṛśyākṣobhyavajretyādistutipuraḥsaraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayet / tebhyaḥ kalaśebhyaḥ stokastokam udakam ānīya maṇḍalagṛhaprāgdvārottarapārśve yantrikāvasthitaśaṅkhādau sthāpayed ātmanaḥ śiṣyānāṃ ca prokṣaṇārthaṃ sārvakarmikakalaśam eva kuśaviṭṭikayānvitaṃ tatra tadarthaṃ sthāpayed ity anyaḥ / abhimantraṇapūjādikaṃ kalaśānāṃ pratidinaṃ trisaṃdhyam ekasaṃdhyaṃ vā kuryāt / 


	10.8 (p. 132)

cakreśādimantrās tu sādhanādiṣu jñātavyāḥ / saṃkṣiptāḥ punar niṣpannayogāvalyāṃ bahupracāratvāt tu kecit kathyante tatra mañjuvajrasya maṇḍale / oṃ āḥ maṃ hūṃ cakreśasyākṣobhyeṇa sahābhinnasya / oṃ āḥ jinajik hūṃ vairocanasya / oṃ āḥ ratnadhṛk hūṃ ratnasambhavasya / oṃ āḥ ārolik hūṃ amitābhasya / oṃ āḥ prajñādhṛk hūṃ amoghasiddheḥ / oṃ āḥ moharati hūṃ locanāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ dveṣarati hūṃ māmakyāḥ / oṃ āḥ rāgarati hūṃ pāṇḍarāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ vajrarati hūṃ tārāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ rūpavajre jaḥ hūṃ rūpavajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ śabdavajre hūṃ hūṃ śabdavajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ gandhavajre vaṃ hūṃ gandhavajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ rasavajre hoḥ hūṃ rasavajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ sparśavajre khaṃ hūṃ sparśavajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ dharmadhātuvajre raṃ hūṃ dharmadhātuvajrāyāḥ / oṃ āḥ yamāntakṛt hūṃ yamāreḥ / oṃ āḥ  prajñāntakṛt hūṃ prajñāntakasya / oṃ āḥ padmāntakṛt hūṃ padmāntakasya / oṃ āḥ vighnāntakṛt hūṃ amṛtakuṇḍaleḥ / yadā mañjuvajreṇābhinno 'kṣobhyaś cakreśas tadāsya / oṃ āḥ vajradhṛk hūṃ /


	10.9 (p.134)

piṇḍīkramamaṇḍale tu akṣobhyādīnāṃ pūrvoktā eva mantrāḥ / maitreyādīnāṃ tu oṃ āḥ maitreya maiṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ kṣitigarbha dhlīṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ vajrapāṇe oṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ khagarbha oṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ lokeśvara oṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ mañjughoṣa hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ sarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhin oṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ samantabhadra saṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ acala hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ ṭakki hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ nīladaṇḍa hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ mahābala hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ uṣṇīṣa hūṃ hūṃ / oṃ āḥ sumbha hūṃ hūṃ / yadākṣobhyeṇābhinno vajrasattvaś cakreśas tadāsya / oṃ āḥ hūṃ hūṃ iti mantraḥ / 


	10.10 (p.135)

sampuṭa-uktavajrasattvamaṇḍale tu / oṃ vajrāmṛta mahāsukha hūṃ svāhā iti hṛdayaṃ vajrasattvasya cakreśasya / oṃ āḥ vajraghaṇṭe hoḥ haṃ svāhā iti vajraghaṇṭāyā mantraḥ sārvakarmikaḥ / apare tu mantrās tantra evaikatroktāḥ /
saṃvaramaṇḍale cakreśasya oṃ śrīvajra he he ru ru kaṃ hūṃ hūṃ  phaṭ ḍākinījālasaṃvaraṃ svāhā iti hṛdayaṃ / oṃ khaṇḍarohe hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ iti khaṇḍarohāyā mantraḥ sārvakarmikaḥ / aparamāṇḍaleyānāṃ mantrāḥ / saṃvarābhisamaye 'smābhiḥ sāmnāyaṃ likhitāḥ / 
hevajramaṇḍale cakreśasya / oṃ devapicuvajra hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā iti hṛdayaṃ / oṃ oṃ svāhā iti oṃ āḥ vajraghasmari oṃ hūṃ svāhā iti vā ghasmaryā mantraḥ sārvakarmikaḥ / aparamantrāḥ sampuṭe piṇḍitāḥ /
tattvasaṃgraha-uktavajradhātumaṇḍale cakreśasya oṃ sarvatathāgata mahāyogīśvara hūṃ iti hṛdayaṃ / vajrayakṣasya tu / oṃ vajrayakṣa hūṃ iti mantraḥ sārvakarmikaḥ / anye tu tattvasaṃgrahatantre samuccitāḥ /


	10.11(p.136)

iha maṇḍalādikarmasūpayogāya prathamaṃ śubhrādirajasā likhitāṣṭadalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ vijayakalaśaṃ sārvakarmikakalaśaṃ vā sthāpayet / pūrvapatre vakṣyamāṇavidhinādhivāsitaṃ pañcaraṅgikasūtraṃ pātrasthaṃ dakṣiṇe vajram uttare vajraghaṇṭāṃ paścime koṇadaleṣu ca yathāyogaṃ pañca rajobhājanāni / tasya kalaśasya jalena kuṇḍalimantraṃ oṃ a ā aṃ aḥ iti vā paṭhan rajaḥ sūtraṃ ca prokṣayed iti kalaśādhivāsanavidhiḥ /


	11. Devatādhivāsanavidhi (p.137)

tato maṇḍalabhūmiṃ sugandhādiliptāṃ sapuṣpaprakarāṃ kārayitvā tatra yathāsambhavaṃ pañcādhipatīnāṃ koṣṭheṣu caturasraṃ maṇḍalam anyadevatānāṃ vartulaṃ sapañcāmṛtasugandhaiḥ kṛtvā paścimāsyas teṣu maṇḍaleṣu svahṛdbījamayūkhākṛṣṭaṃ cakreśādidevatāmaṇḍalaṃ yathāyogam abjastheṣu candreṣu sūryeṣu vopaveśya pādyādipuraḥsaraṃ sampūjya stutvāmṛtam āsvādya dakṣiṇaṃ jānuṃ bhūmau nipātya hūṃ-jaikaśūkavajrajihvāyāṃ hūṃ nyasya sadhūpakaṭacchusavyakaro vāmena vajraghaṇṭāṃ vādayan /

	bhagavann amuka sadvajra vidyārāja namo stu te //
	icchāmi likhituṃ nātha maṇḍalaṃ karuṇātmaka //
	śiṣyāṇām anukampārthaṃ yuṣmākaṃ pūjanāya ca //
	tan me bhaktasya bhagavan prasādaṃ kartum arhasi //
	samanvāharantu māṃ buddhā jagaccakrakriyārthadāḥ /
	phalasthā bodhisattvāś ca yāś cānyā mantradevatāḥ //
	devatā lokapālāś ca bhūtāḥ sambodhiśāsitāḥ /
	śāsanābhiratāḥ sattvā ye kecid vajracakṣuṣaḥ //
	amuko 'haṃ mahāvajrī amukodayamaṇḍalaṃ /
	likhiṣyāmi jagacchuddhyai yathāśaktyupacārataḥ //
	anukampām upādāya saśiṣyasya tu tan mama /
	maṇḍale sahitāḥ sarve sāṃnidhyaṃ kartum arhatha //
iti vāratrayam arthapratītyā paṭhann abhyarthayet /
jagaccakrakriyārthadā jagato maṇḍalavyāpārair arthadātāraḥ sattvā manuṣyādayaḥ / vajracakṣuṣo divyacakṣuṣaḥ / iti devatādhivāsanavidhiḥ /


	12. Sūtraṇavidhi
	12.1 
	12.1.1 (p.140)

tadanu 
	samayollaṅghanāśaṅkī naivāśiṣyaṃ praveśayed // 

ity ukter dvārācāryakriyāyogyān prāk svayam adattābhiṣekān vakṣyamāṇena saṃvaradvayadānapūrvakādhivāsanavidhinācāryasaṃvaradānapūrvakādhivāsanavidhinā vā niṣadya dvāri pūrvasyāṃ vineyān adhivāsayet / te ca catvāro dvitrā asambhave kāryā eko 'py antaśa iṣyate / ebhyo 'nyaḥ pañcama evaṃ kṛtaśiṣyaḥ karmavajrī kartavya ity uktaṃ tantrāntare / abhāve tu nānyaḥ.


	12.1.2 (p.141)

evaṃ śiṣyāṇām adhivāsanāmātraṃ kṛtvā 'dhivāsanārthaṃ niveśitadevatāmaṇḍalaṃ sampūjya jñānasūtrādyarthaṃ maṇḍalabhūmyupary ākāśe buddhyā niveśya pūrvābhimukho vajradharayogavān maṇḍaleśayogavān vā labdhanimitto 'kṣatakanyākartitāni vīrakrayakrītāni vā pañcapañcasūtrāṇi pañcapātrasthāni sitapītaraktaharitakṛṣṇaiḥ sugandhavarṇakaiḥ siddhārthacūrṇapañcāmṛtamiśraiḥ pṛthak pṛthag rañjitāni / vāmakaratale 'ṅgulyagrād ārabhya yāvad aṅguṣṭhamūlaṃ vinyasya / brūṃ-āṃ-hrīḥ-khaṃ-hūṃ-kāraiḥ brūṃ-āṃ-jrīṃ-khaṃ-hūṃ-kārair vā oṃ-svā-āḥ-hā-hūṃ-kārair vā yathātantraṃ vā janitapañcatathāgataniṣpannāni nabhasi niveśitasvasvadiktathāgatasaṅgrahabhūtapañcatathāgatahṛdayeṣu brūṃ-kārādiniṣpannāni jñānasūtrāṇi raśmimayāni dṛṣṭvā / oṃ āḥ śāśvata vajrasūtraṃ me prayaccha mahāmaṇḍalasūtraṇāya hūṃ / ity anena vairocanaṃ prārthayet / nāma parivartya ratnasambhavādīṃś ca / 
jaḥ-kārajapītacandrasūryasvarūpacakṣurdvayaḥ oṃ dīptadṛṣṭyaṅkuśi jaḥ / ity uccārya pradrutapracalaccakṣuḥpakṣmākarṣaṇalocanayā dīptadṛṣṭyā 'ṅkuśeneva tāni vairocanādibhiḥ preṣitāny ākṛṣya hastasthitasūtreṣu svasvavarṇeṣv antarniveśayet / ata eva tāny ādarśādipañcajñānamayāni / ādarśajñānādīnāṃ ca pratyekaṃ caturjñānānugamāt pañcaviṃśatyābheditāni pratyekaṃ bījebhyaḥ pañcatathāgataspharaṇasaṃharaṇāc ca ekaikaṃ jñānaṃ viṃśatidevatāmaṇḍalātmakam iti śatadhābhinnānīti kvacid uktaṃ /


	12.1.3 (p.143)

tadanu vairocanarūpeṇāmṛtakuṇḍalyādisarvakṛdrūpeṇa vā śiṣyeṇa sūtradhāriṇā saha prathamaṃ pañcapañcasūtrair ekaikaṃ sūtraṃ valayet / tadanu tathā valitaiḥ pañcabhir ekaṃ sūtraṃ / oṃ āḥ anyonyānugatāḥ sarvadharmāḥ parasparānupraviṣṭāḥ sarvadharmā atyantānupraviṣṭāḥ sarvadharmā oṃ āḥ hūṃ / ity uccārayan valitasya sūtrasyācāryaśiṣyavāmahastayos tarjanīm ārabhya caturaṅgulīnāṃ madhye praveśya pṛṣṭhena nītvā punaḥ praveśya nītvā tayoḥ kṛtavajramuṣṭyor eva tarjanīpṛṣṭhena bhūmāv āsañjya yantritaparyantam adhikaṃ tyaktvā yathā maṇḍaladviguṇaṃ dairghyaṃ bhavati yavaviṃśatitamāṃśādhikam ācāryayavapramāṇaṃ ca sthaulyaṃ saptayavair aṅgulīparvety abhidharma-ukteḥ / cakrāṣṭamabhāgadvāraviṃśatibhāgikasthaulyoktiś caturviṃśatyaṅgulātmakaikahastamaṇḍalasyaiveti dvihastādimaṇḍaleṣv api tayopalakṣitaṃ mānaṃ veditavyaṃ / pārimaṇḍalyena ṣaḍḍhastamaṇḍale kanīyasīpramāṇaṃ sūtraṃ kāryam anyatrānurūpata ity ānandagarbha-ādayaḥ /
valanānantaraṃ pūrvabhūmau gandhodakapañcāmṛtapañcagavyastemitam antargatatryakṣaraṃ gandhopalipte suvarṇādiśucibhājane nidhāya gandhapuṣpadhūpaiś cābhyarcya hastenāvaṣṭabhya kuṇḍalijāpena saṃrakṣya savyetaracakṣuṣor ma-ṭa-kārābhyāṃ ravīndū vīkṣya pūrvavad vajradṛṣṭi maṭ / iti sthirīkṛtya sarvakṛjjaptāmṛtāmbusarṣapagandhodakasiktaṃ savajrasavyakaraspṛṣṭaṃ / oṃ vajrasamaya sūtraṃ mātikrama hūṃ / ity anena japtvā tryakṣareṇāṣṭottaraśatajaptam adhivāsayet / 

