	12.3.1 (p.170) % supplementary remarks

caturmūlasūtraparicchinnamūlamaṇḍalād eva dviguṇadairghyasūtraṃ tena brahmasūtraṃ catuḥṣaṣṭhimātrikaṃ pātayet / tathā coktaṃ /
	brahmasūtrasya aṣṭabhis tu mahābhāgair ekaikaṃ pārśvam aṅkayet / 
