	ekaikabrahmapārśve tu dvātriṃśatkṛśakās tataḥ /
	dvāramāno mahābhāgaṃ turyaḥ kṛśo 'ṣṭamaḥ śiva[ḥ //]
iti / anyatra coktaṃ
	caturasre kṛte śuddhe maṇḍaladviguṇādhike //
	śvetasūtraṃ tataḥ kṛtvā sottaraḥ sādhakaḥ svayaṃ //
	śvetacandanasaṃmiśraśālipiṣṭena temayet /
	yat pramāṇaṃ bhavec cakraṃ dviguṇaṃ tat tu pātayet // 
	brahmasūtradvayaṃ śuddhaṃ tadardhe mūlasūtrakam //
iti /


	12.3.2 (p.171)

brahmāgrāt param abjakeśarābjadalakuliśakiraṇamālāvṛttasūtrāṇi / yad uktaṃ
	dvāraṣoḍaśakāyāmaṃ cakravāḍasya cāntaram //
iti / tatra keśararekhātaḥ prabhṛti cakravāḍam abhimataṃ /
tat kathaṃ / keśaradaladharmodayā hi na vajrāvalīpratibaddhāḥ / vajravalayarūpaṃ hi vajraprākāraṃ cakravāḍam ucyate / tathā coktam āryanāgabuddhipādaiḥ /
	toraṇaṃ vajraśikharaṃ tadbāhyaṃ cakravāḍakaṃ /
	vajramālāsuraśmyādyam // 
iti / atra hi vajramālaiva cakravāḍaṃ suraśmyādyam iti vyaktam uktaṃ /
atha valayasāmyāt keśarādikam api cakravāḍam iva cakravāḍam upacaryate /
upacāraś ca sammata evaiṣām iti gamyate tadbāhyam iti vacanāt / yady evaṃ tarhi sādhūktaṃ /


	12.3.3 (p.172)

ata eva vacanāt keśarādikaṃ nāstīti kaścit / na saṅgataṃ viśvavajrasya padmasthatve / padmena dharmodayayā ca vināpi kvacit tad astīty uktam iti cet / iha tarhi sābjadalam eva tad ity upacāraḥ sādhuḥ / piṇḍīkrame 'pi /
	śūnyaṃ dhyātvā sthirabalātmakaṃ /
	anena vidhiyogena jñānabhūmir adhiṣṭhyate // 
	ākāśadhātumadhyasthaṃ bhāvayed vāyumaṇḍalam //
ityādi yāvac
	caturmaṇḍalasaṃhāravajrabhūbhāgamaṇḍale /
	tatra bhrūṃ-kāraniṣpannaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ vibhāvayed // 
ity atra jñānabhūmir ākāśadhātuś ca dharmodayā tasya madhyaṃ padmaṃ tatsthaṃ vāyutejastoyapṛthvīmaṇḍalacatuṣṭayena miśritena bhūbhāgaṃ viśvavajrarūpaṃ niṣpādya tadupari candramaṇḍale bhrūṃ-kāreṇa kūṭāgāram iti arthaḥ / ataḥ padmena vinā viśvavajram iheti mahatī bhrāntiḥ /
 

	12.3.4 (p.174)

viśvavajranābhis tu dvādaśadvāramānā tadārās tu pratyekaṃ dvāradvayāyāmāḥ / tatra mūlasūtrasyābhyantaram aṣṭadvāramānaṃ bāhyaṃ tu dvāradvayāyāmaṃ / tatrāntarālapaṭṭī nāsty eva / toraṇastambhāntaṃ toraṇaṃ tiryak triguṇaṃ dvārāt /
tatstambhopari toraṇam ekadvāramānam ūrdhvenaikādaśapaṭṭikaṃ / tatra yathākramaṃ bakūlīratnāśvakharusvarṇamakarasvarṇakharuratnakhurasvarṇakramaśīrṣāṇām aṣṭamāṣṭamadvādaśacaturviṃśāṣṭamacaturviṃśadvādaśāṣṭamadvādaśacaturviṃśāṣṭamadvārāṃ śikhāḥ paṭṭikāḥ / uktaṃ ca /
	bakūlī ratnā sthānā svarṇā makarā 'tha kāñcanā sthānā //
	ratnā saṃsthānā ca svarṇā kramaśīrṣakā ca tataḥ //
	dvāradvādaśabhāgāḥ syuḥ sthānāḥ suvarṇaparyāyāḥ //
	dvāracaturviṃśāṃśāḥ śeṣā dvārāṣṭamāṃ śikhāḥ paṭṭya[ḥ //]
iti /
āsāṃ tiryaṅmānam ucyate / brahmaṇo dakṣiṇe vāme ca sārdhacaturmātrāntareṇa prathamā paṭṭī sārdhadvimātrikā / tadupari sūtraṃ cādyaṃ sārdhatrimātrikaṃ / pañcamātrāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ ca trimātrikaṃ / caturmātrāntareṇa caturthaṃ trimātrikaṃ / sārdhatrimātrāntareṇa pañcamaṃ sārdhatrimātrikaṃ trimātrāntareṇa ṣaṣṭhaṃ pañcamātrikaṃ / saptamāditrīṇy aṣṭamātrikāṇi / daśamaṃ saptamātrikaṃ / ekādaśaṃ ṣaṇmātrikaṃ /
paṭṭīnāṃ pratyekaṃ bahiranta ūrdhvaṃ sūtram ekaṃ / yathāsambhavam abhyantrānte ca / ādyasūtrasya tv ardhamātrāṃ tyaktvotthitaṃ / etat tu sūtraṃ sūtrāntarasambaddhaṃ sadekaṃ vakraṃ dṛśyate / yathāśobhaṃ tu kartavyaṃ / asyābhyantare ratnādilikhanārtham ardhamātraṃ tyaktvā tathaiva vakraṃ sūtram ekaṃ / 
ye tu 
	tatra tiryaṅ mahābhāgaiś caturbhir maṇipaṭṭikā /
	tathaivāśvakhurācchede svalāñchanena maṇḍitāḥ //
	sārdhatrayamahābhāgā bakūlī kāñcanā tathā /
	mahābhāgatrayeṇaiva makarā kramaśīrṣakā //
iti vadanti / tatmate 'ntarālamātrikeṣu bakūlyādīnām abhāve kathaṃ bakūlīpaṭṭīyaṃ ṣoḍaśamātriketyādikaṃ vaktum ucitam iti nirūpyatāṃ.


	12.3.5 (p.177)

toraṇopary ekadvāramānabrahmaṇi dvimātrikaṃ cakraṃ tasyāsanaṃ tu kramaśīrṣapaṭṭikāyāṃ tatpārśvayor mṛgamṛgyau prāgvat / tatpucchaparakramaśīrṣasthe candrakalāratnavajrāgrasārdhadvimātrikaratnadaṇḍe sakamarūkāntadvimātrikapaṭale cchatre śvete kvacid rakte 'valambitacīradvaye /
	tadūrdhvaṃ śivamānena daṇḍaṃ tu paṭalaṃ tathā //
ity anyaḥ / ṣaṇmātraṃ cchatram iti kaścit / antimakramaśīrṣopari dhvajapatākā mātrikā cakrād bahir dvimātrikā viśvavajrārā cakrārāṇām antarāntrareṣu dṛśyamānā /


	12.3.6 (p.178)

tataḥ param āvalīdvayapaṭṭike ekamātrike dvimātrike vā / raśmimālā dvimātrikā /
tathā coktaṃ vajraḍākatantre /
	rajobhūmidviguṇamānaṃ prabhāmaṇḍalakaṃ bahiḥ /
	taccakravāḍabāhye tu vṛkṣādyaṣṭaśmaśānakam //
iti śmaśānāni punaḥ śmaśānavāsidevatānām eva santi nānyāsāṃ / tāsām api rajomaṇḍale na kartavyāny abhavyasamāgame / caturmātrikāpi kiraṇapaṭṭikānyatroktā / kaścit tu saṃvaramaṇḍale /
	vajrapadmārirūpaṃ ca prākāratritayaṃ nyased //
ity anena vajravalayād bahiḥ padmacakravalayāv āha / vṛttasūtraṇārthaṃ tu sūtraṃ vitastyādyadhikaṃ kartavyaṃ / ekaguṇena vā sūtreṇa vṛttasūtraṇaṃ /
maṇḍaladviguṇadairghyavacanena tu lekhyamaṇḍalaṃ viśvavajratadadhikaraṇapuṣkarāntasamaparyantaṃ mūlamaṇḍalasyābhyantare bāhye ca samānam eveti sūcitaṃ bhagavateti dvitīyaḥ pakṣaḥ / 


	12.3.7 (p.180)

nāgabuddhipādais tu prathamapakṣa eva varṇitaḥ / tair hi niryūhakapolayoḥ samaṃ mānam uktaṃ
	toraṇaṃ triguṇaṃ dvārāt kumbhastambhopari sthitam //
iti ca / tathā sati hi toraṇaṃ dvārāt tiryak triguṇaṃ na syāt caturguṇam syāt / tasmād ūrdhvata eva triguṇatvaṃ teṣām abhimataṃ / 
	dvārārdhā sarvato vedī kapolaḥ pakṣakas tathā //
ity āgamān niryūhārdhena kapola ity apy uktaṃ bhagavatā tiryag dvāratriguṇatoraṇapakṣo 'pīti pakṣadvayam api varṇitam asmābhiḥ /
dvitīyapakṣe garbhamaṇḍalād dviguṇaṃ bahirmaṇḍalam uktaṃ padmakeśaravṛttsūtrād arvāk / prathamapakṣe tu saparikaragarbhamaṇḍalād raśmimālāṃ yāvat / toraṇastambhāt paraṃ padmakeśaravṛttasūtrād arvāk caturdaśamātrikam iti tu pakṣadvaye 'pi na ghaṭata iti pratikṣiptaṃ /


	12.4
	12.4.1 (p.181)% adornment

iha dvāraniryūhasandhau mātrike candrakalāsthitaṃ raktaṃ pītaṃ śyāmaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ vā ratnam upary ardhavajrāṅkaṃ sampūrṇavajrāṅkaṃ vā / tathā ca
	rajobhuvo bahiḥ koṇadvāraniryūhasandhiṣu /
	vajrāṅkaratnacandrais tu samantāt paridīpitam //
ity uktam / anyatrāpi 
	vedībahirabhyantarakoṇe kuśalair yathākramaṃ lekhyāḥ /
	śaśiraviratnāsanayor vajrāṅkitam ekam api ratnam //
iti /
caturasravedīsthitakalaśasthās toraṇastambhāḥ / tathā ca /
	toraṇaṃ triguṇaṃ dvārān makarān makarāsyataḥ //
	udgatās toraṇastambhā vedīkumbhasamudbhavā[ḥ //]
ity uktaṃ / teṣāṃ mūle 'gre ca maṇibandho madhye gajopary udbāhubhūtaḥ siṃhaḥ / toraṇāsārāt tadabhāvapakṣe bakūlīpaṭṭīto lambitaratnapatracchaṭāto lambitā yathāśobhaṃ raktapītādivarṇā vicitrā vā vastrāñcalī ratnadaṇḍacāmarāś ca / kaścit tu / añcalapaṭṭikāyāṃ gajopari siṃho vaktralambitaratnahāraḥ stambhamadhye tu darpaṇa evety āha / ratnapaṭṭyāṃ koṇe trikoṇaṃ caturasraṃ tilakaṃ vartulaṃ cānukrameṇa ratnabandhāś caikaikastambhapārśvataḥ /


	12.4.2 (p.183)

hārapaṭṭikāyāṃ catuḥkanakamekhalā bahir makarānanoṅgīrṇā raktasūtragrathitamuktā hārāḥ / pārśvadvayordhvādho hemabaddhamāṇikyamadhyā hārapārśvayor īṣadūnālambitaratnāvalīdhārā hemabaddhasthūlamaṇisundarāgrā ardhahārā ratnadaṇḍacāmarā ghaṇṭāntaś cāmarāś ca kvacil lambante / kaścit tu ardhahārapārśvayoḥ sumanaḥsragardhahārā lambitā tatpārśve vicitravastrārdhahārā ity āha / sumanaḥsragardhahārā aṃśukahārāś ca koneṣv ity anyāḥ / hārodare padmacandrakalārdhavajrāṅkaravimaṇḍalaṃ kvacit / ratnaṃ ca kvacit / padmasthavajraṃ ca kvacit /


	12.4.3 (p.184)

padmadalārdhasaṃsthāneṣu kramaśīrṣeṣu suvarṇakumbhasthā ratnakumbhasthā vā dikṣv aṣṭau dhvajapatākāś candrakalāratnavajrānvitaśikhararatnadaṇḍanibaddhā ghaṇṭāsulālibaddhās trijihvāgrā mṛgarājarājahaṃsoragabhukpṛthuromamakarāṅkā / anilāndolanatribhaṅgalolābhinayā raśatkiṅkiṇīmukharāḥ sacāmarāḥ patākā api tathā paraṃ mṛgādicihnaśūnyāḥ / caturṣu koṇeṣu kramaśīrṣopari cchatrāṇi catvāri/ toraṇe vicitraṃ vitānaṃ hārārdhahāraś ca / khuravaraṇḍaprānteṣu dhvajāḥ patākāś ca yathaśobhaṃ siṃhaśārdūlahaṃsamayūrakinnarakinnaryo 'pi toraṇapārśveṣu nātidūre bhadraghaṭodgīrṇāḥ kalpapādapā hastyādisaptaratnānvitā meghaniṣkrāntamūrtayo gṛhītapuṣpasrajaḥ siddhāḥ kvacit kvacit/ 
evam ayaṃ mūlamaṇḍalād bahiḥ sūtraṇalikhanakramaḥ sarvamaṇḍalasādhāraṇaḥ /


	12.5 
	12.5.1. Mañjuvajramaṇḍala (p.186)
	12.5.1.1

abhyantare tu viśeṣa ucyate / mūlasūtrasyābhyantare devatāpaṭṭikātmakaṃ dvāramitāntaraṃ tyaktvā tiryak sūtram ekaṃ koṇasūtradvayaṃ yāvat / tadabhyantare rūpavajrādinyāsārthaṃ dvāramānaṃ tyaktvā brahmanābhisthasūtraṃ brahmaṇi aiśānasūtre vā dhṛtvā garbhamaṇḍalasīmāvṛttaṃ sūtraṃ prathamaṃ / tadabhyantare vajrāvalīmātrikāntareṇa tathā vṛttasūtraṃ dvitīyaṃ tasmād aparadigvṛttasūtraṃ yāvad brahmaṇo dakṣiṇe pārśve sūtradvayaṃ prathamaṃ mātrādvayāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ / stambhanāyakacihnamātrikāntareṇa / evaṃ vāme / atra prācyāṃ diśi stambhasūtraṃ dakṣiṇastha udaṅmukhaḥ sūtrayet / pratīcyām uttarastho dakṣiṇāsyaḥ / udīcyāṃ paścimasthaḥ pūrvāsyaḥ / avācyāṃ pūrvasthaḥ paścimāsyaḥ /
vajraḍāke tu prathamavṛttasūtrād bahir marīcimālārthaṃ mātrikāntareṇa vṛttasūtram ekam uktaṃ /
tato brahmakoṇasūtralopān navakoṣṭhā bhavanti / aparabrahmasūtrāṇi nāyakasthānapaṭṭyantaḥsūtrāṇi ca proñchyāni koṇasūtrāṇi devatāpaṭṭīsūtrāṇi ca sthāpyāni devatāsthānarajoviśeṣārthaṃ rajaḥpātenaiva cchādayitavyāni /


	12.5.1.2 (p.187)

iha yady evaṃ sūtrapātād anyathā pāte yatnas tadā brahmaṇo bahir dvimātrāntareṇa sūtram ekaṃ tasya bahir ekaikamātrāntareṇa ṣaṣṭhasūtrāṇi saptāpi kūṭāgārakramaśīrṣasūtraṃ yāvat / tatroktasaptā prapātyaiva prapātya prāgvad vartulasūtratrayaṃ kṛtvā pūrvakramasūtrapāte sthāpitasūtrāṇi sthāpayitvānyāni lumped iti dvidhāpīyaṃ mañjuvajramaṇḍale ṭipaṇī / nāyakāntaranyāse 'pīyam / 


	12.5.1.3 (p.188)

anena
	caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitaṃ / 
	catuḥsūtrasamāyuktaṃ sūtrayed bāhyamaṇḍalaṃ //
	tasyābhyantarataś cakram aṣṭamaṇḍalakopamaṃ /
	ardhena bāhyacakrasya samantāt parimaṇḍalaṃ //
	cakrastambhādiracitaṃ vajrāvalyā vṛttaṃ śubham //
iti /
	cakrastambhādisūtrāṇāṃ bhūmis tulyā rajobhuvaḥ //
iti ca vibhaktaṃ / 


	12.5.2 Piṇḍīkramoktamaṇḍala (p.189)

piṇḍīkrama-uktamaṇḍale 'pīyam eva ṭipiḥ / viśeṣaḥ punar dvitīyavṛttasūtrasyābhyantare vajrāvalīmātrikāntareṇa tṛtīyaṃ vṛttasūtraṃ prathamavṛttāntare raśmimālā na tu prathamavṛttasūtrād bahir vṛttasūtram iti / yad āhur nāgabuddhipādāḥ /
	mūlasūtrasya cārdhena garbhacakraṃ pramāṇataḥ //
tatra ca
	brahmaṇo vedimātraṃ syād vedikārdhaṃ dvitīyakaṃ /
	tṛtīyaṃ sārdhavedyā ca vedikārdhena cāparaṃ //
	vajramālojjvalaṃ kuryāt pañcaraśmivibhūṣitaṃ /
	bāhyato garbhacakrasya catuḥsūtraṃ samālikhet //
	aṣṭastambhaṃ likhed garbhavajrāṅkitasuśobhanaṃ /
	navakoṣṭhāni tatraiva vajrastambhāntarāntare //
iti /


	12.5.3 Sampuṭatantroktavajrasattvamaṇḍala (p.190)

śrīsampuṭatantra-ukte vajrasattvamaṇḍale mūlasūtrābhyantare trimātrikāntaraṃ hitvā mātrikārdham antaraṃ vṛttasūtradvayamadhyagacakrāvalyāḥ / tadabhyantare trimātrikāntaraṃ tyaktvā mātrikārdham antaraṃ vṛttasūtradvayamadhyagapadmāvalyāḥ / tadabhyantare trimātrikāntaraṃ parityajya mātrikārdhaṃ antaraṃ raśmimālāyāḥ / tadabhyantare mātrikārdham antaraṃ vṛttasūtradvayāntar vajrāvalyāḥ / atrābhyantaravṛttasūtrād aparadigvṛttasūtraṃ yāvad brahmaṇo dakṣiṇe pārśve sūtradvayaṃ / prathamaṃ sārdhamātrikāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ stambhanāyakacihnamātrikārdhāntareṇa / evaṃ vāme / brahmādilopaḥ pūrvavad iti saviśeṣā ṭipiḥ /


	12.5.4 Jñānaḍākinīmaṇḍala (p.191)

jñānaḍākinīmaṇḍale mūlasūtrābhyantare caturmātrikāntareṇa vṛttaṃ sūtraṃ / tato garbharocir mātrikāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ / tato vajramālā mātrikāntareṇa tṛtīyaṃ tato devī ṣaṇmātrikāntareṇa tiryak sūtram ekaṃ vṛttasūtralagnaṃ / tataḥ stambhanāyikācihnamātrikāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ tatheti viśeṣā ṭippaṇī /


	12.5.5 Hevajramaṇḍala (p.191)

hevajracatuṣṭayasya saptadaśātmakasya maṇḍale mūlasūtrābhyantare brahmakoṇasūtrāṇy eva / nānyat sūtraṃ pātanīyaṃ / brahmasūtrād bahiś catvāri vṛttasūtrāṇi tatrādyaṃ karṇikāyā mātrikāṣṭamāṃśādhikasārdhadvimātrikāntaraṃ tyaktvā dvitīyaṃ dalānāṃ sapādapañcamātrikāntaraṃ hitvā tadbahir mātrikāṣṭamāṃśaṃ hitvā tṛtīyaṃ mātrikāntareṇa vajrāvalayāḥ / caturthaṃ mātrikāntareṇa garbharociṣāṃ /


	12.5.6 Nairātmyāmaṇḍala (p.192)

nairātmyāyās trayoviṃśātmikāyāḥ pañcadaśātmikāyāś ca kurukullāyāś ca maṇḍale 'py evam eva /


	12.5.7 Vajrāmṛtamaṇḍala (p.192)

vajrāmṛtacatuṣṭayasyāpy evaṃ /


	12.5.8 Hevajramaṇḍala (p.192)

navātmakasya hevajracatuṣṭayasya brahmasūtrād bahiḥ karṇikārthaṃ pañcamātrikāntareṇa keśaravṛttasūtram ekaṃ / tadbahir dalārthaṃ daśamātrikāntareṇaikam iti viśeṣaḥ / tadbahir mātrikaṃ kalaśānāṃ vajrāvalī tatreti kaścit /


	12.5.9 Mahāmāyāmaṇḍala (p.193)

bhagavato mahāmāyārūpasya pañcātmakasya maṇḍale 'py evam eva /


	12.5.10 Buddhakapālamaṇḍala (p.193)

navātmakasya bhagavato buddhakapālasya maṇḍale 'pi tathaiva /


	12.5.11 Vajrahūṃkāramaṇḍala (p.193)

vajrahūṃkāramaṇḍale brahmasūtrāt sārddhadvimātrikāntareṇa keśarasūtraṃ vṛttaṃ / tadbahir dalārthaṃ pañcamātrikāntareṇa vṛttasūtraṃ / tato mātrikāntareṇa digvidikṣv aṣṭau padmāni sārdhasaptamātrikāṇi / prākpadmād bahis trimātrikaṃ padmaṃ paścimapadmāc ca tatheti ṭipiviśeṣaḥ.


	12.5.12 Saṃvaramaṇḍala (p.194)
	12.5.12.1

śrīsaṃvarasya tu bhagavato maṇḍale vajravārāhīmaṇḍale ca mūlasūtrābhyantare brahmakoṇasūtreṣv eva sthiteṣu brahmasūtrād bahir dvimātrikāntaraṃ tyaktvā sūtram ekaṃ mūlasūtrāv adhipātayet / koṇasūtrasya savyavāmayor dvimātrikāntaraṃ tyaktvaikaikaṃ sūtraṃ dairghyeṇa nābhyubhayapārśvayoś catuścaturdvāramānaṃ / 
tato brahmaṇaḥ koṇasūtrasya ca bahiḥsūtrād bahir dvimātrikam antaraṃ tyaktvā prathamaṃ sūtraṃ brahmaṇaḥ koṇasūtrasya ca tatpārśvasūtrayoś copari dvāramānaṃ /
tiryak pārśvayor dvidvimātrikatvāt / tasya bahis tathā pañcasūtrāṇi / koṇatatpārśvasūtropari ṣaṣṭham api sūtraṃ /
tatra brahmaṇo dakṣiṇe prathamasyaikamātrāntān niḥsṛtya dvitīyasyāgre gatvā tṛtīyasyaikamātrānte praviśya caturthasyāgre gatvā pañcamasyaikamātrānte praviśya ṣaṣṭhasyāgre gatvā saptamāsyaikamātrānte praviṣṭaṃ sūtraṃ vakram ekaṃ bhavati / asyābhyantare 'rdhamātrāntaraṃ hitvā sūtram idam iva vakraṃ dvitīyaṃ / evaṃ vakrasūtradvayaṃ brahmaṇo vāme 'pi tathā koṇasūtrasya vāmetarayoḥ /
 

	12.5.12.2 (p.195)

tato nābhau sūtraṃ dhṛtvā mūlasūtram ādāyābhyantare / ekaikadvārāntareṇa brahmaṇidhṛtasūtreṇa catvāri vṛttasūtrāṇi / yad uktaṃ /
	mūlasūtram upādāya vṛttaṃ sūtracatuṣṭayaṃ // 
	bhrāmayitvā tricakrāṇāṃ dvāramānena saṃgataṃ //
	śeṣam aṣṭadalaṃ padmaṃ mānaṃ nāto 'dhikaṃ manāk //
	vajrapadmārimālāś ca cittacakrādinemiṣu //
iti /
tatrādyatrayāṇāṃ pratyekam abhyantare 'rdhamātrāntareṇa vṛttasūtram ekaṃ / caturthasya tu cittacakranābhyantasūcakasyābhyantare mātrikāpādāṃśāt paradalasārdhadvimātrikāntareṇa karṇikārthaṃ vṛttasūtram ekaṃ keśaravalayarūpaṃ /
caturthasyāpy abhyantare vajrāvalīvalayārtham ardhamātrāntareṇa vṛttasūtram ekam ity apy kaścit uktaṃ / vajraiś caturbhir atyugrair veṣṭayed arapārśvayor ity anyaḥ / arapārśvopari yathāyogaṃ vajrapadmacakramālā ity aparaḥ /
atra bahirvṛttasūtrābhyantare vṛttasūtrāṇy ārāsūtrāṇi ca saṃrakṣyānyāni proñched iti viśeṣā ṭṭippanī /


	12.5.13 Buddhakapālamaṇḍala (p.197)

iyam eva pañcaviṃśatyātmakasya buddhakapālasya maṇḍale viśeṣas tu prathamoktacaturthavṛttasūtraṃ keśarasūtraṃ ca na kartavyaṃ / ṣaṣṭhavṛttasūtrābhyantare hi dalapañcamātrikāntareṇa vṛttasūtram ekaṃ keśararūpam atreti /


	12.5.14 Yogāmbaramaṇḍala (p.197)

yogāmbaramaṇḍale mūlasūtrābhyantare sārdhatrimātrikāntaraṃ hitvā mātrikāntaraṃ vṛttasūtradvayamadhyagavajrāvalyāḥ / tataḥ sārdhatrimātrikāntareṇa vṛttam aparā tu ṭipiḥ piṇḍīkramoktamaṇḍala iva / mūlasūtrābhyantare kūṭāgāradvayaṃ ṭipiś ca vakṣyamāṇatricatvāriṃśadātmakamañjuvajramaṇḍalavad ity anyaḥ / garbhakūṭāgārād dvitīyaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ vṛttam iti kaścit / na kūṭāgāram atra. 
vajrāvalī prāgvad ity aparaḥ /


	12.5.15 Yamārimaṇḍala (p.198)

śrīmadyamāres trayodaśātmakasya maṇḍale brahmakoṇasūtrāṇy eva nānyat / tatra brahmasūtrād dvāradvayāntaraṃ tyaktvā viśvavajravedīsūtram ekaṃ tiryak koṇasūtraṃ yāvat / tasyābhyantare vajrāvalīsūtram ekaṃ mātrikāntaraṃ tyaktvā vedīsūtrād dvāraṃ yāvat pañcārāṇi / tadanu brahmakoṇasūtrāṇi lopayed iti viśeṣā ṭippitaṃ /

	12.5.16 Vajratārāmaṇḍala (p.199)

vajratārāyā maṇḍale brahmakoṇasūtreṣv eva sthiteṣu brahmato bahiḥ karṇikātrimātrāntareṇa vṛttaṃ sūtram ekaṃ tadbahir dalaṣaṇmātrāntareṇa vṛttasūtraṃ brahmakoṇasūtrāṇi proñchet.


	12.5.17 Mārīcīmaṇḍala (p.199)

pañcaviṃśatyātmakamārīcīmaṇḍale mañjuvajramaṇḍalavaṭ ṭipiḥ.


	12.5.8 Pañcarakṣāmaṇḍala (p.199)

pañcarakṣāṇāṃ trayodaśātmake maṇḍale brahmakoṇasūtrāṇy eva nānyat / tatra brahmasūtrād bahiḥ samantataś caturmātrikāntare madhyapadmaṃ tadbāhye 'ṣṭamātrāntare dikṣu catvāri padmāni brahmakoṇasūtrāṇi lumped iti viśeṣā ṭippaṇī /

	12.5.19 Vajradhātumaṇḍala (p.200)

tripañcaśaddevatātmakavajradhātumaṇḍale mūlasūtrasyābhyantare svadvāradvayamitāntaraṃ tyaktvā tiryak sūtram ekaṃ koṇasūtradvayaṃ yāvat / tad evābhyantaradvitīyamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtraṃ dvāraniryūhādikramaśīrṣasūtraparyantayuktaṃ nistoraṇādikaṃ / 
asya mūlasūtrasyābhyantare 'nantaram eva prathamaṃ vṛttasūtraṃ tadabhyantare vajrāvalīmātrikāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ tasmād aparadigvṛttasūtraṃ yāvad brahmaṇo dakṣiṇapārśve sūtradvayaṃ prathamaṃ mātrādvayāntareṇa dvitīyaṃ stambhamātrikāntareṇa / evaṃ vāme / tato brahmakoṇasūtralopān navakoṣṭhā bhavanti / aparabrahmasūtrāṇi nāyakasthānapaṭyantaḥsūtrāṇi ca proñchyānīti viśeṣā ṭṭipiḥ / 
garbhakūṭāgāraṃ satoraṇam iti tu trilokavijayamaṇḍalasyaivoktaṃ tattvasaṃgrahe /  yad uktaṃ /
	vajrastambhāgrasaṃstheṣu pañcamaṇḍalamaṇḍitam //
iti tat pañcatathāgatasthāneṣu vartulavajrarekhā lekhyās tāsu ca pañcacandramaṇḍalāni likhyānīti vyākhyātam ānandagarbheṇa tat tv asaṃgataṃ / na hi vartulavajrarekhāṇām vācakam idaṃ tantravākyaṃ / 


	12.5.20 Mañjuvajramaṇḍala (p.201)

tricatvāriṃśadātmakamañjuvajramaṇḍale mūlasūtrasyābhyantare dvāradvayāntareṇa tiryak sūtram ekaṃ koṇasūtradvayalagnaṃ tad evābhyantaradvitīyamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtraṃ dvāraniryūhādikramaśīrṣasūtraparyantayuktam atoraṇādikaṃ / asyābhyantare svadvāradvayāntareṇa tiryak sūtram ekaṃ koṇasūtralagnam etad eva tṛtīyagarbhamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtraṃ dvāraniryūhādiyuktam atoraṇādikaṃ / asya mūlasūtrasyābhyantare 'nantaram eva prathamam ityādinoktavajradhātugarbhamaṇḍalavat tṛtīyaṃ maṇḍalam iti viśeṣā ṭippaṇī /

	12.5.21 Dharmadhātuvāgīśvaramaṇḍala (p.202)

bhagavato dharmadhātuvāgīśvarasya maṇḍale prāguktasarvamaṇḍalasādhāraṇabahirmaṇḍalasūtraṇavidhiḥ jñeyaḥ / mūlasūtrādīni tu saptasūtrāṇi vartulānīti viśeṣaḥ / yad uktaṃ 
	vartulaṃ sarvato bhadram 
ity ādikaṃ / asya niryūhalagnamūlasūtrasyābhyantare dvāradvayāntaraṃ tyaktvā tiryak sūtram ekaṃ koṇasūtradvayasaktaṃ / tad evābhyantaradvitīyamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtraṃ dvāraniryūhādikramaśīrṣasūtrāvasānaṃ yuktaṃ toraṇarahitaṃ / asya mūlasūtrasyābhyantare tathā tṛtīyamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtraṃ tathā / asya mūlasūtrasyābhyantare svadvāradvayetyādinoktavarjradhātugarbhamaṇḍalam iva caturthamaṇḍalam iti viśeṣā ṭipiḥ /

	12.5.22 Durgatipariśodhanamaṇḍala (p.203)

durgatipariśodhanamaṇḍale piṇḍīkramoktamaṇḍalavaṭ ṭipiḥ / kiṃ tu vajrāvalyā abhyantaram aṣṭastambhādirahitaṃ pītāṣṭāracakreṇaiva maṇḍitam iti viśeṣaḥ /

	12.5.23 Bhūtaḍāmaramaṇḍala (p.203)

bhagavato bhūtaḍāmarasya maṇḍale caturasramūlasūtrasyābhyantare caturmātrāntaraṃ tyaktvā tiryak sūtratrayaṃ koṇasūtradvayalagnaṃ / tasyābhyantare caturmātrāntareṇaikaṃ tiryak sūtraṃ tathā / tasyābhyantare caturmātrāntareṇa mañjuvajramaṇḍaloktagarbhapuṭam iva garbhapuṭam iti catuṣpuṭaṭipitaṃ /

	12.5.24 Pañcaḍākamaṇḍala (p.204)

pañcaḍākamaṇḍale mahāmaṇḍalasya mātrāmānena mūlasūtrābhyantare sārdhaikamātrikam antaraṃ parityajyāparanavamātrikam antaraṃ dvādaśasamāṃśān kṛtvā pratipārśvam aṃśadvayaṃ tyaktvā madhyāṣṭamāṃśamānaṃ mūlasūtracatuṣṭayaṃ tad ekasyāṣṭamāṃśo dvāraṃ mūlasūtrād bahiḥ ṣaṭsūtrāṇītyādikaṃ ca prāgvad vidhātavyaṃ / evaṃ catvāri kūṭāgārāṇi nistoraṇāni dikṣu nābhau tu pañcamaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ tadvat / navamātrikam ityādikaṃ hy atrāpi jñātavyaṃ / kiṃ tv asya kūṭāgārasya caturṇāṃ cāntaraṃ mahāmaṇḍalamātrayaikamātrikaṃ /
atra hevajrasya kūṭāgāre mūlasūtrābhyantaraṃ ekamātrikasthayā sūtradvayamadhyagatayā caturasrayā vajrāvalyā parivṛttam ardhacandrākāraṃ / śāśvatasya cakramālayā vṛttaṃ / vajrasūryasya navāṃśaratnāvalyā navāṃśaratnākāram aṣṭāṃśaṃ vā / padmanarteśvarasya padmamālayā dvārābhimukhakoṇacaturasraṃ padmākrāraṃ vā / paramāśvasya khaḍgamālayā trikoṇam iti viśeṣā ṭippaṇī / sarveṣv api kūṭāgāreṣu svasvāpekṣayā mūlasūtradvāramātrāṇāṃ mānam avagantavyaṃ /


	12.5.25 Ṣaṭcakravartimaṇḍala (p.206)

ṣaṭcakravartimaṇḍale mahākūṭāgārasya mātrayā brahmasūtrād yac caturmātrikam antaram aparacaturmātrikāntarasahitaṃ tasya dvādaśāṃśān kṛtvā puraḥpṛṣṭhasavyāvasavyeṣu pratyekam aṃśadvayasyābhyantare mūlasūtram aṣṭāṃśamānaṃ pātayet / tadanurūpadvāramātrā niryūhādisūtrāṇi ca kramaśīrṣasūtraṃ yāvat / tato bahir mahāmaṇḍalamātrayā dvimātrikam antaraṃ hitvā brahmaṇi sūtraṃ dhṛtvā vartulaṃ sūtram ekaṃ mānārthaṃ / asyāṃśān samān pañca kṛtvā ekaikāṃśasya madhyān nirgataṃ brahmasūtraṃ mahāmaṇḍalamātrayāṣṭamātrikaṃ tasya madhye 'paraṃ brahmasūtraṃ tathā /
etad dvayasya pratyekaṃ dvādaśāṃśān kṛtvā pratyekam antasyāṃśadvayasyetyādikaṃ yāvad ity antam anantaroktaṃ kuryāt / eṣu ṣaṭsu maṇḍaleṣu koṇasūtrāṇy api pātanīyāni / eṣāṃ brahmasūtrād bahiḥ karṇikātrimātrikāntareṇa vṛttaṃ sūtram ekaṃ / tadbahir dalaṣaṇmātrāntareṇa vṛttasūtram ekaṃ tadbahir digvidikṣu ṣaṇmātrikāṇy aṣṭau padmāni / tato vṛttasūtraṃ tadbahir ekamātrikāntareṇa vṛttaṃ sūtraṃ tataḥ sarvatra brahmakoṇasūtrāṇi proñchet / evam iha ṭipaṇī viśeṣaḥ /
apare ca saptapuṭādimaṇḍalakūṭāgāraviśeṣā uktānusārato 'bhyūhya vijñaiḥ sūtrayitavyāḥ /


	12.6 Kālacakramaṇḍala 
	12.6.1 (p.207)

kālacakramaṇḍale punar atroktebhyaḥ samastatantrāntaravarṇitavidhibhyaḥ sūryarathaprabhṛtivinayanāya visadṛśī prakriyā kathitā 'to niṣpannakramayogino bhagavān śrīvajradhara eva vicitramūrtibhir akhilamaṇḍaleśvaratayā sarvābhipretaniṣpattaye prabhavatīti dṛḍhādhimuktyā tantrāntaravidhibhir api pratiṣṭhādikam anuṣṭhānam aviruddham abhimataṃ sādhayatīti kālacakrasya prakriyāprapañcaṃ parityajya maṇḍalasūtraṇamātram ucyate rajaḥpātamātraṃ ca vakṣyamāṇarajaḥpātanaprastāve vaktavyaṃ /


	12.6.2 (p.208)

iha hy ācāryasyāṅguṣṭhaiś caturviṃśatyā hastaṃ caturbhir hastair maṇḍalaṃ / taddviguṇaṃ dairgyeṇāṣṭahastaṃ brahmasūtradvayaṃ pātayet / tadanu tathā koṇasūtradvayaṃ / sūtraṃ tv ācāryayavapramāṇastaulyaṃ / tatra cittamaṇḍale dvāraṣaṣṭhāṃśo 'rdhāṅguṣṭhamānaṃ mātrā vyavahartavyā /
tatra brahmasūtranābhau nāyakakamalakarṇikārthaṃ brahmasūtrād bahir dvimātrāntareṇāparabrahmasūtropari dhṛtvā vartulaṃ sūtram ekaṃ pātayet / tato dalacaturmātrāntaraṃ tyaktvā sūtraṃ / tato vajrāvalīmātrikāntareṇa sūtraṃ tato devatāpadmacaturmātrāntaraṃ hitvā sūtraṃ / tato vajrāvalīmātrikāntareṇa sūtraṃ / etāni catvāri sūtrāṇy ubhayataḥ koṇasūtraparyantāni /


	12.6.3 (p.210)

atra devatācaturmātrasya madhye padmaṃ caturmātraṃ / tasya pārśvayoḥ stambhāv ekaikamātravistārau caturmātradairghyo (ed.; -dairghyau?) / tayoḥ pārśve kalaśau trimātravistārau tathā dairghyo tayoḥ pārśve stambhau tathā / tato 'ntimāt koṇasūtraparyantasūtrād bahiḥ saptamātrāntaraṃ tyaktvā sūtraṃ /
tato devatāpaṭṭīcaturmātrāntaraṃ hitvā sūtraṃ / tato mātrikāntareṇa mūlasūtraṃ koṇasūtraparyantaṃ / mūlasūtraparyantam eveha cittamaṇḍalaṃ / tathā vāṅmaṇḍalaṃ / tathā kāyamaṇḍalaṃ / 
mūlasūtrasya brahmasavyetaratritrimātrasya prāgvad lopāt ṣaṇmātrikaṃ dvāraṃ cakrāṣṭabhāgikaṃ bhavati / dvārasamo niryūhaḥ kapolaḥ pakṣaś ceti trayaṃ samānaṃ / 


	12.6.4 (p.211)

mūlasūtrād bahiḥ sārdhamātrāntareṇa bhittīnāṃ sūtraṃ koṇasūtrān niḥsṛtya niryūhakapolapakṣān anugacchan trivakraṃ kramaśīrṣasūtraparyantaṃ / tasya pārśve toraṇastambhasārdhamātrāntareṇa sūtraṃ kramaśīrṣasūtralagnāgram abhyantare dairghyeṇa sārdhasaptamātraṃ / mūlasūtrabahiḥsūtrād bahir vedītrimātrāntaraṃ hitvā sūtraṃ / tato ratnapaṭṭīsārdhamātrāntareṇa sūtraṃ / tato hārārdhahārapaṭṭītrimātrāntareṇa sūtraṃ / tato bakūlīpaṭṭīsārdhamātrāntareṇa sūtraṃ / tataḥ kramaśīrṣapaṭṭīsārdhamātrāntareṇa kramaśīrṣasūtraṃ koṇasūtrād aparakoṇasūtraṃ yāvad dairghyeṇa / vedīsūtrādīni catvāry aparasūtraṃ yāvat / ihaikastambhoparito 'parastambhoparigataṃ sūtraṃ śilīsūcakaṃ na tv asyābhyantare kramaśīrṣāṇi likhitavyāni /


	12.6.5 (p.212)

stambhopari toraṇaṃ dvāramānāt triguṇam ūrdhvataḥ /tac ca tripuraṃ / prathamaṃ ṣaṇmātraṃ dvitīyaṃ sārdhacaturmātraṃ / tṛtīyaṃ sārdhatrimātraṃ / harmir dvimātrā / tadupari kalaśo dvimātraḥ /
tatra prathamapure stambhopary ekamātrikā paṭṭī dairghyeṇa caturviṃśatimātrā / 
tadupary ekamātrā mattavaraṇapaṭṭī dairghyeṇa ṣoḍaśamātrā / tadupari caturmātraṃ caturasraṃ madhye pūjādevīsthānaṃ tasya savye vāme ca mātrikaḥ stambhaḥ tayoḥ pārśve tathā pūjādevīsthānaṃ tasya pārśve punar mātrikaḥ stambhaḥ / tatpārśvayos toraṇastambhopary ākrāntadantīndrāv ūrdhvaśirasthau siṃhau /
tacchirasoś catuḥstambhānāṃ copary mātrikā paṭṭī dairghyeṇāṣṭādaśamātrā / tadupari mātrikā mattavāraṇapaṭṭī dairghyeṇa dvādaśamātrā / tadupari trimātrā paṭṭī dvādaśamātrikadairghyā / tasyāṃ pratyekaṃ pādonamātrikaṃ stambhacatuṣṭayaṃ stambhāntarāleṣu pratyekaṃ trimātrāṇi trīṇi devatāsthānāni / bāhyastambhapārśvayoḥ śālabhañjike /
tacchirasoḥ stambhānāṃ copary ardhamātrā paṭṭī dairghyeṇa pañcadaśamātrā / tadupari mātrikā mattavāraṇapaṭṭī dairghyeṇāṣṭamātrā / tadupari dvimātrā paṭṭī dairghyeṇāṣṭamātrā / tasyāṃ pratyekam ardhamātrikaṃ stambhacatuṣṭayaṃ stambhāntarāleṣu pratyekaṃ dvimātraṃ devatāsthānatrayaṃ / bāhyastambhapārśvayoḥ śālabhañjike /
tadupary ardhamātrā paṭṭī dvādaśamātradairghyā / tadupari harmir dairghyeṇāṣṭamātrā / tadupari kalaśaḥ / tasya savyaṃ vāmaṃ ca dhvajadaṇḍasthānaṃ / evaṃ sarvapaṭṭikāgreṣu ghaṇṭācāmarādarśadhvajapatākāḥ /


	12.6.6 (p.215)

iha cittamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtrād bahir vāṅmaṇḍalaṃ tasyaikaikasyāṃ diśi dvādaśamātrikāṃ sthānaṃ cittamaṇḍalabhittyādikramaśīrṣāntapaṭṭībhir vyāptaṃ tadbahiḥ saptamātrikam antaraṃ parityajya sūtraṃ tataś caturmātrāṃ devatāpaṭṭīṃ hitvā sūtraṃ / asyāṃ paṭṭikāyāṃ padmāni caturmātrāṇi kiṃ tu diggatāni cittamaṇḍalatoraṇādhaḥsthāni dvitīyapurasya mattavāraṇādicaturmātrasthāne likhanīyāni stambhadvayasyārdhamātrāpasāreṇa / tato devatāpaṭṭīsūtrād bahir mātrikāntareṇa mūlasūtraṃ / sūtratrayam idaṃ dairghyeṇa koṇasūtraparyantaṃ / mūlasūtrasya tu brahmasavyavāmaṣaṭṣaṇmātrasya pūrvavad lopād dvādaśamātraṃ dvāraṃ bhavati / tato niryūhādikaṃ toraṇāntaṃ cittamaṇḍalaniryūhādibhyo dviguṇamānaṃ /


	12.6.7 (p.216)

asya vāṅmaṇḍalasya mūlasūtrad bahiḥ kāyamaṇḍalaṃ tasyaikaikasyāṃ diśi caturviṃśatimātrasthānaṃ vāṅmaṇḍalabhittyādikramaśīrṣāntapaṭṭībhir vyāptaṃ / tadbahir ekādaśamātrāntaraṃ tyaktvā sūtraṃ / tato dvādaśamātrāṃ devatāpaṭṭīṃ hitvā sūtraṃ / asyāṃ devatāpaṭṭikāyāṃ dvādaśapadmāni pratyekaṃ dvādaśamātrāṇi / tatra dvādaśamātraṃ padmaṃ saptabhāgaṃ kṛtvā madhyabhāgakarṇikā-savyavāmabhāgayoś catvāri dalāni / % (karṇikā-savya Corr by H.I, karṇikā savya ed.)
tadīyasavyavāmayor aṣṭau / tadīyasavyavāmayoḥ ṣoḍaśeti tribhir maṇḍalair aṣṭaviṃśatidalaṃ / devatāpaṭṭīsūtrād bahir mātrikāntareṇa mūlasūtraṃ / idaṃ sūtratrayaṃ koṇasūtraparyantaṃ dairghyeṇa /
mūlasūtrasya tu brahmasavyavāmadvādaśamātrasya prāgvad lopāc caturviṃśatimātraṃ dvāraṃ bhavati / tato niryūhādikaṃ toraṇāntaṃ vāṅmaṇḍalaniryūhādibhyo dviguṇamānaṃ / jalavalayasyārdhaṃ yāvat / vāṅmaṇḍalatoraṇebhyo bahiḥ kāyamaṇḍaladvāramadhyeṣu dvādaśamātrā rathāḥ /


	12.6.8 (p.217)

tataḥ pṛthvīvalayaṃ dvādaśamātraṃ / tato bahir jalavalayaṃ caturviṃśatimātraṃ / tato 'gnivalayaś caturviṃśatimātraḥ. 
tato vāyuvalayaś caturviṃśatimātraḥ / vāyuvalayād bahir ākāśavalayaṃ dvādaśamātraṃ / tadvalayabāhye raśmijvālāś caturviṃśatimātrāḥ / eṣāṃ pṛthivyādiṣaḍvalayānāṃ pratyekam ādau vṛttaṃ sūtraṃ / raśmivalayasya tv ante 'pīti saptavṛttasūtrāṇi /
evam idaṃ cittavajranāyakaṃ trimaṇḍalātmakamaṇḍalaṃ / sūtraṃ cāsyāṣṭahastaṃ pṛthvīvalayasyādiṃ yāvad iti prathamaḥ pakṣaḥ /


		12.6.9 (p.219)

yadā tv atratyacittamaṇḍaladvāramānaṃ vāṅmaṇḍaladvāramānena melayitvā 'ṣṭādaśamātrikaṃ dvāraṃ parikalpya tasya ṣaṣṭhāṃśo mātrā vyavahriyate / tadā tayā mātrayā nāyakakamalakarṇikādau rocirvalayānte mātrā saṃkhyā kartavyā / tadā tu cittavajranāyakaṃ trimaṇḍalātmakamaṇḍalaṃ dvādaśahastaṃ taddviguṇaṃ sūtraṃ caturviṃśatihastaṃ bhūvalayasyādiṃ yāvad iti dvitīyaḥ pakṣaḥ /
yadā tu cittavajro bhagavān vāgvajrasya sthāne bhavati vāgvajras tu nāyakas tadaparadevatādinyāsas tu prathamapakṣavat / yadā ca garbhamaṇḍalaṃ caturhastaṃ taddviguṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ taddviguṇaṃ tṛtīyaṃ / tadā ṣoḍaśahastaṃ trimaṇḍalātmakaṃ vāṇmaṇḍalaṃ / taddviguṇaṃ sūtraṃ dvātriṃśaddhastaṃ bhūmivalayasyādiṃ yāvad iti tṛtīyaḥ pakṣaḥ /
yadā tu prathamoktacittamaṇḍaladvāramānaṃ prathamoktakāyamaṇḍaladvāramānena melayitvā triṃśanmātraṃ dvāraṃ parikalpya tasya ṣaṣṭhāṃśo mātrā vyavahriyate tadā tayā mātrayā nāyakakarṇikādau raśmivalayānte mātrā saṃkhyā kartavyā / cittavajraś ca bhagavān kāyavajrasya sthāne kartavyaḥ kāyavajras tu nāyakaḥ tadaparadevatādinyāsas tu prathamapakṣavat / tadā kāyavajranāyakaṃ trimaṇḍalātmakaṃ maṇḍalaṃ viṃśatihastaṃ taddviguṇam sūtraṃ catvāriṃśaddhastaṃ pṛthvīvalayasyādiṃ yāvad iti caturthaḥ pakṣaḥ /


