tatra prathamaṃ bahirmaṇḍale 'bhyantare ca sāmānyena sarvadevatāmaṇḍaleṣu varṇakrama ucyate /
pūrvadakṣiṇapaścimottaradiktathāgatamadhyanāyakavarṇair yathākramaṃ bahīrekhātaḥ prabhṛty abhyantararekhāṃ yāvat pañcarajobhittirekhāṇāṃ varṇo dikṣu madhye ca devatāntaranyāse mudraṇatathāgatavarṇānukrameṇa / bhāvyamaṇḍale pañcavarṇaratnanirmitā yavāntarāḥ pañcabhittaya etā iti kecit / ekaiveyaṃ bhittiḥ krameṇopary upari pañcavarṇaratnanirmitety apare /
atrādyamate ratnapaṭṭikābhūmī raktā hārārdhahārabhūmiḥ kṛṣṇā / dvitīyamate tu prathamavarṇaratnamayabhāga eva vicitraratnānāṃ paṭṭī / tasmin vā varṇāntararatnanirmitā nyastā ratnapaṭṭī / pañcamavarṇāratnamayabhāga eva vicitrahārārdhahārāṇāṃ paṭṭī / tasmin va varṇāntararatnanirmitā nyastā hārārdhahārapaṭṭī / pakṣānataroktā tadupari ratnapaṭṭī hārapaṭṭīvat / dvayor api matayor vedikā sphāṭikakuṭṭimā hemamayī padmarāgamayī vā ratnāntaramayī vā yathāśobhaṃ /


		13.2.2 (p.235)

bakulyaḥ kramaśīrṣāṇi ca śuklāni bakulīkramaśīrṣāñcalāntarālabhūmayo nīlā ākāśarūpatvāt / ata evāntarālapaṭṭikāndhakārapaṭṭikocyate / āsāro yathāśobhaṃ ratnamayo vicitraratnapatracchaṭādimaṇḍitaḥ /
toraṇasya stambhāḥ svasvadiktathāgatavarṇā vakrābhyantare ca candrātapād adhobhūmiś ca sā hi tathāgatānāṃ svavarṇakiraṇair añjitākāśasvarūpā / khuravaraṇḍā yathāśobhavarṇā makarapaṭṭī ca / cakrāṇi sauvarṇāni / ratnāntaranirmitāny apīti kaścit / mṛgamṛgyau hemamayau ratnāntarakhacitāḥ /
