sampuṭa-uktavajrasattvasya śubhratve 'py akṣobhyeṇa sahaikarasatvasūcanāyābhyantarabhitteḥ kṛṣṇatvaṃ / anye tu śuklatvam eva yathā vāgavajrasya nāyakībhūtasya kvacic chuklatve satīti /


		13.2.4 (p.238)

mūlasūtrābhyantaramaṇḍale punaḥ koṇasūtradvayadvayaparicchinnāś caturdigbhūmayaḥ svasvadiktathāgatavarṇās tathā bhāvyamaṇḍale caturdikpaṭalāni tathā stambhāḥ svasvakoṣṭhatathāgatacihnamālāṅkāḥ / nāyakabhūmir nāyakavarṇā  / 
	nairṛtaṃ haritaṃ kṛṣṇam aiśam āgneyavāyave /
	pīte dikṣu tu raktāni dalāni viśvapaṅkaje //
nāyakapaṭyāṃ nāyakacihnamālā / apararekhāsu guṇavarṇā yathāśobhaṃ /


		13.2.5 (p.239)

samvaramaṇḍale tu cittacakraṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tadārāntarālāni raktāni vākcakranābhitvāt / vākcakraṃ raktaṃ tadārāntarālāni śuklāni kāyacakranābhitvāt / kāyacakraṃ śubhraṃ tadārāntarālāni pūrvādidikṣu vairocanāditathāgatavarṇāni nemitrayaṃ yathākramaṃ kṛṣṇavajraraktapadmaśuklacakrāvalīkalitaṃ / bahiḥ prabhṛti yāvad abhyantaraṃ haritaśuklaraktapītakṛṣṇavarṇāḥ pañcarekhāḥ / śvetaharitaraktapītakṛṣṇavarṇāḥ pūrvottarapaścimadakṣiṇamadhyā bhuvaḥ / paṭalāni ca / kṛṣṇaharitaraktapītasitamiśranīlavarṇāḥ pañcarekhā bhuvaḥ paṭalāni cety aparaḥ /


		13.2.6 (p.240)

tad evaṃ pūrvāparaṃ varṇakramaṃ ca paribhāvya rajaḥ pātayet  / tatra abhavya samāgame cihnamudre eva yathāyogaṃ likhitavye / abhavyāsambhave tu devatāmūrtir likhanīyā / citritā niṣiktā ghaṭitā saṃskṛtā vā sthāpayitavyā / tathā coktaṃ nāgabuddhipādaiḥ /
	bījanyāso 'tha cihnaṃ vā devatārūpam eva vā /
	niṣiktaṃ ghaṭitaṃ sthāpyaṃ maṇḍale ca yathābalam //
iti / mudrālikhanam abhidhānottaratantre varṇitaṃ /
	aśaktau likhitāṃ mudrāṃ cihnaṃ ca sthāpayet //
yad uktaṃ
	raṅgair vāpy athavā kūrcaiś citritaiḥ pravicitritam //
iti / śrīsampuṭatantre ca 
	evaṃ niṣiktaghaṭitādirūpeṇāpi cihnamudrā yuktā //
iti /


		13.3
		13.3.1 Mañjuvajramaṇḍala (p.241)

ato mañjuvajramaṇḍale nābhau bhagavato mañjuvajrasya candre khaḍgaḥ śyāmaḥ /
pūrve vairocanasya candre śubhram aṣṭāracakraṃ / dakṣiṇe ratnasambhavasya sūrye haritanavāṃśaratnaṃ / paścime 'mitanāthasya sūrye raktāṣṭadalakamalaṃ / uttare 'moghasiddheḥ sūrye haritaḥ khaḍgaḥ /
āgneye candre locanāyā meghasthaṃ nīlatārakasitalocanadvayaṃ / nairṛtyendau māmakyāḥ kṛṣṇapañcaśūkavajraṃ / tantre tathā pāṭhāt / vāyavyendau pāṇḍarāyā vikacaraktapadmaṃ sanālakandaṃ / aiśānendau tārāyāḥ pītanīlābham utpalaṃ /
āgneyādicatuḥkoṇeṣu pūrvadvārasya vāmetaradvidvimātrāntaritapārśvayoś ca candreṣu yathākramaṃ rūpa-śabda-gandha-rasa-sparśa-dharmadhātuvajrāṇāṃ śukladarpaṇo nīlagandharvavīṇā pītagandhaśaṅkhaṃ raktarasapātraṃ viśvavastraṃ śukladharmodayā /
prāgādidvāreṣu sūryeṣu yamāntaka-prajñāntaka-padmāntaka-vighnāntakānāṃ yathākramaṃ kṛṣṇavajramudgaraṃ vajrāṅkitasitadaṇḍo raktapaṅkajaṃ nīlakarālavajraṃ /
atronaviṃśatiś candrasūryā viśvapadmasthāḥ / sarvāṇi cihnāni saraśmikāni svasvadiggataśiraskāni / cakreśasya tu paścimaśiraskaṃ / evam uttaratrāpi / vajrasattvasya cakreśatve nīlasaumyavajraṃ madhyābjendau viśvavajram iti kaścit /
garbharociṣāṃ vṛttasūtre guṇarajo na pātanīyam iti bahuvidaḥ / vartulasūtrād bahir brahmasūtrapratipārśvaṃ caturmātrāntaraṃ tyaktvā caturmātrikaḥ kalaśa ity aṣṭau kalaśā amṛtapūrṇāḥ sauvarṇā ity ekaḥ pakṣaḥ / svasvadiktathāgatavarṇaratnamayā ity aparaḥ / ihottaratra ca madhye tathāgatāntaracihnanyāse tatsthāne madhyacihnaṃ likhitavyaṃ /


		13.3.2 Piṇḍīkramoktamaṇḍala (p.243)

piṇḍīkrama-uktamaṇḍale madhye 'kṣobhyasya sūrye indranīlābhaṃ pañcaśūkakarālavajraṃ vastraṃ ca sparśavarjāyāḥ /
vairocanādīnāṃ prathamadvitīyapuṭasthānāṃ dvādaśānāṃ pūrvavac cihnāni /
tṛtīyapuṭe paṭṭikāyāṃ dvārasya pārśve brahmasūtrāc caturmātrāntaratyāgena vāme maitreyasya nāgakeśarakusumaṃ sacakraṃ / savye kṣitigarbhasyāṣṭāraśuklacakraṃ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ tathā lokeśvara-mañjughoṣayo ratkaṃ padmaṃ vajraṃ / uttarasyāṃ tathā sarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhi-samantabhadrayoḥ khaḍgo varjaṃ /
pūrvādidvāreṣu yamāryādīnāṃ yathākramaṃ vajramudgaraṃ vajrāṅkasitadaṇḍo raktābjaṃ viśvavajraṃ / āgneyādikoṇeṣv acala-ṭakkirāja-nīladaṇḍa-mahābalānāṃ khaḍgo vajraṃ vajrāṅkanīladaṇḍo vajrāṅkakṛṣṇadaṇḍaḥ / uṣṇīṣacakraṇo nīlavajraṃ yamāricihnād bahiḥ pītacakram ity anyaḥ / sumbharājasya vajraṃ padmāntakacihnād bahiḥ / 
maitreyādyaṣṭacihnāni candrasthāni / yamāryādidaśacihnāni sūryasthāni / atraikatriṃśatsūryendavo viśvapadmasthāḥ kalaśalikhanaṃ prāgvat /


		13.3.3 Sampuṭatantroktavajrasattvamaṇḍala (p.245) 

saṃpuṭatantra-uktavajrasattvamaṇḍale madhye vajrasattvasya candre nīlapañcaśūkavajraṃ /
pūrvendau śāśvatasya cakraṃ / dakṣiṇasūrye ratneśasya ratnaṃ / paścimaravāv amitābhasya bāṇaḥ / uttararavāv amoghasiddher viśvavajraṃ /
locanāyā jaladasthalocane / māmakyā bāṇaḥ / pāṇḍarāyā bāṇaḥ / tārāyā raktotpalaṃ /
dvitīyapuṭe pūrvasyāṃ diśi raudryā bāṇaḥ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ vajrabimbyāyā vajraṃ / paścimāyāṃ rāgavajrāyāḥ khaḍgaḥ / uttarasyāṃ vajrasaumyāyāḥ piṭṭanī / aiśān-yāṃ vajravakṣyāḥ sitapītadaṇḍaḥ / āgneyāṃ vajraḍākinyāḥ pītaraktapadmaṃ / nairṛtyāṃ śabdavajrāyāḥ śaktiḥ / vāyavyāṃ pṛthivīvajrāyā haritasitakalaśaḥ / 
tṛtīyapuṭe pūrvasyāṃ diśi hāsyāyā vajraṃ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ lāsyāyā vajraṃ / paścimāyāṃ gītāyāḥ kaṃsikā / udīcyāṃ nṛtyāyās triśūkavajraṃ haritaṃ / aiśānyāṃ vaṃśāyā vaṃśaḥ / āgneyāṃ vīṇāyā vīṇā / nairṛtyāṃ mukundāyā mukundaḥ / vāyavyāṃ murajāyā murajaḥ /
bāhyapaṭṭikāyām āgneyāṃ puṣpāyāḥ puṣpamālā / nairṛtyāṃ dhūpāyā dhūpakaṭacchuḥ / vāyavyāṃ dīpāyā dīpayaṣṭhiḥ / aiśānyāṃ gandhāyā gandhaśaṅkhaṃ / prācyām ādarśāyā darpaṇaḥ / avācyāṃ rasāyā rasapātram / pratīcyāṃ sparśāyā viśvavastraṃ / udīcyāṃ dharmāyā dhavaladharmodayā /
pūrvādidvāreṣu yathākramaṃ vajrāṅkusī-vajrapāśī-vajrasphoṭā-vajraghaṇṭānāṃ sūryasthavajrāṅkuśavajrapāśavajramālātmakavajranigaḍavajraghaṇṭāḥ /
ihoktasaptasūryāsanacihnebhyo 'nyāni cihnāni candrāsanāni / ete ca saptatriṃśaccandrasūryā viśvapadmopari kapāleṣu sthitāḥ / kalaśalikhanaṃ pūrvavat /ṣaṣṭhavṛttasūtrād bahir iti tu viśeṣaḥ /


		13.3.4 Jñānaḍākinīmaṇḍala (p.248)

jñānaḍākinyā maṇḍale madhye pūrvottarapaścimadakṣiṇeṣu yathākramaṃ jñānaḍākinī-vajraḍākinī-ghoraḍākinī-vettālī-caṇḍālīnāṃ vajrāṅkakhaṭvāṅgāni / aiśānyāgneyanairṛtyavāyavyeṣu siṃhinī-vyāghrī-jambukī-ulūkīnāṃ vajrāṅkuśāḥ /
pūrvottarapaścimadakṣiṇadvāreṣu rājendrī dīpinī-cūṣiṇī-kambojīnāṃ yathākramaṃ kṛtāñjalikastadvayaṃ sampuṭāñjalī raktapūrṇāñjalir vajrāñjalyaṅguṣṭhāgradvayayuktatarjanīdvayasūcī / 
iha cihnāni mudrāś ca viśvābjasūryasthāḥ / viśvābjāni punar jñānaḍākinyādīnāṃ yathākramaṃ pañcasiṃhaśvetadantisaptaratnarāśimahiṣāṣṭaphaṇīndrapucchaśvacatuṣṭayasthāni bhāvyamaṇḍale samprati rajomaṇḍale na likhyante 'bhavyasamāgame 'nyatra tu prayāsatrāsād alparucitvāc ca dānapateḥ / bhavyaprasādārthaṃ tu dānapativaśāl likhyante / evam uttaratra yathāsambhavaṃ likhanam alikhanaṃ ca veditavyaṃ / kalaśalikhanaṃ bahirvṛttasūtrād bahiḥ / 


		13.3.5 Hevajramaṇḍala (p.250)

saptadaśātmakasya hevajratrayasya maṇḍale viśvakamalakarṇikāyāṃ nīlaṃ krūravajraṃ /
prāgdakṣiṇādi-aiśānāgneyādidaleṣu yathākramaṃ vajraraudrī-vajrabimbā-vajrarāgā-vajrasaumyā-vajrayakṣī-vajraḍākinī-śabdavajrā-pṛthvīvajrāṇāṃ bāṇavajrakhaḍgapiṭṭanīpītadaṇḍapītaraktapadmaśaktiharitasitakalaśāḥ /
dvitīye puṭe aiśānāgneyādiṣu vaṃśā-vīṇā-mukundā-murajānāṃ vaṃśavīṇā-mukundamurajāḥ /
pūrvādidvāreṣu vajrāṅkuśī-vajrapāśī-vajrasphoṭā-vajraghaṇṭāṇāṃ vajrāṅkuśa-vajrapāśanigaḍavajraghaṇṭāḥ /
etāni saptadaśacihnāni kapālasūryasthāni / vaṃśādīnām aṣṭānāṃ kapālādho viśvapadmāni dvicaturbhujayor na kapālaṃ /
ṣoḍaśabhujasya tu maṇḍale viśvābjakarṇikāyāṃ nīlaṃ krūravajraṃ /
prāgādyaiśānādidaleṣu yathākramaṃ gaurī-caurī-vettālī-ghasmarī-pukkasī-śavarī-caṇḍālī-pramohāṇāṃ bāṇo vajraṃ saraktakapālasthakūrmo medaḥpūrṇakapālasthasarpo māṃsapūrṇakapālasthasiṃhaḥ saśuklakapālasthabhikṣū raktabhṛtakapālasthavyāghraś caṣakaṃ /
dvitīyapuṭe koṇeṣu vaṃśādīnāṃ prāgvac cihnāni /
pūrvādidvāreṣu hayāsyā-sukarāsyā-śvānāsyā-siṃhinīnāṃ vajrāṅkuśavajrapāśa-nigaḍavajraghaṇṭāḥ /
amūni saptadaśacihnāni sūryasthāni / vaṃśādīnām aṣṭānāṃ sūryādho viśvapadmāni garbharocirbhyo bahiḥ kalaśāḥ prāgvat /


		13.3.6 Nairātmyāmaṇḍala (p.252)

nairātmyāyā maṇḍale viśvapadmakarṇikāyāṃ prāgādidaleṣu ca yathākramaṃ    nairātmyā-vajrā-gaurī-vārī-vajraḍākinīnāṃ dvitīyapuṭe ṣoḍaśabhujamaṇḍaloktāṣṭagauryādīnāṃ ca vajraṃ /
vaṃśādīnāṃ cihnāni pūrvavat / hayāsyādīnāṃ kartrī hayāsyāyā bahiḥ khecaryā vajraṃ / śvānāsyāyā bahir bhūcaryā vajraṃ / 
iha kartrīcatuṣṭayaṃ sūryasthaṃ / aparacihnāni candramaṇḍalasthāni / bāhyagauryādīnāṃ aṣṭādaśānāṃ candrādikaṃ viśvasarojasthaṃ /
aṣṭānāṃ vaṃśādīnām abhāve śeṣapañcadaśadevīnāṃ candra karttikā / gauryā bahiḥ khecaryāś cihnaṃ vettālyā bahir bhūcaryāḥ /
evaṃ kurukullāmaṇḍale paraṃ candre sanālaraktotpalakalikāśaraḥ / pañcadaśāpi hi devyo 'tra kurukulleva raktavarṇāḥ /


		13.3.7 Vajrāmṛtamaṇḍala (p.254)

vajrāmṛtamaṇḍale prathame viśvābjasya karṇikāyāṃ pūrvādyaiśānādidaleṣu ca yathākramaṃ vajrāmṛta-saumyā-saumyavadanā-cāndrī-śaśinī-śaśimaṇḍā-śaśi-lekhā-manojñā-manohrādanakarīṇāṃ vajraṃ / śaśilekhāyāḥ paraṃ candra-kalaikā / 
dvitīyapuṭe aiśānādiṣu puṣpā-dhūpā-dīpā-gandhānāṃ puṣpakaraṇḍadhūpakaṭacchudīpayaṣṭigandhaśaṅkhāni /
pūrvādipaṭṭīṣu vaṃśādīnāṃ vaṃśādīni catvāri /
pūrvādidvāreṣu bhṛkuṭītaraṅga-bhayabhīṣaṇa-hayarūpa-gaṇanāyakānāṃ vajrāṅkuśapāśanigaḍaghaṇṭāḥ /
etāny ekaviṃśatichināni candrasthāni / dvādaśapuṣpādīnāṃ candrādho viśvāmbujāni / athavā sarvamāṇḍaleyānāṃ dharmodayā likhitavyā / iyam eva likhanīyety anyaḥ / aparavajrāmṛtatrayasya maṇḍaleṣu cihnāni vajrāmṛtatantre veditavyāni /


		13.3.8 Hevajramaṇḍala (p.255)

navātmakasya hevajratrayasya maṇḍale viśvābjasya karṇikāsūrye nīlakarālavajraṃ /
prāgādīśānādidalacandreṣu yathākramaṃ gaurī-caurī-vettālī-ghasmarī-pukkasī-śavarī-caṇḍālī-ḍombīnāṃ karttikṛpīṭakūrmasarpasiṃhabhikṣucakravajrāṇi /
ṣoḍaśabhujasya sūrye viśvavajrāṅkitaśuklakapālam ity eva viśeṣaḥ / bahirvṛttād bahiḥ kalaśāḥ /


		13.3.9 Mahāmāyāmaṇḍala (p.256)

mahāmāyāmaṇḍale raktakamalasya puṣkararavau bhagavato mahāmāyārūpasya padmabhājanaṃ /
pūrvādidalacandreṣu pradakṣiṇaṃ vajraḍākinī-ratnaḍākinī-padmaḍākinī-viśvaḍākinīnāṃ vajraṃ ratnacchaṭā viśvāmbujaṃ khaḍgaḥ / buddhaḍākinī tu vajrasattvaṃ āliṅgya sthiteti na pṛthak taccihnanyāsaḥ /


		13.3.10 Buddhakapālamaṇḍala (p.257)

navātmakabuddhakapālasya maṇḍale viśvāmbujasya karṇikāsūrye ḍamaruḥ / 
prāgudakpratyagavāgaiśānāgneyanairṛtyavāyavyadalasūryeṣu citrasenā-kāminī-pātālavāsinī-saubhadrā-sauṇḍinī-bhūtinī-caturbhujā-ākāśavāsinīnāṃ karttikāḥ /


		13.3.11 Vajrahūṃkāramaṇḍala (p.257)

vajrahūṃkāramaṇḍale madhye vajrahūṃkārasya vajraṃ /
pūrvādiṣu vāmāvartena vajradaṇḍa-analārka-uṣṇīṣa-vajrakuṇḍalīnām āgneyādiṣu pradakṣiṇaṃ vajrayakṣa-vajrakāla-mahākāla-vajrabhīṣaṇa-uṣṇīṣa-vajrapātālānāṃ vajramudgaro vajradaṇḍo raktābjaṃ viśvavajram aṅkuśaṃ parśus triśūlaṃ khaḍgaś cakraṃ vajramuṣalaṃ / sarvāṇi cihnāni viśvābjasūryasthāni /
athavā pūrvādidikṣu dakṣiṇāvartena yamāntaka-prajñāntaka-padmāntaka-vighnāntakānāṃ vajramudgaro vajrāṅkasitadaṇḍo raktapadmaṃ viśvavajraṃ /
āgneyyādividikṣv acala-ṭakkirāja-nīladaṇḍa-mahābalānāṃ khaḍgo vajraṃ vajrāṅkanīladaṇḍo vajrāṅkadaṇḍo yamāricihnād bahir uṣṇīṣacakriṇo vajraṃ / padmāntakacihnād bahiḥ sumbhasya vajraṃ / etāny ekādaśacihnāni viśvābjasūryasthāni /
athavā vighnāreḥ karālavajraṃ / āgneyyādiṣu ṭakkirāja-nīladaṇḍa-mahābala-acalānām aṅkuśo vajrāṅkanīladaṇḍas triśūlaṃ khaḍgaḥ / uṣṇīṣacakriṇaḥ pītacakraṃ / anyad anantarapūrvavat /
athavā yamāryādīnāṃ caturṇāṃ vajrāṅkuśo vajranigaḍo vajraghaṇṭā / aparam anantarapūrvavat /


		13.3.12 Saṃvaramaṇḍala (p.259)

saṃvaramaṇḍale viśvāmbhojasya puṣkarasthabhānau śrīsaṃvarasya nīlakarālapañcasūcikavajraṃ caturdigdaleṣu ḍākinī-lāmā-khaṇḍarohā-rūpiṇīnāṃ karttikāḥ / koṇadaleṣu padmabhājanāni / caturviṃśaticittacakrādyareṣu pracaṇḍā-caṇḍākṣī-prabhāvatī-mahānāsā-vīramatī-kharvarī-laṅkeśvarī-drumacchāyā-airāvatī-mahābhairavā-vāyuvegā-surābhakṣī-śyāmādevī-subhadrā-hayakarṇā-khagānanā-cakravegā-khaṇḍarohā-śauṇḍinī-cakravarmiṇī-suvīrā-mahābalā-cakravartinī-mahāvīryāṇāṃ karttikāḥ / vīrāṇāṃ apradhānatvāc cihnāni na likhyante /
dvāreṣu kākāsyā-ulūkāsyā-śvānāsyā-sūkarāsyānāṃ koṇeṣu yamadāḍhī-yamadūtī-yamadaṃṣṭrī-yamamathanīnāṃ viśvābjasūryeṣu karttikāḥ /
iha pūrvādidikṣu vāmāvartenāgneyyādividikṣu dakṣināvarteṇa cihnanyāsaḥ / bahirvṛttasūtrād bahiḥ koṇaṃ āśritya kalaśalikhanaṃ / aparasaṃvaravajravārāhīmaṇḍaleṣu cihnāni niṣpannayogāvalyām uktāni /


		13.3.13 Buddhakapālamaṇḍala (p.261)

pañcaviṃśatyātmakabuddhakapālamaṇḍale madhye viśvasarojasūrye ḍamaruḥ /
caturviṃśatidevīnāṃ karttikāḥ / prācyādidikṣu vāmāvartenāgneyyādividikṣu dakṣiṇāvartena / tatra kṛṣṇacakrāropari digdaleṣu sumālinī-kapālinī-bhīmā-sudurjayānāṃ vidigdaleṣu kapālāni / tato nīlakuliśāvalī /
dvitīyapuṭe raktāṣṭārasthāṣṭābjeṣu dikṣu śubhamekhalā-rūpiṇī-vijayā-kāriṇīnāṃ vidikṣu kālinī-mahodadhi-kāriṇī-māraṇīnāṃ / tato raktavajrāvalī /
tṛtīyapuṭe śuklāṣṭārasthāṣṭapadmeṣu dikṣu tāriṇī-bhīmadarśana-sudarśanā-ajayānāṃ vidikṣu śubhā-'stārakī-kālarātrī-mahāyaśasāṃ / tataḥ śubhravajrāvalī / 
dvārapadmeṣu sundarī-vasundarā-subhagā-priyadarśanānāṃ /
viṃśatipadmopari sūryeṣu karttikā ity āmananti /


		13.3.14 Yogāmbaramaṇḍala (p.262)

yogāmbaramaṇḍale maṇḍaleśasya viśvābjacandre nīlapañcaśūkavajraṃ /
prāgudakpratyagavākkoṣṭheṣu padmasūryasthāni khaṭvāṅgāni / īśānāgnyādikoṣṭheṣu khaṭvāṅgāṅkuśaparśudaṇḍāḥ / prāgādikoṣṭheṣu khaṭvāṅgebhyo bahir yathākramaṃ / mukhakṣiptahastadvayaṃ kṛtāñjalī rudhirāñjalir muṣalaṃ ca / khaṭvāṅgādicihnāni padmasūryasthāni /
rocivalayād bahiḥ prācyāṃ diśy amṛtakapālāni trīṇi / uttarasyāṃ pradīpakapālatrayaṃ / paścimāyāṃ balikapālatrayaṃ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ pānakapālatrayaṃ / aiśānyāṃ garvahasto gandhabhāṇḍaṃ ca / āgneyyāṃ vīṇā puṣpakaraṇḍakaś ca / nairṛtyāṃ tarjayaṅkaro dhūpakaṭacchuś ca / vāyavyām añjalir dīpaś ca /
tato vajrāvalīvalayād bahiḥ pūrvādipaṭṭikāsu pratyekaṃ catvarī dvārakoṇeṣv aṣṭāv iti caturviṃśatiḥ khaṭvāṅgāni / amṛtakapālādīni sarojasūryasthāni /



		13.3.15 Yamārimaṇḍala (p.264)

yamārimaṇḍale viśvavajrasya vedyāṃ madhye bhagavato yamārer nīlakarālapañcaśūkavajraṃ /
prāgdakṣiṇādyaramūleṣu śāśvata-ratneśa-amitābha-amoghasiddhīnāṃ śuklāṣṭāracakranavāṃśaharitaratnaraktāṣṭadalakamalaśyāmakhaḍgāḥ /
viśvavajrasyāgninairṛtyādikoṇeṣu vajracarcikā-vajravārāhī-sarasvatī-gaurīnāṃ cakravajrapadmakahḍgāḥ /
tato vajrāvalī tato viśvavajrasya pratidikpañcārāṇi / pūrvadakṣiṇādidvāreṣu mudgarayamāri-daṇḍayamāri-padmayamāri-khaḍgayamārīṇāṃ viṃśatyāravajrāṅkamudgaraṃ sitadaṇḍo raktapadmaṃ khaḍgaḥ /
iha śāśvatasya devīnāṃ ca cihnāni candrasthāni / anyeṣāṃ sūryasthāni / ravīndutale viśvapadmāni / maṇḍalakoṇeṣu catvāri padmasthakapālāni / arapārśveṣu kalaśāḥ /


		13.3.16 Vajratārāmaṇḍala (p.265)

vajratārāmaṇḍale viśvapadmavaraṭakacandre kanakavarṇanavaśūkavajraṃ /
prāgdakṣiṇādidalacandreṣu puṣpatārā-dhūpatārā-dīpatārā-gandhatārāṇāṃ puṣpadāmadhūpaśākhādīpaśākhāgandhaśaṅkhāni /
āgneyyādidaleṣu śāśvata-akṣobhya-amitābha-amoghaviśuddyā cakravajra-padmakhaḍgāḥ /
prāksavyādidvāreṣu vajrāṅkuśī-vajrapāśī-vajrasphoṭā-vajraghaṇṭānāṃ viśvābjasūryeṣu pūrvavad aṅkuśādayaḥ / vajrāṅkuśād bahir uṣṇīṣavijayāyā viśvapadmasūrye cakraṃ / vajrasphoṭād bahiḥ sumbhāyā viśvābjabhānau nāgapāśaḥ /
agnyādikoṇābjeṣu locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārāviśuddhyā bodhicittaghaṭo merur bahnikuṇḍaṃ mahādhvajaḥ / padmabāhye kalaśāḥ /


		13.3.17 Mārīcīmaṇḍala (p.266)

mārīcīmaṇḍale madhyaviśvābje candre sūrye vā śaraḥ / rātrau hi candrasthā divā sūryasthā devi vicarati /
prācyāvācyādidikṣu / arkamasi-markamasi-antardhānamasi-tejomasi-devīnāṃ yathākramaṃ sūcī-sasūtrasūcī-aśokakiśalaya-śarāḥ /
agninairṛtyādikoṇeṣu / udayamasi-gulmamasi-vanamasi-cīvaramasīnāṃ yathākramam arkamasyādicihnavac cihnāni /
bāhyapuṭe paṭṭikāyāṃ pūrvasyāṃ mahācīvaramasi-varāhamukhidevyor vajrāṅkuśau / dakṣiṇasyāṃ padākramasi-varaledevyor aśokapallavau / paścimāyāṃ parākramasi-vadaledevyoḥ śarau / uttarasyāṃ ūrmamasi-varālidevyoḥ sūcyau /
agnyādikoṇeṣu vattāli-vadāli-varāli-varāhamukhīnāṃ sūcīsasūtrasūcī-aśoka-pallavaśarāḥ /
pūrvāsmin dvāre ālodevyā vajrāṅkuśaḥ / dakṣiṇe tālodevyā vajrapāśaḥ /
paścime kālodevyā vajrasphoṭaḥ / uttare satsalosambamūrdhatidevyā vajrāveśaḥ /
atra dvārapālīcihnāni padmasūryeṣv anyāsāṃ padmacandreṣu /


		13.3.18 Pañcarakṣāmaṇḍala (p.268)

pañcarakṣāṇāṃ maṇḍale madhye viśvābjacandre mahāpratisarāyā ratnacchaṭā /
pūrvaviśvābjacandre mahāsāhasrapramardanyāś cakraṃ / dakṣiṇaviśvābjasūrye mahāmantrānusāriṇyā vajraṃ / paścimaviśvābjasūrye mahāśītavatyāḥ padmaṃ / uttaraviśvābjacandre mahāmāyūryā mayūrapicchaṃ /
dvitīyapuṭe 'gnyādikoṇeṣu śaṅkho vajrāṅkadhvajaḥ parśus triśūlaṃ ca / kālīkālarātrī-kālakarṇī-śvetānāṃ paṭṭīṣu kalaśāḥ /
pūrvādidvāraviśvābjaraviṣu vajrāṅkuśyādīnāṃ vajrāṅkuśādīni catvārī /


		13.3.19 Vajradhātumaṇḍala (p.269)

vajradhātumaṇḍale viśvapadmasya karṇikācandre bhagavato vajradhātoḥ śubhraṃ pañcasūcikavajraṃ /
varaṭakapūrvādidigdalenduṣu pradakṣiṇaṃ yathākramaṃ sattvavajrī-ratnavajrī-dharmavajrī-karmavajrīṇāṃ pañcaśukaraktavajraṃ pañcaśūkavajraśikharatnaṃ pañcaśukavajrāṅkitāṣṭadalasitaraktāmbujaṃ pañcatathāgatavarṇaviśvavajraṃ /
pūrvādipadmakarṇikācandrabimbeṣu yathākramam akṣobhya-ratnasambhava-amitābha-amoghasiddhīnāṃ nīlapañcaśūkavajravajraratnavajrapadmaviśvavajrāṇi /
akṣobhyapadmasya pūrvādidigdalenduṣu vajrasattva-vajrarāja-varjarāga-vajrasādhūnāṃ yathākramaṃ pañcaśūkavajraṃ vajrāṅkuśo bāṇo vajraṃ / ratnasambhavābjasya vajraratna-vajratejo-vajraketu-vajrahāsānāṃ nīlapañcaśūkavajradvayāṅkitaratnamālā sūryaś cintāmaṇidhvajo dhantapaṅkiyuktavajraṃ / amitābhasya vajradharma-vajratīkṣṇa-vajrahetu-vajrabhāṣāṇāṃ raktapadmaṃ kṛpāṇo 'ṣṭāracakram ekaśūkavajrajihvā / amoghaśiddher vajrakarma-vajrarakṣa-vajrayakṣa-vajrasandhīnāṃ viśvavajraṃ vajrakavaco vajrāṅkadaṃṣṭrā pañcaśūkakuliśaṃ / akṣobhyādīnāṃ pratyekaṃ tṛtīyabodhisattvacihnam uttaradale caturthacihnaṃ tu paścimadale likhitavyaṃ /
āgnyeādipadmakarṇikenduṣu vajralāsyā-vajramālā-vajragītā-vajranṛtyānāṃ vajraṃ ratnamālā vīṇā vajraṃ /
garbhakūṭāgārād bahiḥ paṭṭikāyāṃ pūrvasyāṃ maitreya-amoghadarśi-sarvāpāyañjaha-sarvaśokatamonirghātamatīnāṃ padmenduṣu pañcaśūcikavajrāṇi / dakṣiṇasyāṃ gandhahasti-śūraṅgama-gaganagañja-jñānaketūnām abjenduṣu vajraratnāni / paścimāyāṃ amitaprabha-candraprabha-bhadrapāla-jālinīprabhāṇāṃ ambujenduṣu vajrapadmāni / uttarasyāṃ vajragarbha-akṣayamati-pratibhānakūṭa-samantabhadrāṇāṃ abjenduṣu viśvavajrāṇi /
bāhyamaṇḍalāgnyādikoṇānām abjenduṣu vajradhūpā-vajrapuṣpā-vajrālokā-vajragandhānāṃ pūrvavac cihnāni /
pūrvādidvārapadmacandreṣu vajrāṅkuśa-vajrapāśa-vajrasphoṭa-vajrāveśānāṃ cihnāni /
paṭṭīṣu kalaśāḥ /



		13.3.20 Mañjuvajramaṇḍala (p.272)

tricatvāriṃśadātmakamañjuvajramaṇḍale bāhyamaṇḍale nīlaraktaśvetaharitapītāḥ pañcabhittayaḥ pūrvādidiṅmadhyabhūmayaś ca sarvā / dvitīyamaṇḍale nīlaśvetapītās tisro bhittayaḥ / tṛtīyacakre śvetaikā bhittiḥ /
tatra pītamadhyabhūau viśvapadmacandre mañjuśriyaḥ pītamuṣṭiḥ khaḍgaḥ /
pūrvādikoṣṭhasūryeṣv akṣobhya-ratnasambhava-amitābha-amoghasiddhīnāṃ nīlavajraṃ ratnaṃ śuklapadmaṃ khaḍgaḥ / aiśānyādikoṣṭhenduṣu locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārāṇāṃ pītavajraṃ nīlavajraṃ śvetavajraṃ haritavajraṃ /
dvitīyapuṭamaṇḍale pūrvādidikṣv induṣu sattvavajrī-ratnavajrī-dharmavajrī-karmavajrīnāṃ akṣobhyādīnāṃ iva cihnāni / aiśānādikoṇenduṣu cundā-ratnolkā-bhṛkuṭī-vajraśṛṅkhalānāṃ khaḍgaḥ pītaratnaṃ śuklavajraṃ haritavajraśṛṅkhalā /
tṛtīyapuṭamaṇḍale pūrvenduṣu maitreya-mañjuśrī-gandhahasti-jñānaketūnāṃ sapuṣpanāgakeśarapallavaḥ khaḍgaḥ kalaśasthakarikaraḥ pītacintāmaṇiḥ / dakṣiṇenduṣu bhadrapāla-sāgarmaty-akṣayamati-pratibhānakūṭānāṃ raktaśuklapītaharitabāṇāḥ / paścimeduṣu mahāsthāmaprāpta-sarvāpāyañjaha-sarvaśokatamonirghātamati-jālinīprabhāṇāṃ śuklapadmaṃ śubhrabāṇaḥ pītabāṇo raktotpalasthasūryaḥ / uttarenduṣu candraprabha-amitaprabha-gaganagañja-sarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhiṇāṃ utpalasthacandro raktakalaśaḥ pītabāṇo nīlabāṇaḥ / atra ca yathākramaṃ prāgādidvārāṇāṃ dvayoḥ pārśvayoḥ paṭṭikāyāṃ cihnadvayaṃ dvayaṃ /
pūrvādidvārasūryeṣu yamāntaka-aparājita-hayagrīva-amṛtakuṇḍalīnāṃ kṛṣṇamuṣṭikhaḍgaḥ pītavajraṃ raktavajradaṇḍo nīlamuṣṭikhaḍgaḥ / aiśānādikoṇabhānuṣv acala-ṭakkirāja-nīladaṇḍa-mahābalānāṃ khaḍgo nīlavajraṃ nīlavajradaṇḍo nīlavajradaṇḍaḥ / yamāntakacihnād bahir bhānau sumbhasya khaḍgaḥ / hayagrīva-cihnād bahiḥ sūrye vajrapātālasya vajrāṅkuśaḥ /
sarveṣāṃ sūryendūnām adho viśvapaṅkajāni / paṭṭīṣu kalaśāḥ / kecit tu yamāricihnād bahir bhānāv uṣṇīṣacakriṇaś cakraṃ / tato bahiḥ sumbhasya khaḍga ity āhuḥ /


		13.3.21 Dharmadhātuvāgīśvaramaṇḍala 
		13.3.21.1 (p.276)

dharmadhātuvāgīśvaramaṇḍale 'bhyantaracakraṃ śvetaraṅgaiḥ pūraṇīyam anyat pūrvavat /
madhyamaṇḍalamadhye viśvapadmakarṇikācanre mañjughoṣasya pītamuṣṭiḥ khaḍgaḥ /
pūrvādyaiśānādipatracanreṣu yathākramaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ mahoṣṇīṣa-tejorāsi-sitātapatra-vijayoṣṇīṣa-vikiraṇa-udgata-mahodgata-jayānāṃ aṣṭoṣṇīṣāṇāṃ pītacakrāni /
pūrvakoṣṭhasya madhye viśvābjasūrye 'kṣobhyasya nīlavajraṃ / aiśānādividigviśvapadmacanreṣu vajrasattva-vajrarāja-vajrarāga-vajrasādhūnāṃ vajraṃ vajrāṅkuśo bāṇo vajraṃ /
dakṣiṇakoṣṭhasya madhye viśvābjaravau ratnasambhavasya pītacintāmaṇidhvajaḥ / aiśānyādividigviśvābjenduṣu vajraratna-vajrasūrya-vajraketu-vajrahāsānāṃ pañca-śukavajradvayāṅkitaratnamālā sūryamaṇḍalaṃ cintāmaṇidhvajo dantapaṅktiyuktavajraṃ /
paścimakoṣṭhasya madhye viśvābjaravāv amitābhasya raktapadmaṃ / aiśānādividigviśvābjenduṣu vajradharma-vajratīkṣṇa-vajrahetu-vajrabhāṣānāṃ padmaṃ khaḍgo dharmacakram ekaśūkavajrajihvā /
uttarakoṣṭhasya madhye viśvābjasūrye 'moghasiddheḥ khaḍgaḥ / aiśānādividigviśvābjenduṣu vajrakarma-vajrarakṣa-vajrayakṣa-vajrasandhīnāṃ trisūcikavajraṃ vajrakavaco vajrāṅkadaṃṣṭrā pañcaśūlakuliśaṃ /
aiśānādikoṇakoṣṭhābjenduṣu locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārāṇāṃ cihnāni mañjughoṣa-akṣobhya-amitābha-amoghasiddhicihnavat /
pūrvādidvāraviśvābjasūryeṣu vajrāṅkuṣa-vajrapāśa-vajrasphoṭa-vajrāveśānāṃ vajrāṅkuśādayaḥ /


		13.3.21.2 (p.278)

ato garbhamaṇḍalād dvitīye maṇḍale pūrvasyāṃ diśi viśvapadmenduṣu dvādaśānām adhimukticaryā-pramuditā-vimalā-prabhākarī-arciṣmatī-sudurjayā-abhimukhī-dūraṅgamā-acalā-sādhumatī-dharmameghā-samantaprabhābhūmīnāṃ yathākramaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ ratkapadmaṃ cintāmaṇiḥ sitapadmaṃ viśvapadmasthasūrya utpalaṃ marakatamaṇiḥ padmasthaprajñāpāramitāpustakaṃ viśvābjopari viśvavajraṃ sanālapadmacandrasthapañcaśūcikaraktavajraṃ utpalopari khaḍgo dharmameghaparikaritaprajñāpāramitāpustakaṃ padmasthasambuddhabimbaṃ /
dakṣiṇasyāṃ viśvābjenduṣu dvādaśānāṃ ratnapadmapāramitā-dāna-śīla-kṣānti-vīrya-dhyāna-prajñā-upāya-praṇidhāna-bala-jñāna-vajrakarmapāramitānāṃ padmopari candramaṇḍalaṃ nānādhānyaratnamañjarī sapallavāśokapuṣpastavakaṃ sitapadmaṃ nīlotpalaṃ sitapadmaṃ padmasthaprajñāpāramitāpustakaṃ pītābjasthavajraṃ utpalasthakhaḍgaḥ prajñāpāramitāpustakaṃ nānāratnaphalālaṅkṛtabodhivṛkṣalatā utpalasthaviśvavajraṃ /
paścimāyāṃ viśvābjenduṣu dvādaśānām āyuś-citta-pariṣkāra-karma-upapatti-ṛddhi-adhimukti-praṇidhāna-jñāna-dharmavaśitānāṃ tathatāyā buddhabodheś ca padmarāgamaṇisthasamādhimudrāmitāyurbuddhabimbaṃ ratkapañcaśūkavajraṃ cintāmaṇidhvajo viśvavajraṃ vividhavarṇajātilatā padmasthasūryacandramaṇḍalaṃ priyaṅgukusumamañjarī nīlotpalaṃ utpalasthakhaḍgaḥ padmasthabhadraghaṭaḥ sitapaṅkajaṃ pītābjasthapañcaśūkavajraṃ /
uttarasyāṃ viśvābjenduṣu dvādaśadhāraṇīnāṃ vasumatī-ratnolkā-uṣṇīṣavijayā-mārīci-parṇaśabarī-jāṅgulī-anantamukhā-cundā-prajñāvardhanī-sarvakarmāvaraṇa-viśodhanī-akṣayajñānakaraṇḍā-sarvabuddhadharmakośavatīnāṃ dhānyamañjarī cintamaṇidhvajaś candrakāntamaṇikalaśaḥ sasūtrasūcī mayūrapicchikā viṣapuṣpamañjarī raktapdamasthākṣayamahānidhikalaśo 'kṣasūtrāvalambitakamaṇḍalu nīlotpalasthakhaḍgas triśūkavajrāṅkitasitaraktakamalaṃ ratnakaraṇḍakaḥ padmasthanānāratnapeṭakaḥ /
pūrvādidvārāmbhojasūryeṣu dharmapratisaṃvid-arthapratisaṃvin-niruktipratisaṃvit-pratibhānapratisaṃvidāṃ vajrāṅkuśo ratnapāśa-ubhayāntapadmāṅkitaśṛṅkhalā-triśūkavajrāṅkaghaṇṭāḥ / āgneyādikoṇeṣu lāsyā-mālā-gītā-nṛtyānāṃ vajraṃ ratnamālā vīṇā varjaṃ /


		13.3.21.3 (p.282)

tṛtīyamaṇḍale padmacandreṣu pūrvasyāṃ diśi samantabhadrasya utpalasthakhaḍgaḥ / akṣayamateḥ khaḍgaḥ / kṣitigarbhasya padmasthakalpavṛkṣaḥ / ākāśagarbhasya ratnaṃ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ gaganagañjasya cintāmaṇiḥ / ratnapāṇe ratnaṃ / sāgaramateḥ śaṅkhaḥ / vajragarbhasya vajraṃ / paścimāyāṃ avalokiteśvarasya padmaṃ / mahāsthāmaprāptasya khaḍgaḥ / candraprabhasya savajracakraṃ / jālinīprabhasya khaḍgaḥ / uttarasyāṃ padmenduṣu amitaprabha-pratibhānakūṭa-sarvaśokatamonirghātamati-sarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhiṇāṃ viśvapadmaṃ padmasthakhaḍgaḥ pañcaśūkavajraṃ khaḍgaḥ /
pūvādidvārābjabhānuṣu yamāntaka-prajñāntaka-padmāntaka-vighnāntakānām aṅkuśapāśasphoṭaghaṇṭāḥ / īśānādikoṇaviśvābjasūryeṣu trailokyavijaya-vajrajvālānalārka-hetukavajra-paramāśvānāṃ khaḍgavajravajraviśvavajrāṇi / yamāntakacihnād bahir uṣṇīṣacakriṇaḥ pītacakraṃ / padmāntakacihnād bahiḥ sumbhasya vajraṃ /
trailokyavijayādicihnebhyaś caturbhyo bāhye tṛtīyamaṇḍalasyaiva koṇābhyantare rekhāṃ dadyāt / tasyā bāhye sthāne āgneyādikoṇasūtrāṇāṃ dakṣiṇapārśvasthapadmenduṣu puṣpā-dhūpā-dīpā-gandhānāṃ puṣpapuṭaṃ dhūpakaṭacchukaṃ ratnadīpayaṣṭiḥ śaṅkhaṃ vāmapārśvasthapadmenduṣu vajrarūpa-vajraśabda-vajrarasā-vajrasparśānāṃ darpaṇaṃ vajravīṇā rasabhājanaṃ viśvavastraṃ /


		13.3.21.4 (p.284)

bāhyavajrakulamaṇḍale padmeṣu pūrvādidikṣv indra-yama-varuṇa-kuberāṇāṃ vajraṃ kṛṣṇadaṇḍo nāgapāśo 'ṅkuśaḥ / aiśānyādividikṣv īśāna-agni-nairṛti-vāyūnāṃ triśūlaṃ śruvaḥ khaḍgaḥ vātapaṭaḥ /
tata īśānasya bahiḥ samīpe aiśānīṃ diśam ārabhya cihnāni kramato likhyāni / tatra brahmaṇo 'kṣasūtraṃ viṣṇoś cakraṃ / maheśvarasya triśūlaṃ / kārtikeyasya śaktiḥ / 
brahmāṇyā akṣasūtraṃ / rudrāṇyās triśūlaṃ / vaiṣṇavyāś cakraṃ / kaumāryāḥ śaktiḥ / indrāṇyā vajraṃ / vārāhyā rohitamatsyaḥ / cāmuṇḍāyāḥ karttiḥ / bhṛṅgiṇo 'kṣamālā / gaṇapateḥ parśuḥ / mahākālasya triśūlaṃ / nandikeśvarasya murajaḥ /
ādityasya padmasthasūryamaṇḍalaṃ / candrasya kumudasthacandramaṇḍalaṃ / maṅgalasya kaṭṭāraḥ / budhasya bāṇaḥ / bṛhaspater akṣasūtraṃ / śukrasyākṣasūtraṃ / śanaiścarasya kṛṣṇadaṇḍaḥ / rāhoś candraḥ / ketor nāgapāśaḥ / balabhadrasya lāṅgalaṃ / jayakarasya puṣpamālā / madhukarasya makaradhvajaḥ / vasantasya bāṇaḥ /
ananta-vāsuki-takṣaka-karkkoṭaka-padma-mahāpadma-śaṅkhapāla-kulikānām api sampuṭāñjaliḥ / athavā svasvapitṛcihnasadṛśaṃ cihnaṃ/ tatrānanta-kulikau brāhmaṇāv agneḥ putrau / vāsuki-śaṅkhapālau kṣatriyāv indrasya / takṣaka-mahāpadmau vaiśyau vāyoḥ / karkkoṭaka-padmau śūdrau varaṇasya /
vemacitri-bali-prahlāda-vairocanādimahāsurendrāṇāṃ khaḍgādinānāpraharaṇāni / garuḍendrasya sampuṭāñjaliḥ / drumasya kinnararājendrasya vīṇā / pañcaśikhasya gandharvarājendrasya vīṇā / sarvārthasiddhasya vidyādhararājendrasya kusumamālā / pūrṇabhadra-māṇibhadra-dhanada-vaiśravaṇa-civikuṇḍali-kelimāli-mukhendra-carendrāṇāṃ yakṣāṇāṃ bījapūraphalāni / hārītyā jaḍīdvayaṃ /
aśvinī-bharaṇī-kṛttikā-rohiṇī-mṛgaśirā-ārdrā-punarvasu-puṣyā-aśleṣā-maghā-pūrvaphālgunī-uttaraphālgunī-hastā-citrā-svātī-viśākhā-anurādhā-jyeṣṭhā-mūlā-pūrvāṣādhā-uttarāṣādhā-śravaṇā-dhaniṣṭhā-śatabhiṣā-pūrvabhādrapadā-uttarabhādrapadā-revatī-abhijīnāṃ samputāñjalikaramudrāḥ /
atrāpi dvāreṣu vajrāṅkuśādīni / kalaśāś caturthamaṇḍale /


		13.3.22 Durgatipariśodhanamaṇḍala (p.288)

durgatipariśodhanamaṇḍale nīlavajrāvalyā abhyantare pītāṣṭāracakrasya vedyāṃ pītadharmacakramudrā /
pūrvādyareṣu śubhrabhūsparśamudrānīlavaradamudrāraktadhyānamudrāharitābhayamudrāḥ / agnyādyareṣu sūryaś cintāmaṇidhvajo 'siś chattraṃ /
vajrāvalīto bahir vahnyādikoṇeṣu lāsyādicihnāni pūrvādipaṭṭīṣu dvārasya vāme cihnadvayaṃ savye ca / tatra nāgakeśarakusumaṃ sanetrābjam aṅkuśo daṇḍaḥ śaṅkhaṃ khaḍgaḥ / padmasthadharmagañjaś cintāmaṇidhvajo 'mṛtakalaśaḥ padmasthacandrabimbaṃ ratnaṃ vajrapañrajaṃ savajrendīvaram amṛtaghaṭo 'bjastharatnaṃ ratnamañjarī ca / agnyādikoṇeṣu puṣpādicihnāni / dvāreṣu vajrāṅkuśādīni /
saptatriṃśad api cihnāni viśvābjacandrasthāni / nīlakaṇṭhādicihnāni na likhyante 'pi /


		13.3.23 Bhūtaḍāmaramaṇḍala (p.290)

bhūtaḍāmaramaṇḍale sitapītaraktaharitakṛṣṇāḥ pañcabhittayaḥ pūrvādibhūmayaś ca / sūtrarekhātrayaṃ śvetaraktakṛṣṇavarṇā ekasūtrarekhā kṛṣṇā vajravalayarekhe ca / garbhapuṭasya madhye koṣṭhe viśvapadmacandre bhagavato bhūtaḍāmarasya pañcaśūlanīlavajraṃ /
pūrve maheśvarasya sūrye triśūlaṃ / dakṣiṇe viṣṇoḥ sūrye cakraṃ / paścime brahmaṇaś candre 'kṣamālā / uttare kārtikeyasya sūrye śaktiḥ / aiśāne gaṇapateś candre parśuḥ / āgneye rave ravau padmasthasūryamaṇḍalaṃ / nairṛte rāhoḥ sūrye candramaṇḍalaṃ / vāyave nandikeśvarasya candre ḍamaruḥ /
dvitīyapuṭe purvādidikṣu śrītilottamā-śaśī-umānāṃ candreṣu śvetābjaṃ dhūpakaṭacchuḥ dīpayaṣṭir bhogākārakaraḥ / āgneyyādiṣu ratnaśrī-sarasvatī-surasundarī-ābhūtīnāṃ yathākramaṃ candreṣu gandhaśaṅkhaṃ vīṇā ratnamamālā triśūkavajraṃ /
tṛtīyapuṭe pūrvādidikṣv indra-yama-varuṇa-kuberāṇāṃ candrasthavajraṃ sūryasthakapālāṅkitadaṇḍaś candrasthanāgapāśaś candrasthagadā / āgneyādividikṣv agini-nairṛti-vāyu-candrāṇāṃ sūraysthākṣasūtraṃ sūryasthakhaḍgaś candrasthavātapaṭaś candre kumudasthacandramaṇḍalaṃ / candracihnasamīpe īśānasya sūrye triṣūlaṃ /
caturthapuṭe purvādidikṣu siṃhadhvajadhāriṇī-vibhūtī-mahāpadmavatī-surahāriṇīnāṃ candreṣu siṃhadhvajo 'ṅkuśo bāṇaś cintāmaṇiḥ / aiśānyādiṣu varahārī-ratneśvarī-bhūṣaṇī-jagatpālanīnāṃ candreṣu puṣpapuṭo dhūpakaṭacchur gandhaśaṅkho dīpayaṣṭiḥ /
atra sarva ravīndavo viśvapadmasthāḥ / kalaśāś caturthapuṭe /


		13.3.24 Pañcaḍākamaṇḍala (p.292)

pañcaḍākamaṇḍale madhyakūṭāgarasya madhye saprajñāhevajrasya karttikapālau / pūrvādivāreṣu gaurī-caurī-vettālī-ghasmarīṇāṃ vajrāṅkuśapāśasphoṭaghaṇṭāḥ / aiśānādikoṇeṣu pukkasī-śabarī-caṇḍālī-ḍombīnāṃ bodhicittaghaṭo merur bahnikuṇḍaṃ mahādhvajapatākā /
tasmāt pūrvakūṭāgārasya madhye śāśvatasya kapālasthamayūraḥ / pūrvādidvāreṣu saṃdaṃśā-pāśnī-vāgurā-aṅkuśadhāriṇīnāṃ saṃdaṃśaḥ pāśo vāgurāṅkuśaḥ / aiśānādiṣu puṣpā-dhūpā-dīpā-gandhānāṃ puṣpakaraṇḍo dhūpakaṭacchur dīpayaṣṭiḥ pītagandhapūrṇaśaṅkhaḥ /
dakṣiṇakūṭāgārasya madhye vajrasūryasya kapālasthakāraṇḍavaḥ pakṣī / pūrvādidvāreṣu sūryahastā-dīpā-ratnolkā-taḍitkarāṇāṃ sūryamaṇḍalaṃ dīpayaṣṭhī ratnaṃ vidyullatā / aiśānādiṣu lāsyā-mālā-gītā-nṛtyānāṃ vajraṃ ratnamālā kaṃsikā vajraṃ / pścimakūṭāgarasya madhye padmanarteśvarasya kapālasthabhallūkaḥ / prāgādidvāreṣu padmā-dharmodayā-sphoṭā-svāśleṣāṇāṃ  padmaṃ dharmodayā sphoṭo vajraṃ / aiśānādiṣu vaṃśā-vīṇā-mukundā-murajānāṃ svasvavādyāni /
uttaramaṇḍalasya madhye paramāśvasya kapālasthabudhaḥ / prāgādidvāreṣu tālā-kuñcī-kapāṭā-paṭadhāriṇīnāṃ tālikā kuñcikā kapāṭaṃ kāṇḍapaṭaḥ / aiśānādiṣu locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārānāṃ cakraṃ vajraṃ padmaṃ utpalaṃ /
bāhyamahāmaṇḍalasya dvāreṣu gauryādicihnāni / aiśānādiṣu pukkasyādicihnāni /
etāni sarvacihnāni viśvapadmasūryasthāni / śāśvatasyaiva candrāsanasthaṃ / pratimaṇḍalam amṛtakalaśāḥ / mahāmaṇḍala eveti kaścit /


		13.3.25 Ṣaṭcakravartimaṇḍala (p.295)

ṣaṭcakravartimaṇḍale viśvapadmeṣu sūryasthāni cihnāni buddhaḍākasya paraṃ candrasthaṃ / ṣaṇṇām api kūṭāgārāṇāṃ koṇeṣu kapālāni viśvapadmasthāni /
tatra garbhamaṇḍalasya madhye padme vajrasattvasya vajraṃ / vidikpadmeṣu ḍākinī-lāmā-khaṇḍarohā-rūpiṇīnāṃ ḍamaravaḥ / prāgādidvāreṣu vāmāvartenāgnyādividikṣu dakṣiṇāvartenetīha nyāsakramaḥ / dvārābjeṣu khaṇḍakapāla-pracaṇḍayor mahākaṅkāla-caṇḍākṣyoḥ kaṅkāla-prabhāvatyor vikaṭadaṃṣṭri-mahānāsayoś catvāri vajrāṇi / valayamadhye vajrāvalī /
buddhaḍākasya maṇḍale madhyābje cakraṃ / dvārābjeṣu surāvairi-vīramatyor amitābha-kharvaryor vajraprabha-laṅkeśvaryor vajradeha-drumacchāyayoś ca cakrāṇi / valayamadhye cakrāvalī /
rantaḍākasya maṇḍale madhye ratnaṃ / dvārābjeṣu aṅkulika-airāvatyor vajrajaṭila-mahābhairavayor mahāvīra-vāyuvegayor vajrahūṃkāra-surābhakṣyoś ca ratnāni / valayamadhye ratnāvalī /
padmaḍākasya maṇḍale madhye padmaṃ / dvārābjeṣu subhadra-śyāmādevyor vajrabhadra-subhadrayor mahābhairava-hayakarṇayor virūpākṣa-khagānanayoś ca padmāni / valayamadhye padmāvalī /
vajraḍākasya maṇḍale madhye vajraṃ / dvārābjeṣu mahābala-cakravegayo ratnavajra-khaṇḍarohayor hayagrīva-śauṇḍinyor ākāśagarbha-cakravarmiṇyoś ca vajrāṇi / valayamadhye vajrāvalī /
viśvaḍākasya maṇḍale madhye viśvavajraṃ / dvārapadmeṣu heruka-suvīrayoḥ padmanarteśvara-mahābalayor vairocana-cakravartinyor vajrasattva-mahāvīryayoś ca viśvavajrāṇi / valayamadhye viśvavajrāvalī /
mahākūṭāgārasya dvāreṣu kākāsyā-ulūkāsyā-śvānāsyā-śukarāsyānāṃ vajrāṅkuśapāśasphoṭaveśāḥ / koṇeṣu yamadāḍhī-yamadūtī-yamadaṃṣṭrī-yamamathanīnāṃ darpaṇavīṇāgandhaśaṅkharasabhājanāni kalaśāś ca yathāyogaṃ /


		13.3.26 (p.298)

evam uktānasārato maṇḍalāntareṣv api rajaḥpātanam anusaṃdheyaṃ / atra tu granthavistaratrāsān na pratipāditaṃ /

		
		13.3.27 Kalācakramaṇḍala 
		13.3.27.1 (p.299)

kalācakramaṇḍale tūktarajovarṇakramataḥ prāyaśo visadṛśo rajovarṇakrama ucyate /
cittacakrasyābhyantarabhūmiḥ sarvā dvitīyavajrāvalīparyantā kṛṣṇā / cittavākkāyamaṇḍalānāṃ pūrvā bhūmiḥ sarvā kṛṣṇā / dakṣiṇā raktā / paścimā pītā / uttarā śubhrā / vedī śvetā /ratnapaṭṭī raktā / tasyāṃ ratnabandho vicitraḥ / hārārdhahārabhūmiḥ kṛṣṇā / tasyāṃ hārārdhahāraṃ śvetaṃ / kṛṣṇabhuvi bakulī śuklā / kṛṣṇabhūmau kramaśīrṣāṇi śubhrāṇi / toraṇastambhāḥ pītāḥ /
cittamaṇḍale tu nāyakapadmaṃ haritaṃ / śāntyādiṣu tu sitavarṇādikaṃ bhavati / vajrāvalī ṣoḍaśastambhāś ca kṛṣṇāḥ / pūrve kṛṣṇakhaḍgair dakṣiṇe raktaratnaiḥ paścime pītacakrair uttare śvetapadmair yuktāḥ / aṣṭau kalaśāḥ śuklāḥ kamalasthāḥ kamalamaṇḍitamukhāś ca / sarvatrāsanakamalasya tṛtīyabhāgā karṇikā /
dvitīyavajrāvalī haritā / devatāpaṭṭī śuklā / bhittirekhās tisro garbhāt prabhṛti sitaraktakṛṣṇavarṇās tāsāṃ bhūmir navabhāgā tatra bhāgam ekaṃ tyaktvā bhāgadvaye pratyaekaṃ rekhākhacitaṃ vajraratnair dvāraniryūhasandhiṣu / toraṇāni dvādaśa nānāvarṇāni /
vāṅmaṇḍale devatāpaṭṭī śuklā / tasyāṃ aṣṭau padmāni candrasūryarahitāni / diṣu raktāni / koṇeṣu śubhrāṇi / garbhāt prabhṛti haritakṛṣṇaraktasitapītavarṇāḥ pañcarekhāḥ / tāsāṃ bhūmiḥ pañcadaśabhāgā tatra prāgvad rekhā /
kāyamaṇḍale devatāpaṭṭikā śuklā / tasyāṃ padmāni candrasūryarahitāni / pañcarekhā vāṅmaṇḍalavat /


		13.3.27.2 (p.301)

toraṇastambhānām adho vedīsthāneṣu phaṇināṃ āsanāni pratyekaṃ dvādaśamātrāṇi / tatra pūrvasyāṃ diśi vṛttadvayaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ upari dhvajau / dakṣiṇasyāṃ trikoṇadvayaṃ ratkaṃ svastikalāñchitaṃ / paścimāyāṃ dvayaṃ caturasraṃ pītaṃ vajrāṅkaṃ / uttarasyāṃ dvayam ardhacandrākāraṃ śubhraṃ padmāṅkaṃ / pūrvasyāṃ savyavṛttasya sarvye 'mṛtakalaśo jayanāmno nāgarājasya / paścimāyāṃ vāmacaturasrasya vāme 'mṛtakalaśo vijayanāmnaḥ /
pūrve toraṇe prathamapurasya mattavāraṇopari madhyacaturasre dharmacakraṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tasya savyavāmayor mṛgamṛgyau kṛṣṇe / dakṣiṇe raktavarṇo bhadraghaṭas tasya savyavāmayoḥ śaṅkhapadmau raktau / paścime bodhivṛkṣaḥ pītas tasya savyavāmayoḥ kinnarakinnaryau pīte / uttare dumdubhiḥ sitā tasyāḥ savyavāmayor daṇḍamudgarau pāṇḍarau / kramaśīrṣapṛthivīvalayayor madhye bhūmiḥ kṛṣṇā tasyāṃ yathāśobhaṃ pūjāvastūni likhet /
pṛthvīvalayaṃ pītaṃ tasminn aiśānyāṃ vidiśy udayat pūrṇimācandramaṇḍalaṃ dvādaśamātraṃ / nairṛtyāṃ astaṃgacchan sūryo dvādaśamātraḥ / jalavalayaṃ śuklaṃ / vahnivalayo raktaḥ / vāyuvalayaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ / tayor agnivāyuvalayayor madhye pratyekaṃ dvādaśamātrāṇy aṣṭāv aṣṭārāṇi śmaśānacakrāṇi / dikṣu raktāni vidikṣu sitāni pūrvacakrād bahiḥ śūnyamaṇḍalaṃ paścimacakrād bahiḥ śūnyamaṇḍalaṃ / śūnyamaṇḍalayor likhanaṃ sādhanapaṭaloktanyāyena /
daśasv api chinaṃ karttikā / vāyuvalaye nānācihnāni likhyante / na cātra kāmacāraḥ / ākāśavalayaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ / tasya pārśvadvayaṃ tritrimātraṃ kṛtvā tatra ghūṇadvayaṃ madhye ṣaṇmātre haritā vajrāvalī kartavyā / raśmijvālāḥ pañcavarṇāḥ /


		13.3.27.3 (p.304)

unnatiḥ punar garbhamaṇḍale kṛṣṇarajaso yavasyaikapādaḥ pūrvasyāṃ diśi / raktasya dvau dakṣiṇasyāṃ pītasya catvāraḥ paścimāyāṃ śvetasya traya uttarasyāṃ / 
bhittirekhāṇāṃ unnatiḥ pītarajastriguṇā vajrāvalīnāṃ ca / anyā rekhā pītarajaso dviguṇā / padmānāṃ dviguṇatvaṃ paṭṭikātaḥ / candrasūryayor abjarekhātaḥ / evam uktonnatibhyo vāṅmaṇḍale dviguṇā unnatayaḥ tābhyo dviguṇāḥ kāyamaṇḍale / kramaśīrṣād bāhyapūjābhūmāv eko yavaḥ / pṛthivyādivalayeṣu ghūṇadvaye ca kāyamaṇḍalabhittirekhāmānenonnatiḥ / apararajaḥpātaḥ sarvatra dviguṇabhedena samānaḥ sarvabhūmiṣu / vajraprākārāṇāṃ triguṇas trivalayapramāṇaḥ /

	
		13.3.27.4 (p.305)

tatra nāyakasya karṇikāyāṃ karṇikā tulyasitaraktakṛṣṇaraktacandrasūryarāhukālāgnimaṇḍalopari nīlatriśūkavajraṃ bhagavataḥ kālacakrasya /
pūrve dale dhūpakaṭacchuḥ kṛṣṇā / dakṣiṇe dīpo raktaḥ / paścime śaṅkhaḥ pītaḥ / uttare nivedyaṃ śuklaṃ / āgneyādiṣu kṛṣṇaraktaśuklapītacāmarās tadbahir īśāne dharmaśaṅkhaḥ sitaḥ / agnau cintāmaṇiḥ kṛṣṇaḥ / nairṛtye dharmagaṇḍī raktā / vāyavye kalpavṛkṣaḥ pītaḥ /
dvitīyapuṭe pūrvaśubhrābjasūrye kṛṣṇakhaḍgaḥ / āgneyaraktābjendau nīlotpalaṃ / dakṣiṇasitābjasūrye raktanavāṃśaratnaṃ / nairṛtyaraktābjendau raktapadmaṃ / paścimasitābjaravau pītacakraṃ / vāyavyaraktābjendau pītacakraṃ / uttarasitābjasūrye sitapadmaṃ / īśānaraktābjendau sitotpalaṃ /
tṛtīyapuṭe paṭṭiāyāṃ pratidvāraṃ pārśvayor dvayaṃ ity aṣṭau padmāni / tatra ṣaṭsu sūryāḥ / paścimottaradvāravāmayoś candrau koṇapadmacandrāś catvāras teṣv īśānāt prabhṛti darpaṇavajrakhaḍgavastravajraratnarasapātradharmodayacakragandhaśaṅkhavīṇāpadmāni śuklakṛṣṇakṛṣṇakṛṣṇaharitaraktaraktaharitapītapītanīlaśuklāni / pūrvadvārasya padmasūrye kṛṣṇakhaḍgaḥ / dakṣiṇasya raktadaṇḍaḥ / paścimasya pītapadmaṃ / uttarasya sitamudgaraḥ /
iha sūryamaṇḍalāni śvetābjasthāni candramaṇḍalāni raktābjasthāni /
pūrvasyāṃ vedikāyāṃ toraṇastambhamūlavāme kṛṣṇaśaṅkhaḥ / savye nīlakusumamālā / dakṣiṇasyāṃ raktadhūpakaṭacchur dīpaḥ / paścimāyāṃ pītamukuṭaṃ pītahāraḥ / uttarasyāṃ sitaphalaṃ sitaṃ pīyūṣapūrṇapātraṃ / sarvāsu tu vedīṣu vividhādhāraṇyaḥ pūjādevyaḥ / pūrvatoraṇasya pūjādevīsthāne madhye vastraṃ / dakṣiṇasya padmaṃ / paścimasya paṭahaḥ / uttarasya vajraṃ /


		13.3.27.5 (p.308)

vāṅmaṇḍale tu pūrvapadmasya karṇikāyāṃ daleṣu ca kṛṣṇakarttikāḥ / āgneyasya cakrāṇi kṛṣṇāni / yāmyasya raktadaṇḍāḥ / nairṛtyasya raktaśaktayaḥ / paścimasya pītavajrāṇi / vāyavyasya pītabhrahmadaṇḍasūñayaḥ / uttarasya śuklatriśūlāni / aiśanasya śuklapadmāni / 
kāyamaṇḍale paṭṭikāyāṃ padmakarṇikādaleṣu cihnāni / tatra pūrvadvārasya savye khaḍgāḥ / āgneyyāṃ kalpavṛkṣāḥ / dakṣiṇadvārasya vāme vajrāṅkadaṇḍāḥ / savye śaktayaḥ / nairṛtye śaktayaḥ / kuntā vā / paścimadvārasya vāme ratnāni gadā vā / savye vajrāṇi / vāyavye sūcayaḥ / uttaradvārasya vāme triśūlāni / savye pāśāḥ / aiśānyāṃ parśavaḥ pūrvadvārasya vāme cakrāṇi /
pūrvadvāre daṇḍaḥ / tadbahir nīlatriśūlaṃ / uttaradvāre sitamuṣalaḥ / etāni daṇḍādicihnāni padmasūryasthāni /
vākkāyamaṇḍalayor dikṣu padmāni raktāni koṇapadmāni śuklāni / iha vāṅmaṇḍalasya vedyāṃ pūrvasyāṃ dvārasya savye kṛṣṇāny utpalavastrakartticakrakhatvāṅgāni / vāme karttikhaḍgakarttikarttikāḥ kṛṣṇāḥ / dakṣiṇasyāṃ dvārasya savye padmarasapātradaṇḍaśaktipadmāni raktāni / vāme bāṇaparśukarttikarttikā raktāḥ / paścimāyāṃ dvārasya savye cakragandhaśaṅkhavajraśūcicakrāṇi pītāni / vāme haritadharmodayā cakrakarttikarttikāḥ pītāḥ / uttarasyāṃ dvārasya savye śvetāny utpaladarpaṇatriśūlapadmotpalāni / vāme nīlavīnā mudgarakarttikarttikāḥ śuklāḥ / evaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśac cihnāni kāyamaṇḍalasyāpi vedīṣu /


		13.4 (p.310)

tato likhitaṃ mañjuvajrādyanyatamamaṇḍalaṃ sarvākāraparisphuṭībhūtaṃ vijñāya hūṃ-kāreṇa kuṇḍalinā ca japtasapañcāmṛtagandhāmbunā maṇḍalād bahir liptvā tajjaptajalena cakraṃ prokṣya śeṣarajāṃśi oṃ āḥ hūṃ vajra muḥ iti jñānarajo visṛjya rajo bhāṇḍasthāni vijane sthāpayed iti rajaḥpātanavidhiḥ /


		14. Kalaśanyāsavidhi 
		14.1 (p.311)

tadanu prāgadhivāsitakalaśān dakṣiṇāvartena nyaset /
tatra cakreśasya vijayakalaśaṃ maṇḍalacakrasya pradakṣiṇaṃ kārayitvā vajraprākārātmakacakravāḍajvālāvalībhūmer bahiḥ pūrvasya maṇḍaladvārasya sammukhe sthāne kiñcid dakṣiṇe sthāpayet / vāme pārśve yathākramaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ vairocana-locanā-sārvakarmikakalaśān / savye rūpavajrā-dharmadhātuvajrāyamārīnāṃ / dakṣiṇasya vāme ratnasambhava-māmakyoḥ / savye śabdavajrā-prajñāntakayoḥ / paścimasya vāme 'mitābha-pāṇḍarayoḥ / savye gandhavajrā-padmāntakayoḥ / uttarasya vāme 'moghasiddhi-tārayoḥ / savye rasavajrā-sparśavajrā-vighnārīṇāṃ /
yamāryādikordhānāṃ agnyādikoṇeṣv iti kaścit / tathāgatānantaraṃ krodhānaṃ kulamātṝnāṃ tu dvārasavyeṣv ity anyaḥ / etadanusārāt pakṣāntareṣu nyāsa unneyaḥ / matāntaram apy asti kiṃ tena / evam ayaṃ mañjuvajramaṇḍale nyāsaḥ /


		14.2 (p.312)

piṇḍīkramamaṇḍale vāme kulamātranantaraṃ savye ca prathamam aṣṭabodhisattvānāṃ koṇakrodhānāṃ koṇeṣu yamāryanantaram uṣṇīṣacakriṇaḥ / padmāntakānantaraṃ sumbhasyeti viśeṣaḥ / etadanusārāt maṇḍalāntareṣu ghaṭanyāsaḥ sugama iti na prapañcitaḥ / catuḥkoṇakalaśeṣu catvāraḥ kāṇḍāḥ sapakṣāḥ / oṃ vajrayakṣa hūṃ iti mantreṇa sthāpyā iti /
kālacakrarajomaṇḍalasya punar bāhye pūrvādidikṣu catvāraḥ kalaśāḥ pūrvasyāṃ jayakalaśo 'pi pañcamaḥ / tadupari vijayakalaśaḥ śaṅkhaḥ ṣaṣṭha iti pañcaghaṭapakṣe / daśakumbhapakṣe tv aṣṭadikṣv aṣṭau ghaṭāḥ / paścimakumbhād bahir dvyaṅgulāsparśena vijayakalaśaḥ / pūrvaghaṭād bahir dvyaṅgulāsparśena jayakalaśas tasyopari mahāvijayakalaśaḥ śaṅkha ekādaśaḥ / evaṃ śatasahasrakalaśeṣv api mahāvijayaśaṅkhaḥ / śāntau puṣtau sarvakramaṇi ceti kalaśanyāsavidhiḥ /


		15. Saparikaramaṇḍalasādhanavidhi 
		15.1 (p.314)

tataś caturdikṣu maṇḍalād bahir āryaprajñāpāramitādisaddharmacatuṣṭayaṃ pāṭhayitavyaṃ / karpūrāguruturuṣkādibhir dhūpaghaṭikā aṣṭau sthāpyāḥ / vicitravastrasahasrādikaṃ pratidaivatam ekaṃ vā yathāśaktir vā caṅgeḍādau kṛtvā chattradhvajapatākāś ca hūṃ-kāreṇādhipatimantreṇa ca japtvā oṃ vajra sphara khaṃ ity anena niryātya yathāsthānaṃ niveśayet / toraṇāni suvastrāṇi saghaṇṭācāmarāṇi ca pūrṇakumbhān sadalakadalīstambhāṃś ca /


		15.2 (p.315)

snātaḥ sugandhāṅgaḥ sottarāsaṅgoṣṇīṣābharaṇaḥ kuṇḍalijaptajalena maṇḍalaṃ prokṣya tryakṣareṇa kuṇḍalimantreṇa ca saṃrakṣya dhṛtavajravajraghaṇṭaḥ pūrvadvārasamīpe paścimānano niṣadya cakreśātmaka eva likhitamaṇḍalaṃ jhaṭiti śūnyatānantaraṃ rakṣācakravighanakīlanādividhiparikaritabhāvyamaṇḍalasvarūpaṃ nirūpya
	ṣoḍaśābdikāṃ prāpya yoṣitāṃ kāntisuprabhām /
	gandhapuṣpākulāṃ kṛtvā tasya madhye tu kāmayet //
	samadhiṣṭhya ca tāṃ prājño māmakīguṇamekhalām /
	sṛjed buddhapadaṃ saumyam ākāśadhātvalaṅkṛtam //
iti pravacanāt / prasādhitabāhyamudrāsamāpattyā tadabhāve jñānamudrāsamāpattyā vā samutsalitasuratadhvaninā samānītaṃ jñānacakraṃ pādyārghadānapuraḥsaraṃ svāntarniveśya mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya vajramārgeṇa nirgatya padme jñānadevatācakrātmakaṃ spharitvā yathāsthānaṃ samayacakre praviṣṭhaṃ vicintya cakṣuḥkāyādyadhiṣṭhānānantaraṃ svahṛdbījamayūkhākṛṣṭatathāgatadevībhir abhiṣicya yathāyogaṃ mudrayet / ajñātakulāṃs tv akṣobhyeṇa vajrasattvena vā /


		15.3 (p.317)

tadanu sphāritadevībhir manomayapūjayā pūjayitvā śīlalikāvastrayugaṃ vitānalambitavastraṃ ca traykṣaramantritakhādyabhojyalehyacoṣyapeyopahārādikaṃ svarṇakanyākarituragagavādikaṃ ca niryātya rūpavajrādirūpābhir bāhyayoginībhiḥ ṣoḍaśabhir aṣṭabhiś catasṛbhir vā svasvapūjayā pūjayitvā ghaṇṭāṃ vādayann akṣobhyavajretyādibhiḥ stutvā svasya prajñāyāś ca sakusumabodhicittaṃ padmabhājane prakṣipyāmṛtīkṛtaṃ ḍhaukayitvā / tadamṛtāsvādena saṃtarpya mahāsukhamayam adhimucya cakreśamantram aṣṭottaraśataṃ tadanyamāṇḍaleyamantram ekaviṃśativārān śatākṣaraṃ ca japet /
vakṣyamāṇāvidhinā sārvabhautikaṃ ca baliṃ dadyāt / sambhave saty uttarasādhakaṃ maṇḍale sthāpayitvā bahir nirgatya pūrvādidikṣu vakṣyamāṇasārvabhautikabalividhinā sveṣṭadevatendrādibhyo baliṃ dadyāt /
tato dakṣiṇahastam uttānaṃ kṛtvā madhyamānāmike īṣad ākuñcyābhimukhaṃ dhārayet / tadagreṇa jānvantaḥ karau kṛtvotkuṭukas tūṣṇīṃ karapuṣkarabhāgena vadanaṃ bahuśaḥ parāmṛṣya vāradvayaṃ trayaṃ vā karṇasrotasī cakṣuṣī mukhaṃ bhujau nābhim ūrdhvānaṃ ca spṛśed ity upasparśanavidhiṃ kuryāt /


		15.4 (p.320)

tadanusambhave nyūnādidoṣaśāntaye śāntikaṃ maṇḍalādhyāpanāya pauṣṭikaṃ ca homaṃ kṛtvā trailokyavijayayogavān kusumasrajam ādāya oṃ sumbha nisumbha hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ gṛhnāpaya gṛṇāpaya hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ ānaya ho bhagavan vidyārāja hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / iti Śrīsampuṭa-uktaṃ trailokyavijayamantram āvartayan vajravegena maṇḍalaṃ praviśya vajram ullālayan ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan vajrapadena tathaiva oṃ hūṃ phaṭ iti / oṃ hūṃ āḥ phaṭ  iti / oṃ hūṃ āḥ āḥ āḥ phaṭ iti / oṃ hūṃ hana māraya duṣṭān ghāṭaya ghāṭaya aḥ aḥ hūṃ hrīṃ phaṭ iti caturmantrān yathākramam uccārayadbhiḥ pūrvadakṣiṇādidvārācāryaiḥ saha triḥpradakṣinīkṛtyonātiriktadoṣaśāntaye cakraṃ nirīkṣya mālāṃ bhagavate niryātya yathāsaṃkhyaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ paścimadvārādicatuṣṭaye sthitaḥ pūrvādidvāracatuṣṭayaṃ oṃ vajrodghāṭaya samaya praveśaya hūṃ iti mantreṇodghāṭitaṃ vicintya oṃ samayaṃ praviśāmi ity uktvā punar mālāṃ nṛtyann ādāya svaśirasi baddhvā cakraṃ praṇamya sarvasattvānāṃ sarvasiddhīḥ prasādīkurudhvam iti vijñāpya dhyāyej japec ceti /


		15.5 (p.322)

iha maṇḍalagṛhād bahir aindrādiṣu yathākramaṃ sitā pāṭalā kṛṣṇā dhūmrā raktā śabalā pītā haritā cety aṣṭau patākā maṇḍaladevatābhyo niryātya pūrvādāv ucchrāpayed iti prajñāpālitaḥ /
bhagavatā ca buddhakapālatantre /
	caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ patākāṣṭavibhūṣitam //
ity uktaṃ vairocanasya tatkuladevatānāṃ ca patākā āgneyāṃ sthāpayet / ratneśatatkulīnānāṃ nirṛtyāṃ / amitābhatatkulajānāṃ vāyavyāṃ / amoghasiddhitatkuladevatānām aiśānyāṃ / cakreśasya pūrvasyāṃ tatkuladevatānāṃ tu svasvadikṣv iti kecit / pītendrasya kṛṣṇā viṣṇoḥ / sitendo lohitā raveḥ / pītā pitāmahasyaindryāṃ / raktā vahneḥ / kṛṣṇā yamasya / dhūmrā nairṛteḥ / svasvadiśi / paśimāyāṃ śuklā varaṇasya / pītā pṛthivyāḥ / kṛṣṇā vemacitriṇaḥ / vāyavyāṃ śyāmā vāyoḥ / udīcyāṃ pītā kuberasya / sitā gaṇapateḥ / aiśānyām īśānasya śukleti pañcadaśapatākā dikpatitoṣāya / asambhave tu yathāśaktipatāka dadyāt / iti saparikaramaṇḍalasādhanavidhiḥ /


Vajrāvalī nāma maṇḍalopāyikā_Vol.2


% Pratiṣṭhā

		16. devatādhivāsanavidhi
		16.1 (p.325)

tadanu tatra rajomaṇḍale paṭādimaṇḍale vā sākṣātkṛte vā manomayamaṇḍale yathoktapūjādipuraḥsaraṃ śiṣyapratiṣṭhām iva pratimādipratiṣṭhām api kuryāt / 
tatra maṇḍalāntare 'pi pūrvoktavidhinā prathamaṃ kalaśādhivāsananyāsau kṛtvā pratimādikaṃ śūnyatānantaraṃ bījādiniṣpannaṃ jhaṭiti vā samayasattvarūpaṃ svahṛdbījaṃ vicintya navīnaraktādivastrācchāditaṃ sapuṣpaṃ kṛtvā tadīyapuṣpamālām ādāya dānapatiḥ pratimādinā saha śiṣyavad rajomaṇḍalādīnām anyatamamaṇḍale praviśet / ācāryas tu pratimādyadhidaivatacihne tatkuleśacihne vā puṣpaṃ niveśayet /
athavā puṣpapātam antareṇaiva pratimādīnāṃ maṇḍaladarśanād eva praveśaḥ /


		16.2 (p.326)

tato maṇḍalāgārād bahiḥ pūrvasyāṃ diśi / tatrānavakāśe tv aiśānyāṃ nātidūre manorame sthāne snānavedīṃ caturhastāṃ caturasrāṃ hastadvayocchritām athavā dairghyeṇāṣṭahastāṃ tadardhocchrayāṃ. 
athavā dairghyeṇa dvādaśahastāṃ tadardhocchrayāṃ / śalyādidoṣarahitāṃ mṛnmayīm iṣṭakādimayīṃ vā tadabhāve yathālabdhāṃ yathāvasthitabhūmiṃ vālepanādibhir likhitavedikāṃ digvidikṣu sthāpitāṣṭakalaśāṃ sṛnmṛṣṭāṃ sāmṛtapañcagavyādiliptāṃ vitānasitacchatradhvajapatākāpūrṇakumbhakusumanṛtyagītavāditrādibhir yathāptair vā manoharāṃ kārayitvā śubhe tithivāranakṣatramuhūrtādau kṛtasnānahāranūpurakeyūrakarṇābharaṇakaṅkaṇāṅgulīyakādyābharaṇo yathāptābharaṇo vācāryo vajrasattvamūrtiḥ savidyas tasyā vedyā madhye viśvapadmaṃ paścimadvāracaturasraikarekhāveṣṭitaṃ rajobhir ālepanādibhir vā likhet /
athavā nistoraṇapaścimadvāracaturasramadhyagataṃ / athavā garbhamaṇḍalārdhamānaṃ caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ dvipuṭaṃ nistoraṇaṃ pūrvādipaṭikāsu cakraratnapadmakhaḍgān koṇeṣu caturmātṛcihnāni madhye viśvāṣṭadalakamalaṃ ceti saṃkṣiptamadhyavistarabhedāt tridhāsnānamaṇḍalaṃ /


		16.3 (p.328)

tadupari likhitāṣṭadalābjāyāṃ pīṭhikāyāṃ candramaṇḍalapaṭādicchādite siṃhāsane vā snānamaṇḍalakamalakarṇikopari niṣādādhimokṣeṇa niṣādya snānamaṇḍalarahite vā tathānyathā ca pīṭhādau bhāvitatanmaṇḍale pratimāpaṭapustakacaityādikaṃ pūrvābhimukham anyamukhaṃ vā sthāpayet / yat tu sthānāntarasaṃcārayogyaṃ na bhavati vihāracaityagandhakuṭīpratimādikaṃ tasya prāgvad bhāvitasamayasattvarūpasya maṇḍaladarśanam adhimuñcet na tatra snānavedyā prayojanaṃ /
ubhayathā pradoṣasamaye pratimādikaṃ puraskṛtya tadabhimukhībhūya pādyārghādidānapuraḥsaram arghādidānaṃ vinā vā nīrājayet / tatra oṃ āḥ vighnāntakṛt hūṃ iti kuṇḍalimantreṇa hūṃ-kāreṇa ca saptajaptaiḥ siddhārthaiḥ savyetaramuṣṭibhyāṃ gṛhītaiḥ pratyekaṃ vāradvayaṃ vāmāvartena oṃ sarvapāpadahanavajrāya vajrasattvasya sarvapāpaṃ daha svāhā iti paṭhan nirmañcya siddhārthān agnau kṣipet / tathā dakṣiṇāvartena vāmadakṣiṇatas tathodakena / tathā dhavalitaśarāvais tathā sadūrvāṅkuragomayajaḍībhis tathā bhaktajaḍībhiḥ / śītalikayā ca / kiṃtu śarāvādayo 'gnau na kṣepyāḥ /

tato hastābhyāṃ pratimādikam upaspṛśet / cakreśamantreṇa pratimāder yathāyogaṃ sākṣād darpaṇapratibimbitasya vā hṛdi gandhalepanaṃ puṣpamālayā śiroveṣṭanaṃ purato 'rghadānaṃ kṛtvā dīpaṃ paribhrāmya kuṇḍalinā hūṃ-kāreṇa ca saptajaptasaghṛtasajjarasadhūpena dhūpayed iti nīrājanakramaḥ /


		16.4 (p.331)

tadanu kuṇḍalijaptadūrvākūrcena tāmrabhājanasthair miśritadadhidugdhaghṛtamadhukhaṇḍarūpaiḥ pañcāmṛtais tadanu dadhidugdhaghṛtagomayagomūtraiḥ pañcagavyaiḥ snānayogyaṃ pratimādikaṃ oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ aḥ iti mantreṇa mrakṣayet / paṭapustakamṛnmayādicitritapratimādikaṃ tu darpaṇe pratibimbitaṃ /
tataḥ kuṇḍalijaptasugandhiśucivāriṇā snāpayitvā kāṃsyabhājanasthaiḥ pañcānāṃ nyagrodhodumbaraplakṣapippalagandhamuṇḍānāṃ kṣīravṛkṣāṇāṃ pañcavalkalakalkair virūkṣya oṃ sarvatathāgata kāyaviśodhane svāhā iti mantraṃ oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ khaṃ khaḥ iti vā 'vartayan kāṃsyabhājanasthasugandhitailena mrakṣayitvā virūkṣya kāṃsyasthāmalakṣyā  pralipya tathā snāpayitvā kāṃsyasthaharidrayā pralipya snāpayitvā śrīkhaṇḍaraktacandanakuṅkumagranthikāgurubhir yathālābhaṃ kuṅkumāgurukasturīkarpūrādibhir vā samālabhya hṛdbījakiraṇānītatathāgatadevībhiḥ kumbhaiḥ snāpyamānaṃ maṅgalagītivicitravāditrādipuraḥsaraṃ vijayakalaśādīnāṃ jalaiḥ śaṅkhe 'nyatra vā sambhṛtair yathā hi jātamātrā ityādivakṣyamāṇaṃ paṭhan snāpayet / tallagnajalaṃ mṛduvastreṇākṛṣya yathāśakti vastrādibhir maṇḍayet /
 

		16.5 (p.333)

tato hṛnmantraraśmibhiḥ pratiṣṭhāpanīyajñānasattvaṃ buddhabodhisattvādidevatāś ca purato nabhasy ānīya pādyācamanārghapūjāpuraḥsaraṃ bhuvi kṛtasavyajānupāto vāmena ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan savyena dhūpaṃ ḍhaukayan hūṃ-javajrajihvaḥ /
	bhagavann amuka sadvajra vidyārāja namo 'stu te /
	kartum icchāmi te nātha pratiṣṭhānaṃ dayāmaya //
	śiṣyāṇām anukampārthaṃ yuṣmākaṃ pūjanāya ca /
	sattvānāṃ puṇyavṛddhyarthaṃ bodhicittodayāya ca // 
	tan me bhaktasya bhagavan prasādaṃ kartum arhasi /
	samanvāharantu māṃ buddhā jagaccakrakriyārthadāḥ //
	phalasthā bodhisattvāś ca yāś cānyā mantradevatāḥ /
	devatā lokapālāś ca bhūtāḥ sambodhiśāsitāḥ //
	śāsanābhiratāḥ sattvā ye cānye divyacakṣuṣaḥ /
	amuko 'haṃ mahāvajrī pratiṣṭhām amukasya tu //
	kariṣyāmi tato yūyaṃ sānnidhyaṃ kartum arhatha //
iti triḥ paṭhet /
evam atrārhasītyantena pratiṣṭhānārtham adhivāsanaṃ śeṣeṇa tu sannidhānam abhyarthya nabhaḥsthadevatācakraṃ sampūjya praṇamya stutvā oṃ vajra punar āgamanāya muḥ iti visarjayet /
snāpitapratimādikasya hṛcchiraḥkaṇṭabhujaśikhareṣu samālabhya sampūjya kuṇḍalimantreṇa savajrasavyakareṇa triḥ saṃspṛśya yathāsvaṃ mantraṃ kuṇḍalimantraṃ vā japed digbalīṃś ca dadyād iti /


		16.6 (p.335)

yasya tu devatāyā adhivāsanaṃ vinaiva pratiṣṭhāpane dṛḍho 'dhimokṣas tenādhivāsanam akṛtvaivādhivāsanārtham uktaṃ pratiṣṭhāpanārthaṃ vakṣyamānaṃ ca vidhānaṃ sarvam ekasmin dine kartavyaṃ / kimtu nīrājanādikaṃ sadṛśaṃ vidhānam ekadaiva kartavyaṃ / na punaḥ / so 'pi dānapateḥ śaktisambhave puṇyopacayārtham adhivāsanaṃ kuryād eveti devatādhivāsanavidhiḥ /


		17. Pratimādipratiṣṭhāvidhi 

		17.1 (p.336)

tadanu pratyuṣe snānavedīṃ tathā manoharāṃ kārayitvā śubhamuhūrtādau kṛtatathābharaṇo vajradharamūrtir ācāryaḥ saprajña upaviśya balipūjāpūrvakaṃ pratimādikaṃ tathaiva sthāpitaṃ vihārādikaṃ ca yathāvasthitaṃ punaḥ samayasattvarūpaṃ niṣpādayet / tatra tantrābhisamayasādhanādiṣu viditadevatāviśeṣotpattyanukramo yasya devatāviśeṣasya yā pratikṛtis tāṃ śūnyatānantaraṃ yathākramaṃ jhaṭiti vā tām iva samayasattvarūpāṃ bhāvayet /
pustake tv akṣarasamudāyaśūnyatānantaraṃ raktapadmasūrye rakta-hrīḥ-kārajābja-hrīḥ-kārapariṇatapāṇḍarāśliṣṭo 'mitābhaḥ pariṇamya samuditākṣarākāraḥ pratibimbitāmitābharūpaḥ samayasattvaḥ sthita iti cintayet /
dīpaṅkarasya vihārādikasya ca śūnyatānantaraṃ padmacandre śubhra-bhrūṃ-jāṣṭāracakra-bhrūṃ-javairocano locanāliṅgitaḥ pariṇamya dīpaṅkarākāro vihārarūpo gandhakūṭīrūpo vā caityarūpo vā kiṃtu vihāraḥ pratibimbitasaprajñavairocanaḥ samayasattvo 'vasthitaḥ / evaṃ gandhakūṭīcaityaṃ ceti bhāvayet /
evaṃ niṣpādya samayasattvaṃ pādyārghādidānapuraḥsaraṃ prāgvan nīrājayet /


		17.2 (p.339)

tato 'nantaroktavidhinā pañcāmṛtādimrakṣaṇādikaṃ kuṅkumādisamālabhanasnāpanalagnajalākṛṣṭiparyantaṃ kṛtvā maṇḍalagṛhe praveśya maṇḍalasyaiśānyāṃ diśy anyasyāṃ vā nātidūre maṇḍalābhimukhaṃ sthāpayitvā pratimādikaṃ niścalaṃ tu vihārādikaṃ svasthānastham eva yathāyogaṃ tadīyahṛdbījacakṣurādikāyādyadhiṣṭhānabhāvanāpuraḥsaraṃ svahṛdbījamayūkhair yathāsvaṃ jñānasattvādyānayanādikam anantaroktam anuṣṭhāya bhagavann ityādikam arhathetyantaṃ triḥ paṭhitvā yathāyogaṃ hṛdraśmibhir devatābhir vākṛṣya jñānasattvaṃ yathāsvaṃ samayasattve praveśyaikarasīkṛtya vaśīkuryāt / pratimāhṛdi samayamaṇḍalaṃ niṣpādya tatraiva jñānamaṇḍalapraveśādikaṃ kuryād ity anyaḥ /


		17.3 (p.341)

tataḥ svahṛdbījamayūkhaiḥ puronabhasy ākṛṣṭadaśadiggatatathāgatān locanādidevīś ca sampūjya pratimādyabhiṣekārthaṃ /
	buddhānām abhiṣekas tu jagattrāṇāya vajriṇā /
	guṇākaro yathā dattas tathā dadadhvam asya hi //
iti gāthayābhyarthayet / taiś ca tathāgataiḥ prajñāsamāpannair mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya svasya vairocanadvāreṇa praviśya vajramārgeṇa nirgatya taddravair devīpadme mukhena praveśitaṃ pratimādikam abhiṣicya punar bhujamukhādimūrtibhiḥ padmāt niḥsṛtya bahirambaram āpūrya sthitair locanādividyāsahitaiś cchatrapatākānṛtyagītavāditrakusumakuṅkumādivṛṣṭiparikaritakarakiśalayāvarjitabodhicittāmṛtapūrṇasitakalaśais tat pratimādikaṃ padmād bahir niḥsṛtam abhiṣicyamānaṃ rūpavajrādibhir 
	yat maṅgalaṃ sakalasattvahṛdisthitasya sarvātmakasya varasarvakulādhipasya /
	niḥśeṣasattvajanakasya mahāsukhasya tat maṅgalaṃ bhavatu te 'dya varābhiṣeke //
iti maṅgalagītena vakṣyamāṇagītair vopanīyamānamaṅgalaṃ svayaṃ ca tat tāni vā pragāya vijayādikalaśānāṃ jalenaikatra śaṅkhe sambhūtena pratyekaṃ vā yathākramaṃ sapallavavajrakaragṛhītena sapallavavajrāgragalitena bodhicittāmṛtarūpeṇa 
	yathā hi jātamātreṇa snāpitāḥ sarvatathāgatāḥ /
	tathāhaṃ snāpayiṣyāmi śuddhaṃ divyena vāriṇā //
oṃ āḥ sarvatathāgatābhiṣeka samaya śriye hūṃ svāhā / iti / oṃ vajrodakābhiṣiñca hūṃ / iti ca paṭhan bhagavān vajrasattva eva paramagurur maṇḍalādhipatimūrtir abhiṣecayaty abhiṣiñcati ceti dṛḍhādhimuktyābhiṣiñced ity udakābhiṣekaḥ /


		17.4 (p.343)

pañcatathāgatādhiṣṭhitavastraratnādimayamukuṭaṃ / 	oṃ āḥ vajrābhiṣiñca hūṃ iti vā / oṃ vajraratna āṃ iti vā / oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ aḥ iti vā paṭhan maṇḍalādhipamūrtir vajradhara eva gurur āropayatīti dṛḍhādhimokṣeṇa pratimādidevatāmūrdhany āropayed iti mukuṭābhiṣekaḥ / vīrasya tu oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ aḥ iti mantreṇa lalāṭe paṭam api badhnīyāt / 
	adyābhiṣiktas tvam asi buddhair vajrābhiṣekataḥ /
	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhatvaṃ gṛhṇa vajraṃ susiddhaye //
iti paṭhan vajraṃ tathā vajrasattva evopanayatīty adhimuktyopanayet / tac ca pratimādidevatayā gṛhītam ity adhimokṣato vajrābhiṣekaḥ /
	oṃ vajrādhipati tvām abhiṣiñcāmi tiṣṭha vajra samayas tvam iti paṭhan ghaṇṭāṃ tathādhimuktyopanayet / sā ca pratimādidevatayā gṛhītety adhimokṣād ghaṇṭābhiṣekaḥ /
	oṃ vajrasattva tvām abhiṣiñcāmi vajranāmābhiṣekataḥ / oṃ amukavajras tvam iti paṭhan tathā vajrasattva eva yathāsvaṃ pratimādidevatāyā nāma karotīty adhimuñcann uccārayed iti nāmābhiṣekaḥ /


		17.5 (p.345)

pratimādidevatāṃ savajravajraghaṇṭākarakṛtajñānamudrāliṅganābhinayāṃ vibhāvyānantaroktodakābhiṣekavidhinābhiṣicya svasvakuleśena śirasi mudrayet / ajñātakulāṃ tv akṣobhyeṇa vajrasattvena vā / aparatathāgatabodhisattvadevīs tatraiva jñānasattvarūpeṇa praveśya oṃ supratiṣṭhita vajre svāhā iti mantreṇādhitiṣṭhet / oṃ hūṃ hrīḥ bhrūṃ khaṃ vajrībhava dṛḍhaṃ tiṣṭha bhrūṃ khaṃ ity anenāpi vihāraṃ caityaṃ ca pustakaṃ tu oṃ supratiṣṭhita vajre svāhā iti oṃ hūṃ hrīḥ tvaṃ iti mantrābhyāṃ ity ācāryābhiṣekaḥ /


		17.6 (p.346)

tadanu cakreśamūrtir vajrasattvaḥ svahṛdbījakiraṇānītaṃ savidyavairocanāditathāgatasamūhaṃ vairocanadvāreṇa praviśya dravībhūtaṃ mahāsukham anubhūya vajrapadmābhyām utsṛṣṭaṃ bodhicittarūpaṃ pratimādidevatāyā mukhe praveśayatīti cintayed iti guhyābhiṣekaḥ /
tatas tena vajrasattvenopanītadevyā samāpannāyāḥ pratimādidevatāyāḥ sahajānandamayatvam adhimuñced iti prajñājñānābhiṣekaḥ /
tadanu tena vajrabhṛtā pratipāditacaturthasekasvarūpāṃ pratimādidevatāṃ prahīṇasavāsanāvaraṇamahāsukhamayaśūnyatākaruṇaikarasām adhimuñced iti caturthābhiṣekaḥ /


		17.7 (p.347)

yad uktaṃ (yat tūktam Tanemura ed.) sārdhatriśatikāyāṃ 
	cakraṃ saṃlikhya samyak prāk pratiṣṭhāyāṃ tv ayaṃ vidhiḥ /
	pratimāpustakādīnāṃ pauruṣāntas tu sekataḥ //
	jalamaulī tu niḥṣpandaḥ (niḥṣyandaḥ Tanemura ed.) pāko vajrādhipāhvayāḥ /
	pauruṣo 'tra jinaiḥ seko vaimalyaṃ guhyayogataḥ //
	% Guhyasamājamaṇḍalavidhi
iti / tatra pauruṣa ācāryābhiṣekas tasya pauruṣasyopāyasyāyam upeya ity api pauruṣo (aṇipauruṣo Tanumera ed.) vaimalyaseko guhyaprajñācaturthasekātmakaḥ paryanto 'syeti pauruṣāntaḥ sekavidhir ity arthaḥ / puruṣakārād eva kuśalotsāhātiśayarūpād itaraphalatrayam āvirbhavatīty ākūtena (ākṛtena Tanemura ed.) pauruṣāntavacanaṃ / yogo 'tra sāṃvṛtaprajñayā pāramārthikaprajñayā ca vivakṣita iti trayātmakaṃ vaimalyaṃ / api ca pratimādirūpeṇāvirbhāvitadevatāyā ācāryasekena kāyaśuddhir evāpāditā / vākcittaśuddhyarthaṃ guhyādayo deyā eva /
	mahābodhisattvānām api hy  ete (kve te Tanemura ed.) dīyante //
yathoktam 
	abhiṣekaṃ vajragarbhasya dātuṃ kṛṣṭā tilottamā // 
	% Hevajratantra II.v.42cd
iti / bhagavataḥ siddhārthasya bodhitarutalagatasya nabhaḥsthaiḥ sambuddhair āsphānakasamādhisaṃskāram apanīyārdharātre niruttaraprajñāṃ samarpya prajñācaturthasekau dattāv iti ca / evam abhipretyaiva śiṣyapratiṣṭhāvat pratimādīnāṃ pratiṣṭhety aviśeṣeṇoddūṣyate mahārathair iti /


		17.8 (p.349)

tataḥ pratimādidevatānāṃ svasvahṛdayamantreṇa vastrādikaṃ niryātayet / athavā oṃ āḥ vajravāsase hūṃ svāhā / oṃ āḥ vajrapuṣpe hūṃ svāhā / 	oṃ āḥ vajradhūpe hūṃ svāhā / oṃ āḥ vajradīpe hūṃ svāḥā / oṃ āḥ vajranivedye hūṃ svāhā / oṃ āḥ vajragandhe hūṃ svāhā / oṃ sarvābharaṇavibhūṣaṇe svāhā / iti / ebhir mantraiḥ oṃ āḥ sarvaśodhani hūṃ phaṭ / phalaphullādinānāvastuprokṣaṇamantraḥ / oṃ jaṃ svāhā / iti phalaḍhaukanamantraḥ / samayadravyaṃ ca rocanāṃ ca dattvā oṃ vajrasattva āḥ iti mantreṇa darpaṇaṃ darśayet /


		17.9 (p.350)

tadanantaraṃ vā homasambhave homenāpyāyanānantaraṃ vā pratimādyanurūpato dānapatyāśayānurūpataś ca śāntyādibuddhatvaparyantam arthaṃ dānapatyādīnām abhilaṣan māṣakānalpakahemaśalākayā raupyamallikāsthitaghṛtamadhum ukṣitayā / oṃ cakṣuś cakṣuḥ samantacakṣur viśodhane svāhā / iti paṭhann añjayaṃś cakṣur udghāṭayet / 
pratimāyāḥ pustakādidevatāyās tu darpaṇe bhāvitapratibimbāyāḥ śāntyādyarthaṃ ca dānapatyādivyavalokanaparam adhidevatam adhimuñcet /
tadanu kuṇḍāgnau kṣīrākhaṇḍataṇḍulaghṛtamadhuśarkarābhiḥ pātryā śruveṇa ca tadabhāve pippalapatreṇa prakṣipya yantrikoparisthitabhājane sāṭopaṃ svādhipamantram udīrayan pāyasaṃ niṣpādayet / homakuṇḍābhāve tv anyāgnau tat pāyasaṃ / oṃ divyānne samādhidhyānaprīṇane svāhā / ity abhimantrya paṭhaṃś ca pratimāṃ pustakādiṣu bhāvitapratibimbitadevatāṃ ca prāśayed ācamanaṃ candanādikaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca dadyāt / tadanu oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ aḥ iti samayaṃ śrāvayet /


		17.10 (p.352)

tataḥ pustake saprajñam amitābham akṣareṣu praviśyākṣararūpaṃ savidyavairocanaṃ tu vihāre caitye vā praviśya vihārarūpaṃ sarvasambuddhataddharmabodhisattvaśrāvakādyāśrayaṃ nānāsamādhilayanaṃ caityarūpaṃ ca jagadarthakaraṇāyāsaṃsāraṃ vajrasattvādibhir adhiṣṭhitaṃ cintayet /
tataḥ puṣpādikam upanīya kṛtāñjaliḥ

	yathā hi sarvasambuddhās tuṣite sampratiṣṭhitāḥ /
	māyādevyā yathā kukṣau tadvat tiṣṭhantv ihākṛtau //
	atrasthaḥ satataṃ nātho bhūtvā pūjādikān imān /
	gṛhāṇa amukārthāya bodhicittavivṛddhaye //

ity anena cirasthityartham abhyarthya kuṇḍalimantraṃ japan pratimāder adhomadhyordhvabhāgān dakṣiṇakarotkṛṣṭacalitavajreṇa trir veṣṭayitvā dṛḍhīkṛtya 

	akṣobhyavajramahājñāna vajradhātu mahābudha /
	trimaṇḍala trivajrāgra ghoṣavajra namo 'stu te //
	vairocana mahāśuddha vajraśānta mahārate /
	prakṛtiprabhāsvarāgrāgra deśavajra namo 'stu te //
	ratnarāja sugāmbhīrya khavajrākāśa nirmala /
	svabhāvaśuddha nirlepa kāyavajra namo 'stu te //
	vajrāmita mahārāja nirvikalpa kha vajradhṛk /
	rāga pāramitāprāpta bhāṣavajra namo 'stu te //
	amoghavajra sambuddha sarvāśāparipūraka /
	śuddhasvabhāvasambhūta vajrasattva namo 'stu te //

iti gāthābhiḥ stutvā nyūnādividhiśāntaye / oṃ vajrasattva samayam anupālaya vajrasattvatvenopatiṣṭha dṛḍho me bhava sutoṣyo me bhava supoṣyo me bhava anurakto me bhava sarvasiddhiṃ me prayaccha sarvakarmasu ca me cittaṃ śreyaḥ kuru hūṃ ha ha ha ha hoḥ bhagavan sarvatathāgatavajra mā me muñca vajrībhava mahāsamayasattva āḥ / iti śatākṣaraṃ trir āvartya /
	aprāptyā cāparijñānād aśaktyā ca dayāmaya /
	yat kṛtaṃ nyūnam anyad vā tat sarvaṃ kṣantum arhasi //
iti kṣamayitvā /
	kṣantum arhanti sambuddhā devatyas tatsūtā api / 
	brahmādyā devatā nāgā yad vidhinyūnatādikaṃ // 
	rakṣantu cāgnibhūvārimarutaḥ pratimāṃś ciraṃ / 
	kuryur dānapateḥ śāntiṃ puṣṭiṃ svastiṃ ca sarvataḥ // 
	tatputrādeś ca śiṣyāṇām asmākaṃ ca tato mudā / 
	gacchantu buddhaviṣayaṃ punar āgantum atra ca //

iti trir abhyarthya digbalīn sārvabhautikabaliṃ ca dadyāt / dānapatir api pradakṣiṇaṃ pūjāṃ vandanāṃ ca pratimādikasya kṛtvā ''cāryaṃ samyagdakṣiṇābhiḥ paritoṣayad iti /


		17.11 (p.357)

ihāmitābhanāyake maṇḍale pustakaṃ pratiṣṭhāpayitavyaṃ / vairocananāyake tu vihārādikaṃ / akṣobhyanāyake vajrasattvanāyake vā sarvāḥ pratimāḥ / ajñātakulā api pratiṣṭhāpanīyāḥ / athavā yasyāḥ pratimādevatāyā yatkulaṃ jñāyate sā tatkulatathāgatanāyake maṇḍale /
kvacit tu

	pratiṣṭhāpyaṃ hi yad bimbaṃ yasmiṃs tantre vyavasthitaṃ /
	tat tasya manḍalaṃ kāryam athavā svādhidaivataṃ //
	ācāryasya bhaved yat svaṃ tat kuryād bhedadṛṣṭhitaḥ //
