		20.9 (p.386)

tadanu tān kuṇḍalimantreṇārakṣya tajjapārthaṃ kuṇḍalimantraṃ kathayitvā prātar asmāsu svapnaṃ kathayiṣyathety abhidhāya kūṭāgārodare maṇḍalabhūmiparyante yamanikādyantarite 'nyatra vā śiṃhaśayyayā svāpayet / svayaṃ maṇḍalagṛhaṃ praviśya rakṣārthaṃ kuṇḍalimantraṃ japed iti /
iha yaḥ saṃvara ācāryam akartum api dīyate sa sāmānyaḥ śaraṇagamanabodhicittotpādamātralakṣaṇaḥ / yas tv ācāryaṃ kartuṃ dīyate sa ācāryasaṃvaraḥ pañcakulasaṃgṛhītaḥ / ato 'yaṃ saṃvaradvayadānapūrvakaḥ śiṣyādhivāsanavidhiḥ /


		21. Ācāryapraveśavidhi 

		21.1 (p. 387)

tadanu guruḥ pratyūṣe baliṃ dattvā maṇḍalagṛhān niṣkramya śiṣyān svapnaṃ pṛṣṭvā giripātādisūcitāśubhasvapne kuṇḍalimantreṇārakṣya maṇḍalagṛhapraveśakāle śiṣyaiḥ / oṃ praviśa bhagavan mahāsukha mokṣapuraṃ sarvasiddhisukhapradaṃ paramasukhottama sidhya jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ prasidhyasva / ity utsāhitaḥ praviśya pradakṣiṇayaṃś cakreśamūrtiḥ paścimādidvāreṣu sthitvā maṇḍalasya pūrvādidvārāṇi / oṃ vajrodghāṭaya samaya praveśaya hūṃ / iti paṭhann udghāṭaya puṣpamālām / oṃ paramasukhāśayasulalitavilāsanamitair namāmi bhagavantaṃ jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ hi hi hi hi hrīḥ pratīccha kusumāñjaliṃ nātha hoḥ / iti mantreṇa kṣiptvā maṇḍale punar gṛhītvā svaśirasi baddhvā mālābhiṣekāśayena pratyakṣībhavaccakreśaṃ ca gurum adhimucya tena dīyamānān gṛhītamālābhiṣekādivakṣyamāṇasamastābhiṣekān yathāvidhi sarvācāryakarmasv anujñān ca prāpya śiṣyapraveśāya mahāsukhātmakaprajñopāyamayatattvastutipuraḥsarāṃ maṇḍalasiddhim abhilaṣet / satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ ca kuryāt /


		21.2 (p.389)

