		21.3 (p.391)

ākāśam utpāde cihnaṃ dṛṣṭānto yasya sa tathā tattvāt śūnyatākaruṇāmayo vajrasattva ity arthaḥ / sarve vajrāḥ kāyavajrādayaḥ / sarvarāgaiḥ sarvakāmaiḥ sattvānām anurāgaṇaḥ / mahārāgo nirālambanamahākṛpā / ādimukutaḥ prakṛtipariśuddhyā sarvātmā dharmatayā bodhyātmakaḥ sattvo bodhisattvaḥ / kāmyata iti kāmaś cāsāv agraś ca / samayāgriṇāṃ samyagjñānavatām / kleśajñeyasamāpattyāvaraṇair virahaniḥsvabhāvatvaśabdāviṣayatvair acchādipañcapadāni / akalmaṣāḥ satyādhiṣṭhānād bhagavadadhiṣṭhānāc ca / ity ācāryapraveśavidhiḥ /


		22. Śiṣyapraveśavidhi

		22.1 Samayodakadānavidhi

		22.1.1

tato dvārācāryāṇām arucāv anyaṃ rucau tu tān anyañ cādhivāsitaṃ dvisaṃvariṇaṃ śiṣyaṃ snāpayitvā sugandhādinā pavitrībhūtaṃ kuṇḍalimantritaraktāmbaram anyathā vā kāṇḍhapaṭād bahir vairocanarūpeṇa cakrādhiparūpeṇa vālambitam / oṃ sarvatathāgatānuttarabodhyalaṃkāravastrapūjāmeghasamudraspharaṇasamaye hūṃ / iti kṛtaparidhānam / oṃ vajrarakṣa haṃ / iti kṛtottarīyam / oṃ vajroṣṇīṣa hūṃ phaṭ / iti kṛtoṣṇīṣam / amṛtakuṇḍalijaptena raktena pītena vā vastreṇa / oṃ cakṣubandhaṃ varam ānaya hūṃ / iti mantreṇa buaddhvāndhapaṭam / āḥ khaṃ vī ra hūṃ / iti paṭhitvā gṛhītapuṣpasrajaṃ dattadakṣiṇaṃ sārvakarmikakalaśajalābhyukṣitaṃ hṛtkaṇṭhaśiraḥsthavajramuṣṭipadmacakranyastasūryasūryacandoropari kṛṣṇa-hūṃ-rakta-āḥ-śukra-oṃ-kāraraśmiprabhāsvaraśarīraṃ hūṃ ity uccārya maṇḍalapūrvadvāre sthāpitaṃ karmavajriṇā gṛhītaṃ maṇḍalapraveśāya pṛcchet /


		22.1.2 (p.394)

kas tvaṃ bhoḥ suratapriyeti / tena vaktavyam / subhago 'haṃ mahāsukheti / tatas tasya / oṃ sarvayogacittam utpādayāmi / iti pāṭhayan bodhicittam utpādya sapuṣpavajraṃ hṛdi / oṃ surate samays tvaṃ hoḥ sidhya vajra yathāsukham / iti paṭhan dhṛtvā / adya tvaṃ sarvatathāgatādhiṣṭhito bhaviṣyasi / na ca tvayedaṃ sarvatathāgataparamarahasyamaṇḍalam amaṇḍalapraviṣṭāya vaktavyaṃ / na cāśraddhātavyam / ity uktvā / oṃ yamāntakṛt hūṃ /
 iti paṭhann ākṛṣya / āḥ khaṃ vīra hūṃ / ity anena yamanikābhyantaraṃ praveśya / mahārata sudṛḍha suṭoṣya susukho vajrasattvādya sidhya mām iti pāṭhena pradakṣiṇayantaṃ kṛtāñjaliṃ maṇḍalasya pūrvadvāre / oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi / sarvatathāgata vajrasattvādhitiṣṭha mām / oṃ sarvabuddhapūjopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi / sarvatathāgata vairocanādhitiṣṭha mām iti / dakṣiṇe oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjābhiṣekāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi sarvatathāgata vajraratnābhiṣiñca mām / paścime / oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjāpravartanāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi sarvatathāgata vajradharma pravartaya mām / uttare / oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjākarmaṇe ātmānaṃ niryātayāmi sarvatathāgata vajrakarma kuru mām / iti pañcamantrair yathākramaṃ maṇḍalasthākṣobhyāditathāgatān praṇamamya punaḥ pūrvadvāri / oṃ guru caraṇopasthānāyātmānaṃ niryātayāmi / oṃ sarvasattvaparitrāṇārtham ātmānaṃ niryātayāmi / ity arthānugamapuraḥsaraṃ pāṭhayet /
asya hṛdi samāpannamahāsukhaṃ hṛdādau nyāsāntaraṃ ca kenacid uktam / atrāvasare na bhāvyam vidhyantaraṃ hi tat /


		22.1.3 (p. 397)

tato 'dya tvaṃ sarvatathāgatakule praviṣṭas tad ahaṃ te vajrajñānam utpādayāmi yena jñānena tvaṃ sarvatathāgatasiddhīr api prāpsyasi kim utānyāḥ siddhīrḥ na ca tvayedam adṛṣṭamaṇḍalasya purato vaktavyaṃ mā te samayo vyathed ity ukutvā śirasi vajraṃ dhṛtvā ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan / ayaṃ te samayo vajraṃ mūrdhānaṃ sphālayed yadi tvam imaṃ kasyacid brūyā iti śrāvayitvā hṛdaye vajraṃ dhṛtvā /
	oṃ vajrasattvaḥ svayaṃ te 'dya hṛdaye samavasthitaḥ /
	nirbhidya tatkṣaṇaṃ yāyād yadi brūyā imaṃ nayam // (1 //)
ity ājñāpya vijayakalaśoparisthitajalam anāmāṅguṣṭnagṛhītabhājanamukhena tasya mukhe dadāna
	idaṃ te nārakaṃ vāri samayātikramād dahet /
	samayasaṃrakṣaṇāt siddhiḥ piba vajrāmṛtodakam // (2 //)
     	%+ oṃ pañcāmṛtodaka ṭhaḥ in Tibetan translation
iti paṭhan koṣapānaṃ kārayitvā / adyaprabhṛti tavāhaṃ vajrapāṇir yad ahaṃ brūyām idaṃ kuru / tat tvayā kartavyaṃ / na ca tvayāham avamantavyo mā te viṣamāparihāreṇa kālariyāṃ kṛtvā narakapatanaṃ syād iti vadet / te iti tvām / nārakam iti vaitaraṇījalam iva / vajrāmṛtodakam iti vajraṃ nigrahād amṛtam anugrahāt / iti samayodakadānavidhiḥ /


		22.2 Āveśavidhi (p. 400)
		22.2.1

tadanu sādhanakālāt prāk siddhyādiniścayādyarthaṃ pātre śiṣye devatām avatārayet / tatra prathamaṃ parvatādimanonukūlasthāne kṛtapuraścaraṇaḥ sthiracitto vajrasattvayogaṃ sudṛḍham ālambya labdhāveśasāmarthyaḥ sarvalakṣaṇopetam adhivāsya śiṣyaṃ puraskṛtya jhaṭiti śūnyatānantaram āḥ-kārajāmitābharūpaṃ niṣpādya sarvatathāgatāś cādhitiṣṭhantām / vajrasattvo me āviśatu iti vācayitvā tasya hṛdi laṃ-jātavajrāṅkacatuḥkoṇapītapṛthvīmaṇḍale sūrye nīla-hūṃ / śirasi vaṃ-bhavaśuklavartulakalaśāṅkavāruṇamaṇḍale candre śukla-haḥ-kāram / kaṇṭhe yaṃ-kārajacalatpatākādvayāṅkadhanvābhanīlānilamaṇḍale candre raktam āḥ-kāraṃ vibhāvya / svahṛdbījaraśmibhiś cittakāyavāgvajrān ānīya yathākramaṃ tatsvabhāveṣu hūṃ-haḥ-āḥ-kāreṣu antarbhāvya pādayor adhastād vāyumaṇḍaloddīpita-raṃ-pariṇatarephāṅkāruṇatrikoṇaspharatkiraṇānalamaṇḍalasthena rakta-jhaiḥ-kāreṇotkṣipyamāṇaṃ śiṣyaṃ jhaiḥ-kāraraśmisamūhaiḥ pādasuṣirapraviṣṭaiḥ hūṃ-kārādiraśmibhiś cāpūryamāṇasamastaśarīraṃ dhyāyan dhūpotkṣepapuraḥsaraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan / āveśaya stobhaya ra ra ra ra cālaya cālaya hūṃ haḥ āḥ jhaiḥ / iti mantraṃ śatadhāvartayan dhyānapara āveśayet / yady āviṣṭo dūram utpatati tadā tasyopari vajramayaṃ meruṃ tadupari māhendramaṇḍalaṃ tadupari pītapañcasūcivajraṃ tadupari yaḥ-kāraṃ tasyopari vairocanaṃ dhyātvā taṃ nivartayet /


		22.2.2 (p.402)

evam āveśe vidyamāne śiṣyasya cittavajrabījaraśmibhir vāgvajraṃ bījātmakaṃ saṃcodyamānaṃ jihvāyāṃ ca raktaṃ āḥ-kāraṃ candrasthaṃ jvālāmālākulaṃ dhyātvā / brūhi vajreti brūyāt / evam asau śubham aśubhaṃ vā svasya parasya vā kṛtyaṃ satyaṃ vadet /

tadanv avatīrṇadevatāṃ hṛdraśmibhir ākṛṣya svahṛdbīje 'ntarbhāvayan śiṣyamūrdhni vajraṃ dhṛtvā / oṃ kṛto va ityādipūrvakaṃ hūṃ haḥ āḥ jhaiḥ mur iti visarjayet /


		22.2.3 (p.403)

athavā ghaṇṭāpādair likhitena /
	viṇmūtrādisaṃsiktaṃ rajoyukutāṅganāpaṭam /
	kuṭṭitam otuviṣṭhāktaṃ guggulena vimiśritam // (1 //)
	pretānalaṃ samādāya kṛtvā taṃ padmabhājane /
	prakṣipya tatra tat sarvam ālīḍhapadasaṃsthitaḥ // (2 //)
	krodhāviṣṭas tricakrātmā tasmai cakratrayātmane /
	dadyād vajrī tato dhūpam āviṣṭaḥ syān na saṃśayaḥ // (3 //)
tiṣṭha mahākrodhāveśaya hūṃ śrīherukāya vidmahe vidyārājāya dhīmahe svāhā / ity anena vīraṃ pracodayet / iti lakṣābhidhānatantra-uktavidhinā 'veśayet / viṇmūtrādīti daśabhir amṛtapradīpaiḥ siktaṃ /
saṃvararūpo gurur ālīḍhastha ālīḍhasthaṃ saṃvarātmānaṃ śiṣyaṃ hṛdikṛtāñjaliṃ vāmakaraghaṇṭānādena tiṣṭha-ityādimantraṃ sāṭopaṃ paṭhan savyakareṇa dhūpayet / tato yady āviṣṭa ityādikaṃ veditavyam /

		22.2.4 (p.405)

yady api kvacit tantre dvādaśavarṣapramāṇām akṣatayonim avikalāṅgopāṅgāṃ kanyāṃ kumāraṃ ca tāvadvārṣikam ajñātastrīviṣayam avikalāṅgopāṅgaṃ pātraṃ purodhāya devatām avatārayed ity uktam / tathāpi pratimuhurāvirbhavadvajrabhṛnmūrter ūpacitapuṇyasya guror jhaṭiti dṛḍhabhāvanāśakter avikalāṅge bahuvayaske 'pi viditamaithune 'pi pātre devatāvatared iti tantrāntareṣu bahuśaḥ prakāśanāt śiṣyāveśārthaṃ yateteyti āveśavidhiḥ /


	22.3 Sāndhapaṭaśiṣyapraveśavidhi (p. 406)

tato maṇḍalābhimukhaṃ śiṣyam cakṣuṣas te kīdṛśo 'vabhāsa iti pṛṣṭvā taduktaiḥ sitapītaraktakṛṣṇāvabhāsair yathākramaṃ śāntipuṣṭivaśyābhicārasiddhibhavyatām asya jñātvāinam aṅguṣṭhadvaye savajradakṣiṇakareṇa gṛhītvā vajrapadanṛtyam abhinayan kuṇḍaliṃ paṭhan pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kārayitvā satyādhiṣṭhānam iti kuryāt /
	ity ayaṃ maṇḍale samyaṅ mayā śiṣyaḥ praveśitaḥ /
	yathā puṇyaṃ tathāsyāstu devatānāṃ kulakramaḥ // 1 //
	yādṛk siddhir bhaved asya gotre yasmiṃś ca bhājanam /
	yādṛk puṇyānubhāvaś ca tādṛg asyāstu maṇḍale // 2 //
iti maṇḍale sāndhapaṭaśiṣyapraveśavidhiḥ /


		23. Mālābhiṣekavidhi 
		23.1 Mālābhiṣekavidhi 
		
		23.1.1 (p.408)

tataḥ pūrvaṃ gṛhītamālāyāḥ trāṃ-kāramantritāyā amlānaṃ laghupuṣpam ekam ākṛṣya tatkarapuṭe dadyāt / sa tadā tat kusumamālām adhimucyātmānaṃ ca tryakṣareṇojjvalaṃ prakṣālitakalmaṣaṃ guruṇā tathādhiṣṭhito bhaktipraḥsaraṃ purato 'vasthitam iva samāṇḍaleyaṃ maṇḍaleśam avalambya tanmaṇḍalaṃ manasā praviśya tacchirasi puṣpaṃ nikṣipet / oṃ tiṣṭha vajra dṛḍho me bhava śāśvato me bhava hṛdayaṃ me 'dhitiṣṭha sarvasiddhiṃ me prayaccha hūṃ ha ha ha ha hoḥ āḥ khaṃ vīra hūṃ pratīccha kusumāñjaliṃ nātha hoḥ / iti mantraṃ paṭhan pañcarekhābhyantarapuṣpapātānurūpato 'sya kulam ādiśet / tadyogaṃ ca dadyāt / siddhiṃ ca lakṣayet /


		23.1.2 (p.409)

yadi buddhānām ūrṇāyāṃ śirasy uṣṇīṣe vā puṣpaṃ patati mahāmudrāsiddhiḥ / locane mukhe vā mantrasiddhiḥ / uttamāṅga uttamā / madhyamāṅge madhyamā / adhobhāge tv adhamā / bimbasyātidūre cirāt / samīpe kṣipraṃ siddhiḥ / devatānān tu svakīyaṃ sthānaṃ koṣṭhādivicchedato jñātavyam / dvayor devatayor antare yadi patati tadā yasyāsannaṃ puṣpaṃ tatkulaṃ tasya bhavati / samatve tūbhayavidhisiddhiḥ / tadā yatra rucirasya tatkulam / pañcarekhābahiḥpāte punaḥ kṣiped vāratrayaṃ yāvat / tatra ca bahiḥ pāte kṣudrasiddhiḥ / bāhye vartularekhāsu bāhyavajrāvalībahiś ca nāsti siddhiḥ / maṇḍalaṃ cāsya na darśayet / mantrajāpādinā bhavyatām āpādya prastāvāntare sa praveśanīyaḥ / bāhyavajrāvalīgarbhe pāte kaṣṭata iti /
tatas tat puṣpaṃ gṛhītvā mālāyām ābadhya tāṃ mālām / oṃ pratigṛhṇa tvam imaṃ sattva mahābala / iti paṭhan śiṣyasya śirasi badhnīyāt / iti mālābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		23.1.3(p.411)

iha rajomayadevatāsv api puṣpapāte sati nāpattiḥ śubhacittasyeti na kaścid doṣaḥ / tathānabhijñasya tu vimalaprabhāyāṃ / rajomaṇḍale puṣpapātena rajobhaṅgād apuṇyaṃ syād ato vijayakalaśasthacihne puṣpaṃ kṣeptavyam ity uktam / ihāveśe sati śubhādikathanānantaraṃ / oṃ tiṣṭha vajra / ity anenāveśaṃ dṛḍhīkṛtya cakṣuravabhāsapraśnādikaṃ śirasibandhanaparyantaṃ kṛtvāvatīrṇadevatāṃ visarjayet / asāmarthyāt tv āveśavidhāv akṛte samayodakadānānantaram eva cakṣuravabhāsapraśnādikaṃ kuryād iti vadanti /


		23.2 Darśanātmakapraveśavidhi 
		23.2.1 (p.412)

tadanu śiṣyasya hṛccandre 'dhipatiṃ lalāṭe rephaṃ netradvaye sajvāla-oṃ-dvayaṃ vibhāvya /
	vajrasattvaḥ svayaṃ te 'dya cakṣurudghāṭanatatparaḥ /
	udghāṭayati sarvākṣo vajracakṣur anuttaram // (1 //)
oṃ jñānacakṣuḥ hūṃ āḥ svāhā / iti paṭhann andhapaṭam apanayet / sarvākṣaḥ sarvadarśitvāt vajracakṣuḥ sarvarūpiṣv apratihataṃ cakṣuḥ / anuttaraṃ buddhānām ivāvaraṇāpanayanāt /


		23.2.2 (p. 413)

tato he vajra paśyety uktvā devatānāṃ nāmakathanapūrvakaṃ maṇḍalādhipatim ārabhyottaradvārapālaṃ yathāsaṃbhavaṃ sumbhararājaṃ vā yāvad darśayitvā /
	idaṃ tan maṇḍalaṃ paśya śraddhāvegena saṃprati /
	tvañ ca buddhakule jāto mudrāmantrair adhiṣṭhitaḥ // (2 //)
	saṃpadā sarvasiddhīnāṃ samayāgryo bhaviṣyasi /
	vajrapadmāgralalitaṃ mantreṣv ārādhanaṃ kuru // (3 //)
iti paṭhitvā vajramaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍalapraviṣṭo 'ham // yogamaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍaladarśito 'ham // guhyamaṇḍalamahāmaṇḍaladīkṣito 'ham // iti pāṭhayitvā samayaṃ pāṭhayet / hoḥ hoḥ hoḥ / iti maṇḍale śiṣyasya darśanātmakapraveśavidhiḥ /

		24. Udakābhiṣekavidhi
		24.1 (p.414)

tadanūdakābhiṣekārthaṃ gurave yathāvibhavaṃ dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā pṛthivyām āropitajānuḥ kṛtāñjaliḥ /
	bodhivajreṇa buddhānāṃ yathā datto mahāmahaḥ /
	mamāpi trāṇanārthāya khavajrādya dadāhi me // (1 //)
iti paṭhann abhyarthayet //
tato gurur mūlamaṇḍalād bahir yathā snānajalena tan na spṛśyate pūrvasyāṃ diśi praveśadvārasaṃmukhaṃ viśvapadmam ityādi pīṭhādau bhāvitamaṇḍala iti paryantena pratimāsnānārthaṃ prāk pratipādite śiṣyaṃ bhāvitavajradhararūpaṃ maṇḍalābhimukhaṃ nīrājayet / prāguktena / oṃ āḥ vighna ityādinīrājanakrameṇa /


		24.2 (p.416)

tadanu hṛdbījamayūkhair anantadigvartinas tathāgatān vidyādevīś ca saṃpūjya śiṣyābhiṣekārtham /
	buddhānām abhiṣekas tu jagattrāṇāya vajriṇā /
	guṇākaro yathā dattas tathā dadadhvam asya hi // (2 //)
iti gāthayā prārthya tais tathāgataiḥ prajñāsamāpannair mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya vairocanadvāreṇāntarniviśya vajramārgeṇa nirgatya taddravair devīpadme mukhena praveśitaṃ / śiṣyaṃ jhaṭiti śūnyatānantaraṃ hūṃ-vajrajātasaprajñākṣobhyarūpiṇaṃ jñānasattvābhinnam abhiṣicya punar bhujamukhādimūrtibhiḥ padmān niḥsṛtya gaganam āpūrya sthirair locanādividyāsahitaiś chatradhvajapatākāvastravāditragītanṛtyapuṣpakuṅkumādivṛṣṭibhiḥ karakiśalayāvarjitabodhicittāmṛtapūrṇasitakalaśais taṃ śiṣyaṃ padmān niḥsṛtam abhiṣicyamānaṃ rūpavajrādidevībhiḥ /


		24.3 (p.418)

yan maṅgalaṃ sakalasattvahṛdisthitasya sarvātmakasya varasarvakulādhipasya /
niḥśeṣasattvajanakasya mahāsukhasya tan maṅgalaṃ bhavatu te 'dya varābhiṣeke // (3 //)
lakṣmīdharaḥ kāñcanaparvatābhas trilokanāthas trimalaprahīṇaḥ /
buddho vibuddhāmbujapatranetras tan maṅgalaṃ bhavatu śāntikaraṃ tavādya // (4 //)
tenopadiṣṭaḥ pravaras tv akampyaḥ khyātas triloke naradevapūjaḥ /
dharmottamaḥ śāntikaraḥ prajānāṃ tan maṅgalaṃ bhavatu śāntikaraṃ tavādya // (5 //)
saddharmayuktaḥ śrutamaṅgalāḍhyaḥ saṃgho nṛdevāsuradakṣiṇīyaḥ /
yaḥ śrīnivāsaḥ pravaro gaṇānāṃ tan maṅgalaṃ bhavatu śāntikaraṃ tavādya // (6 //)


		24.4 (p.419)

iti maṅgalagītibhir upanīyamānamaṅgalaṃ svayaṃ ca tāḥ pragāya vijayādighaṭebhyaḥ stokastokam ākṛṣya padmapātre śaṅkhe vā dhṛtenāthavā prathamaṃ vijayalakalaśasya / oṃ mahāsukha vajrasattvābhiṣekeṇa tvāṃ abhiṣiñcāmi sarvatathāgatādhipatitvena dṛḍho bhava / ity uccārya saṃkṣeparucitvenāpaṭhitvāpi / sapallavavajrasavyakaramuṣṭigṛhītena tataś catustathāgatakalaśānāṃ tataś caturdevīkalaśānāṃ / tato yathāyogaṃ maṇḍaleyakalaśānām / asaṃbhave ca vijayakalaśasya jalenākṣobhyātmakena bodhicittāmṛtarūpeṇa sapallavavajrāgragalitena /
	abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajraṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam /
	dadāmi sarvabuddhānāṃ triguhyālayasaṃbhavam // (7 //)
oṃ āḥ vajrodakābhiṣiñca hūṃ suratas tvam aham / iti paṭhann abhiṣiñcet / sa tadā mahāsukhasamāpanno bhavatīti cintayed ity udakābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		25. Mukuṭābhiṣekavidhi (p.421)

tatas taṃ bodhivajreṇetyādinā gurum adhyeṣitavantam āṃ-ratnajaratnasaṃbhavarūpiṇaṃ jñānasattvenaikībhūtaṃ nabhaḥsthatathāgatadevībhiḥ kumbhair abhiṣicyamānaṃ rūpavajrādibhir upanīyamānamaṅgalagītikaṃ bhāvayet / vajrādhipatyanāmasekeṣv apy evam /
tataḥ kanakavastrādighaṭitaṃ ratnasaṃbhavajaṃ tatsvabhāvaṃ jñānasattvarūpapañcatathāgatair madhyasthitaśiṣyakuleśair adhiṣṭhitaṃ mukuṭaṃ tasya śiraso madhye lalāṭe pārśvadvaye mūrdhni pṛṣṭhe ca yathākramaṃ / oṃ vajradhātvīśvary abhiṣiñca hūṃ / oṃ sattvavajry abhiṣiñca bhrūṃ / oṃ ratnavajry abhiṣiñca āḥ / oṃ dharmavajry abhiṣiñca hrīḥ / oṃ karmavajry abhiṣiñca tāṃ (trāṃ Sakurai ed.) / iti pañcamantraiḥ sthāpayitvā śirasi samāropayann abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajram ityādigāthām / oṃ āḥ vajramukuṭābhiṣiñca hūṃ suratas tvam aham / iti ca paṭhitvā / vajra tuṣya hoḥ / iti paṭhaṃs toṣayet / iti mukuṭābhiṣekavidhiḥ / 
tadanu oṃ hūṃ trāṃ hrīḥ aḥ iti mantreṇa lalāṭe paṭṭaṃ badhnīyād iti /


		26. Vajrābhiṣekavidhi (p.423)

tatas tathābhyarthitavantaṃ hrīḥ-padmapariṇatāmitābharūpaṃ jñānasattvābhinnaṃ śiṣyaṃ vajraṃ cāmitābhātmakaṃ vicintyābhiṣekaṃ mahāvajram ityādigāthāṃ paṭhitvā /
	adyābhiṣiktas tvam asi buddhair vajrābhiṣekataḥ /
	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhatvaṃ gṛhṇa vajraṃ susiddhaye // (1 //)
iti paṭhan śiṣyasya hṛtkaṇṭhaśirāṃsi vajreṇa spṛṣṭvā dakṣiṇahaste tad dadyāt / iti vajrābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		27 Ghaṇṭābhiṣekavidhi (p.424)

tadanu tathādhyeṣitavantaṃ khaṃ-khaḍgajāmoghasiddhirūpaṃ jñānasattvābhinnaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ cāmoghasiddhipariṇatāṃ tasya vāmahaste dattvā vajravajraghaṇṭānvitakarābhyāṃ mudrāliṅganābhinayaṃ kārayitvābhiṣekam ityādigāthāpāṭhapūrvakam / oṃ vajrādhipati tvām abhiṣiñcāmi tiṣṭha vajra samayas tvam / iti paṭhitvā / oṃ vajraghaṇṭa aḥ aḥ 
	gṛhīto 'si bhagavan mayi saṃnihito bhava /
iti pāṭhayet / ity ādhipatyābhiṣekāparanāmaghaṇṭābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		28. Nāmābhiṣekavidhi
		28.1 (p.425)

tadanu taṃ tathādhyeṣitavantam oṃ-cakrajavairocanarūpaṃ jñānasattvaikarasaṃ vibhāvya śirasi vajraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ ca samanvāharayann (saman dhārayann Sakurai ed.) abhiṣekam ityādigāthāṃ paṭhitvā / oṃ vajrasattva tvām abhiṣiñcāmi vajranāmābhiṣekataḥ dveṣavajras tvam iti mohavajras tvam ityādinā vā puṣpapātānusṛtasvakulanāmnā vairocanātmanābhiṣiñcet /
tatra vajrasattvasya nāmāni paramādya-anupama-surata-samarasa-vijaya-alala-sattva-mahāsukha-anaṅga-jñāna-sahajavajrāḥ /
vajraśabdaḥ pratyekaṃ saṃbandhanīyaḥ / ṣaṭtathāgatanāmasv eva /
akṣobhyasya hāsa-vilāsa-rati-līlā-lalita-svayaṃbhū-dveṣa-he-karuṇā-citta-hūṃkāra-akṣobhyavajrāḥ //
vairocanasya vairocana-oṃkāra-śāśvata-tathāgata-māyā-buddha-rūpa-kāyavajrāḥ /
ratnasambhavasya ratna-cintāmaṇi-kha-gagana-tejo-mārtaṇḍa-bhāskara-mānavajrāḥ /
amitābhasya rāga-avalokita-dharma-padma-vajrāṅkura-padmāṅkura-suratāṅkura-karuṇāṅkura-paramānanda-suratānanda-amita-vāgvajrāḥ /
amoghasiddheḥ amogha-paramāśva-samaya-pāramitā-karma-anila-sparśa-īrṣyāvajrāḥ //


		28.2 (p.428)

vajrasattvasya strīṇāṃ vajravegī vajravilāsinī vajramadā vajrakoṅkaṇā vajrānanā vajrapatākā vajramālā vajrodayā [ca Tib] /
akṣobhyasya vajranairātmyā vajrahastā vajrāvalī vajrakarā vajramāmakī dveṣaratiś ceti /
vairocanasya vajraḍākinī vajragaurī vajralāsyā vajralocanā moharatiś ceti /
ratnasaṃbhavasya vajrahārā vajrāśvāsā vajrajvālā vajramālā vajrākāśā ākāśaratiś ceti /
amitābhasya vajrarāgā vajragītā vajrāhosukhā vajravetālī vajramatī vajrahāsyā vajrapāṇḍarā rāgaratiś ceti /
amoghasiddheḥ vajragarvā vajramāyā vajravaḍabā vajratārā vajranarteśvarī samayavajrā vajraratiś ceti / nāmābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		28.3 (p.429)
%%
ete mālodakādayaḥ ṣaḍabhiṣekā avidyāvipakṣayogyatāpādanād vidyābhiṣeka ucyate / ebhir abhiṣekaiḥ siktaḥ śiṣyaḥ kriyācaryātantrayoḥ śravaṇavyākhyānamantrasādhaneṣv adhikṛto bhavati / yogayoginītantrāṇām apīty ācāryaṃmanyamatam anāgamam / na hi sahajasekasaṃvaram antareṇa tatsvarūpam abhidhātuṃ kvacid ādiśati sma bhagavān ayuktaṃ vā / 
ete cābhiṣekā ācāryābhiṣekeṇānarthinaḥ sāmānyasaṃvaradānapūrvakaṃ dīyante /
arthinas tūbhayasaṃvarapuraḥsaram /


		29 Trisamayadānavidhi 
		
		29.1 (p.430)

tatas taṃ śiṣyaṃ dattadakṣiṇaṃ kṛtāñjalim /
	vajrācāryābhiṣekaṃ bho mahyaṃ dehi kṛpānidhe /
	svaparārthasamarthaḥ syāṃ yenāhaṃ tvatprasādataḥ // (1 //)
iti paṭhitvā gurvadhyeṣaṇāṃ kṛtavantaṃ vajraṃ hūṃ-jaṃ vajrasattvarūpaṃ dhyātvā /
	anādinidhanaḥ sattvo vajrasattvo mahārataḥ /
	samantabhadraḥ sarvātmā vajragarvāpatiḥ patiḥ /
	paramādyapuruṣo bhagavān // (2 //) 
iti paṭhaṃs tattvena grāhayet // iti vajrasamayaḥ / patir jagataḥ //


		29.2 (p.431)

tato ghaṇṭām āḥ-kārajāṃ dhyātvā 
	iyaṃ sā sarvabuddhānāṃ ghaṇṭā ghoṣānugā smṛtā /
	tvayāpi hi sadā dhāryā bodhir agrā jinair matā // (3 //)
iti paṭhaṃs tattvena grāhayet / ghoṣenānābhogavāhinānugamyamānā / buddhaprajñāvad ghaṇṭā'pi /
śiṣyas tu tām /
	svabhāvaśuddho hi bhavaḥ svabhāvair vibhavīkṛtaḥ /
	svabhāvaśuddhaiḥ satsattvaiḥ kriyate paramo bhavaḥ // (4 //)
iti vadan vādayet / svabhāvair āropitair viruddhabhavīkṛtaḥ / iti ghaṇṭāsamayaḥ /

		29.3 (p.432)
		
tadanu tam /
	mudrā hi samayaḥ prokto manomūrtidṛḍhatvataḥ /
	sarvamūrtir dṛḍhā yena tena mudrā prakīrtitā // (5 //)
iti 
	jñānamudrām adhiṣṭhāya sarvakāmopabhogataḥ 
	sarvāḥ siddhīḥ sādhaya //
iti pratipādya vajrasattvamūrtiṃ jñānamudrāṃ sampuṭakrameṇādhiṣṭhāpyāliṅganābhinayaṃ kārayet / tad uktaṃ paramādyatantre /
	vajraṃ tattvena saṃgrāhya ghaṇṭāṃ dharmeṇa vādya ca /
	samayena mahāmudrām adhiṣṭhāya hṛdā japet // 6 //
iti mudrāsamayaḥ / iti trisamayādānavidhiḥ //



		30. Ācāryābhiṣekavidhi 
		30.1 (p.434)

tadanu gṛhītatrisamayaṃ prāgvat snānamaṇḍale 'nyatra vā tathā bhāvita upaveśya vajrasattvarūpaṃ vibhāvyodakābhiṣekoktavidhinā hṛdbījādi yāvad vajrāgragalitena /
	abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajraṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam /
	dadāmi sarvabuddhānāṃ triguhyālayasaṃbhavaṃ // (1 //)
oṃ āḥ sarvatathāgatābhiṣeka samaya śriye hūṃ svāhā / iti paṭhann abhiṣiñcet / 
tato 'kṣobhyamaulinaṃ vicintyāparatathāgatadevīs tatraiva jñānasattvarūpeṇa praveśya /
oṃ supratiṣṭhita vajre svāhā / iti mantreṇādhiṣṭhāya tasmai puṣpādikaṃ dadyāt / tathā coktaṃ /
	pāṇibhyāṃ tu samāliṅgya prajñāṃ vai ṣoḍaśābdikām /
	ghaṇṭāvajrasamāyogād ācāryasecanaṃ matam // (2 //)
iti //


			30.2 (p.435)

tataḥ saṃkṣepato vairocanasvarūpam idaṃ kūṭāgāram iti maṇḍalasya tattvaṃ viśuddhiḥ /
	pañcaskandhāḥ samāsena pañcabuddhā[ḥ //]
ityādinā devatānāṃ tattvaṃ viśuddhiḥ / paramārthatas tu maṇḍalādīnāṃ kramadvaye 'pi naiḥsvābhāvyātmikā / tathataiva tattvaṃ viśuddhiḥ / saparikaramaṇḍalalikhanādikācāryaparikarma ca kathayet //
evaṃ maṇḍalatattvādīnāṃ jñānam anatikramaṇīyarūpasamayasya kartavyākartavyātmakasaṃvarasya ca tathaiva saṃpādanaṃ bhavyatā bhaṇitā / vistaratas tu maṇḍalatattvādikam asmābhir āmnāyamañjaryām upavarṇitam ity avaivartyābhiṣekāparanāmācāryābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		31. Mantrasamarpaṇavidhi (p.437)

tataḥ svayaṃ sāṣṭaśatajaptaṃ trir japtaṃ vā hṛdayādimantram /
	datto 'si mayā bhagavann asmin sannihito bhava //
iti vadan śiṣyāya dadyāt / śiṣyo 'pi /
	gṛhīto 'si mayā bhagavan mayi sannihito bhava //
ity anena gṛhītvā trir japet / iti mantrasamarpaṇavidhiḥ /
idam eva buddhakapāla-āditantrāntareṣu ghaṇṭāpādaiś ca mantrābhiṣeka uktaḥ //


		32. Añjanavidhi (p.438)

tadanu sauvarṇe rājate vā bhājane nyastena ghṛtamadhvañjanena hemamayyāśalākayā śiṣyasya cakṣuṣoḥ praṃ-kāraṃ dhyātvā / oṃ vajranetrāpahara paṭalaṃ (ed. vajranetrāpaharapaṭalaṃ) hrīḥ / iti paṭhann añjayitvā /
	ajñānapaṭalaṃ vatsa apanītaṃ jinais tava /
	śalākivaidyarājais tu yathā lokasya taimiram // (1 //)
iti vadet / apanītam apanayayogyatāpādanāt / ity añjanavidhiḥ /


		33. Darpaṇābhiṣekavidhi (p.438)

tato darpaṇam ādāya āḥ-kāreṇa mantritaṃ darśayan śiṣyam /
	pratibimbasamā dharmā acchāḥ śuddhā hy anāvilāḥ /
	agrāhyā anabhilāpyāś ca hetukarmasamudbhavāḥ // (1 //)
	darpaṇavad vajrasattvas teṣv acchaḥ śuddho hy anāvilaḥ /
	hṛdi tiṣṭhati te vatsa sarvabuddhādhipaḥ svayam // (2 //)
	evaṃ jñātvā tu vai dharmān niḥsvabhāvān anālayān /
	kuru sattvārtham atulaṃ jāto 'sy urasi tāyinām // (3 //)
iti vadet /
acchaḥ kleśakāluṣyābhāvāt / śuddho jñeyāvṛtivirahāt / anāvilas taddvayavāsanāpagamāt / prakṛtiviśuddhyā 'dyaśloko dvitīyo vaimalyaviśuddhyā / teṣu dharmeṣu tiṣṭhaty adhiṣṭhānāt prāpyatvenālambanāc ca yogyatayā ca / iti darpaṇābhiṣekavidhiḥ //
dvau darpaṇadarśanavidhī bruvāṇena āryanāgabuddhipādīyamaṇḍalopāyikā na dṛṣṭaiva / abhiṣekatvāvivakṣayā tu dvir darśanavidhir uktaḥ kaiścit /


		34. Śarakṣepavidhi (p.440)

tato hoḥ-kārajaṃ dhanuḥ hoḥ iti paṭhan dattvā / sarvatathāgatān anurāgayasva / iti vadet / śarakṣepasamaye ca / śiṣyena sarvatathāgatān anurāgayāmi / iti paṭhatā vighnavedhanabuddhyā caturdikṣu catvāraḥ śarāḥ kṣeptavyā eka ūrdhvam adho 'pare / iti śarakṣepavidhi /


		35. Guhyābhiṣekavidhi 
		35.1 (p.441)

tataḥ kāṇḍapaṭādibhir vijanīkṛte śiṣyo 'bhinavayauvanādisampannāṃ samayinīṃ tadalābhe 'nyāṃ vā prajñāṃ guhyābhiṣekārthaṃ gurave niryātya kṛtāñjalir guruṃ vajrasattvam adhimucya /
	yuṣmat pādaprasādena prāptā me 'nuttarakriyā /
	tasmād guhyābhiṣekeṇa kuru nātha anugraham // (1 //)
iti gāthayādhyeṣayet /


		35.2 (p.442)

tato guruś cakreśāhaṃkāravāṃs tayā prākṛtastrīrūpaśūnyatānanataraṃ niṣpāditadevīrūpayā vajrapadmasaṃskārapūrvakaṃ samāpattiṃ kurvan / oṃ sarvatathāgatānurāgaṇavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham / iti paṭhan hṛdbījamayūkhānītalocanādisamāpannavairocanāditathāgatān ātmani vairocanadvāreṇa praveśya mahārāgeṇa dravībhūyāvadhūtyā nirgacchato vicintya vajramaṇau sahajaṃ sthirīkṛtyāṅguṣṭhānamikābhyāṃ prapīḍya vajramaṇiṃ padmād uddhṛtya taṃ tathāgatadravaṃ svabodhicittābhinnam adhimucya vāgvajrarūpaśiṣyasya vaktre darśanād aprasādaśaṅkayā baddhāndhapaṭatvena dṛṣṭikarāgocaram /
	buddhaputrā yathātītaiḥ siktā vajradharādibhiḥ /
	siñcāmi tvāṃ tathā vatsa bodhicittena cāruṇā // (2 //)
iti maṇḍalādhipamantraṃ ca / oṃ āḥ vajradhṛk hūṃ / ityādikaṃ yathātantraṃ paṭhan pātayet / so 'pi vairocanādisarvatathāgatasamājabuddhyā / aho mahāsukham /
iti vadan pibet /
prajñāpy utthāya nirambaraiva svābjasthatathāmakarandabindūṃs tadānane niveśayet / so 'pi tathā pibed iti prajñopāyayoḥ sāṃśvṛttabodhicittābhyāṃ guhyābhyām abhiṣeka iti guhyābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		36. Prajñājñānābhiṣekavidhi 
		36.1 (p.444)

tadanu tām anyāṃ vā prajñāṃ samayasaṃvarasthām anyāṃ vā rūpayauvanāḍhyāṃ bodhivajreṇetyādigāthayā 'dhyeṣitavati śiṣye /
	iyaṃ te dhāraṇī ramyā sevyā buddhaiḥ prakalpitā /
	cakrakramaprayogeṇa samāsvādaya satsukham //
	vajraparyaṅkataś cittaṃ maṇyantargatam īkṣayan // (1 //)
iti pratipādya samarpayet /


		36.2 (p.445)

sā 'pi kuṅkumādibhiḥ sugandhīkṛtam anambaram ambujaṃ darśayantī śiṣyam
	aho madīyaṃ padmaṃ sarvasukhasamanvitam /
	yaḥ sevayati vidhānena tasyāham agrataḥ sthitā // (2 //)
	kuru padme yathā kāryaṃ saṃbuddhārādhanādikam /
	svayaṃ mahāsukho rājā atraiva hi sadā sthitaḥ // (3 //)
bhaja mokṣa hoḥ / iti vadet /
so 'pi svayaṃ devatāmūrtiḥ prajñāṃ devīrūpāṃ niṣpādya hrīḥ-hūṃ-bhyāṃ janitakamalakuliśayoḥ kiñjalkamaṇī āḥ-oṃ-janitau vajravaktre pīta-phaṭ-kāraṃ vibhāvya vāmāvāmāṅgagatāṃ nāḍīm agrastharakta-hrīḥ-kārayā tarjanyā jihvayā ca śīt-kārapūrvakaṃ sañcālya / oṃ śī śī śī ha ha ha svāhā / iti /  oṃ sarvatathāgatānurāgaṇavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham / iti ca mantram āvartayan gurūpadeśāt pratītānandabhedaḥ svahṛdbījakiraṇākṛṣṭatathāgatādyadhiṣṭhitaśarīro guruṇā ca praveśitāparimitavairocanalocanādyekarasībhūto ratim ārabhet / 
	prajñāsaṃparkataḥ śrīmāṃs tattvaṃ samupalakṣayet /
	vajraparyaṅkataś cittaṃ maṇyantargatam īkṣayan // (4 //)
ity ākalayya yathāśakti saṃdhārya śanair utsṛjya rasanayaivoddhṛtyāmbhoruhāt tattvadṛṣṭyā pibet samayarūpaṃ bodhicittam iti /


		36.3 (p.447)

cakreti savidyavairocanādidevatācakraṃ tasya krameṇa prayoga ānayanaṃ praveśanaṃ vajramārgān nirgamanaṃ ca / vidhānaṃ devīrūpaniṣpādanādikam / mokṣeti mokṣaṃ sarvaprapañcavirahaṃ devatādhirūpaṃ guruṇā vaktavyam / tattvaṃ sarvadharmācintyatā tacchāyānukārāt sahajānandarūpaṃ prajñājñānaṃ tattvam ucyate / cittaṃ bodhicittam / maṇir vajrasya / yadi strīr abhiṣicyamānā tadā maṇiḥ padmasya / īkṣayann īkṣaṇaṃ īkṣas taṃ kurvann īkṣamāṇa ity arthaḥ / iti prajñājñānābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		37. Caturthābhiṣekaḥ (p.448)

tadanantaraṃ vācaiva caturthābhiṣekaṃ dadyāt / tad eva prajñājñānam aṅkuritaṃ bodhicittaṃ bhāvanayā pravardhamānam anāvaraṇatām upetaṃ tattvaṃ sarvadharmācintyatāsvarūpaṃ saptāṅgayuktamahāmudrātmakamahāvajradharasvabhāvaṃ caturthābhiṣekarūpaṃ kathayet / iti caturthābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		38. Vidyāvratadānavidhi (p.448)

tadanantaraṃ tasyāḥ prajñāyāḥ pāṇiṃ śiṣyapāṇau dattvā taddvayaṃ svavāmakareṇa dhṛtvā savajrasavyakaraṃ śiṣyaśirasi dattvā
	sākṣiṇo yūyam atra samarpiteyam asmai mayā //
iti tathāgatān sākṣīkṛtya /
	nānyopāyena buddhatvaṃ śuddhaṃ cedaṃ jagattrayaṃ /
	tasmād viyogam anayā mā kārṣīs tvaṃ kadācana // (1 //)
	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhānāṃ vidyāvratam anuttaraṃ /
	atikrāmati yo mūḍhaḥ siddhis tasya na cottamā // (2 //)
iti vadan vidyāvrataṃ dadyāt / iti vidyāvratadānavidhiḥ /


		39. Vajravratavidhiḥ (p.450)

tadanu śiṣyaṃ vajrasattvarūpaṃ vibhāvya /
	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhatvaṃ vajrasattvakare sthitaṃ /
	tvayāpi hi sadā dhāryaṃ vajrapāṇidṛḍhavrataṃ // (1 //)
iti paṭhan vajraṃ grāhayet / sa tu / oṃ sarvatathāgata siddhi vajrasamaya tiṣṭha eṣa tvāṃ dhārayāmi vajrasattva hīḥ hi hi hi hi hūṃ / iti paṭhan gṛhṇīyāt / iti vajravratavidhiḥ /


		40. Caryāvratadānavidhi 
		40.1 (p.450)

tato buddhakapālasaṃvarahevajrādīnām anyatamahṛnmantreṇa khaṭvāṅgaḍamarupadmabhājanāni trir japtvā
	gṛhṇa dattam ato vīra khaṭvāṅgaṃ ḍamarupātrakaṃ /
	śrīvajrasattvamudreyaṃ bahiradhyātmasaṃsthitā // (1 //)
iti gāthāṃ paṭhan grāhayet / tantrāntaroktaṃ vā khaṭvāṅgādibhyo 'nyac caryāṅgaṃ tattaccakreśahṛnmantramantritaṃ gṛhṇetyādinā grāhayet / tathā ca śrīsamāje /
	jaṭāmukuṭadharaṃ bimbaṃ sitavarṇanibhaṃ mahat /
	kārayed vidhivat sarvaṃ mantrasaṃvarasaṃvṛtam //
	kandamūlaphalaiḥ sarvaṃ bhojyaṃ bhakṣyaṃ samācaret // (2 //)
ityādinā vidyāvrataṃ samādānena kartuṃ caryāvratam uktaṃ /


		40.2 (p.452)

yā tu yoṣit puruṣo vā caryāvrataṃ yācate / tāṃ vajravārāhīrūpāṃ nairātmyārūpāṃ vā puṣpapātānurūpakuladevīrūpāṃ vā puruṣaṃ tu saṃvarahevajrādyanyatamarūpaṃ vicintya tasyāṃ tasmin vā hṛdbījamayūkhair ānītāṃ jñānadevatāṃ praveśya /
	akṣobhyaś cakrirūpeṇāmitābhaḥ kuṇḍalātmakaḥ /
	ratneśaḥ kaṇṭhamālāyāṃ haste vairocanaḥ smṛtaḥ //
	mekhalāyāṃ sthito 'mogha[ḥ] // (3 //)
ity ukter yathākramaṃ cakrīkuṇḍalakaṇṭhikārucakamekhalā akṣobhyāmitābharatnasaṃbhavavairocanāmoghasiddhirūpā jhaṭiti vicintya tatra tattajjñānasattvaṃ tathānītaṃ praveśyākṣobhyādipariṇatāś cakryādimudrā akṣobhyādisvabhāvā evety adhimucya / oṃ dhara dhara dhāraya dhāraya marda marda vajradhṛk phaṭ svāhā / iti mantreṇa trir japtāṃ cakrīṃ tasyās tasya vā śirasi gṛhṇetyādigāthāṃ / strīpakṣe vīreti pāṭhe devīti nikṣipya paṭhann āropayet / oṃ vajradharma samayas tvaṃ hulu hulu ārolik phaṭ svāhā / iti trir japtaṃ kuṇḍaladvayaṃ karṇayoḥ / oṃ vajrasūrya tamovidhūnana samayas tvam ahaṃ ratnadhṛk phaṭ svāhā / iti trir japtāṃ kaṇṭhikāṃ grīvāyām / oṃ śāśvata paramaśāśvata ehy ehi jinajik phaṭ svāhā / iti trir japtaṃ rucakadvayaṃ karayoḥ kaṅkaṇavat / oṃ phu phu hi hi hi prajñādhṛk phaṭ svāhā / iti trir japtāṃ mekhalāṃ śroṇau devīty anantaraṃ vīrety-anantaraṃ vā yathākramaṃ cakrīm akṣobhyarūpiṇīm iti vāgvajrakuṇḍaladvayam iti ratnasaṃbhavakaṇṭhikām iti / rucakaṃ śāśvatātmakam iti / amoghasiddhimekhalām iti prakṣipya gṛhṇetyādikaṃ paṭhet / 


		40.3 (p.455)

yā tu strī puruṣo vā labdhadṛṣṭyādisāmarthyaḥ parārthaṃ vīracaryāvratam ādātum icchati / tāṃ vajravārāhīrūpāṃ taṃ saṃvararūpaṃ jñānasattvaikarasaṃ vicintya cakryādikaṃ prāgvad adhimucya muṇḍamālādikaṃ ca svasvamantradevatāsvabhāvam / oṃ vajravairocanīye hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ (+ svāhā Tib.) / iti trir japtāṃ cakrīṃ tathaivāropayet / pañcabuddhātmakakapālāni ca pañca yad uktaṃ / 
	vairocanīti yan mantraṃ kapālālaṃkṛtaśira[s //]
iti / kapālam iha cakrīrūpam api / oṃ hrīḥ ha ha hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ / iti trir japtaṃ kuṇḍaladvayam / yad uktaṃ /
	saptākṣaramantreṇa kuṇḍalaṃ karṇaśobhanam //
iti / vajravārāhyā mūlamantreṇa / oṃ sarvabuddha-ityādimantreṇa vā trir japtāṃ kaṇṭhikām / yad uktam /
	vajravārāhyā yan mantraṃ kaṇṭhe kaṇṭhikamaṇḍitam //
iti / oṃ hanamahi svāhā hūṃ vauṣaṭ he hūṃ hūṃ ho phaṭ hūṃ iti trir japtaṃ rucakadvayam / yad uktam /
	ṣaḍbhiḥ kavacasya vīreṇa mudreyaṃ gātraśobhanā //
iti / oṃ vaṃ hāṃ yoṃ hrīṃ moṃ hroṃ hrīṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ / iti trir japtāṃ mekhalām / yad uktam /
	ṣaḍyoginyeti mantreṇa mekhalākṛtabhūṣaṇam //
iti /


		40.4 (p.457)

oṃ śrīvajra he he ru ru kaṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ ḍākinījālasaṃvaraṃ svāhā / iti trir japtāṃ pañcāśanmuṇḍamālāṃ grīvāyām / yad uktaṃ / 
	hṛdayamantraṃ tu devasya mālāṃ vai śatārdhabhūṣitam //
iti / oṃ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye vajravarṇanīye hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / iti trir japtaṃ paridhānaṃ ca vyāghracarma / yad uktaṃ /
	sarvabuddhasya ḍākinyā carmāmbaradharāparam //
iti / oṃ pracaṇḍe hūṃ hūṃ phaḍ-ityādibhiḥ oṃ rūpiṇīye hūṃ hūṃ phaḍ-ityantaiḥ ṣaṭtriṃśatā mantrais trir japtaṃ jñānāmṛtapānapātraṃ pāṇau / yad uktaṃ /
	sarvacakrasya yoginyo mantrapāṇakaroṭakam //
iti / khatvāṅgaḍamarū tu bhagavanmūlamantreṇa trir abhimantrya gṛhṇetyādigāthayā / 
śrīsaṃvarasya mūlamantreṇa trir japtaṃ brahmasūtraṃ kaṇṭhāvalambitahāram ābharaṇavajraṃ caurakeśakṛtamukuṭīṃ dviveṣṭanakacaḍorībhasmakeyūraṃ nūpuraṃ ghurghurāṃ ca svasvasthāne / yad uktaṃ /
	mūlamantrasya yad vīraṃ brahmasūtrādikalpitam //
iti / 
	tatra ekayāvalyā brahmasūtraṃ kartavyam aṣṭabhir āvalībhir mekhalā saiva strīkaṭyāṃ ṣoḍaśabhiḥ pañcaviṃśatyā hāraḥ / yad uktam / 
	ekayaṣṭir bhavet sūtraṃ mekhalā tv aṣṭayaṣṭikā /
	rasanā ṣoḍaśā jñeyā pañcaviṃśat tu mālinam // (4 //)
iti /


		40.5 (p.458)

athavā nṛnaharūmayaṃ keśakṛtaṃ vā brahmasūtram / atra cakryādikaṃ yathāyogaṃ nrasthighaṭitam ābharaṇavajrāṇi ca / tad ekaṃ śikhāyām tad uktam /
	pañcāṅgulakhaṇḍaṃ kṛtvā mukuṭyāṃ dhriyate //
iti / anyāni karṇagrīvāhṛdguhyabhujābharaṇasthāni yathā śobhamānāni / ṣaṭtriṃśanmantrā mūlamantrau cāsmābhiḥ śrīsaṃvarābhisamayopāyikāyāṃ saṃvarṇitau / 
	vīracaryāvratam eva yauvarājyavratacaryeti / vajrakāpālikacaryāvratam iti coktaṃ śrīsaṃpuṭatantre / 
	tadanu pañcamudrādikaṃ pūjayet / iti caryāvratadānavidhiḥ /


41. Vyākaraṇavidhi (p.459)

tatas tathāgateryām āracayya sacīvarakarṇikāṃ vāmamuṣṭiṃ hṛdi nidhāya dakṣiṇābhayamudrayā / 
	eṣo 'haṃ vyākaromi tvāṃ vajrasattvas tathāgataḥ /
	bhavadurgatitoddhṛtya atyantabhavaśāntaye // (1 //)
he amukavajra tathāgata siddhya samayas tvaṃ bhūr bhuvaḥ svaḥ / iti mantraṃ paṭhan vyākuryāt / puṣpapātānurūpatathāgatarūpaṃ śiṣyam / yaś caivaṃ vyākriyate sa sarvatathāgataiḥ saṃbodhau vyākriyata iti śraddhātavyam / iti vyākaraṇavidhiḥ.
etāni vidyāvajracaryāvratavyākaraṇāni kvacit tantrādāv abhiṣekatvena vyavahṛtāni / 


		42. Anujñāvidhiḥ
		42.1 (p.460)

tadanu 
	caturthaṃ tat tathā punar
ity anantaram /
	bodhicittābhiṣekeṇa śiṣyāya gatakalmaṣe / 
	anujñāṃ tu tato dadyāt //
iti saṃpuṭokteḥ śiṣyasyāsanāgrataḥ kvacid āsane bhrūṃ-jadharmacakram / oṃ vajrahetu maṃ / iti paṭhan savye kare / oṃ vajrabhāṣa raṃ / iti vadan āḥ-kārajaṃ śaṅkham vāme ādisvarajaṃ pustakam ādisvaraṃ paṭhan antyasvarajāṃ ghaṇṭām antyasvaraṃ paṭhan dattvā taṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayantam / 
	ākāśalakṣaṇaṃ sarvam ākāśaṃ cāpy alakṣaṇam /
	ākāśasamatāyogāt sarvāgrasamatā sphuṭā // (1 //)
	adyaprabhṛti sahacittotpādamātreṇa dharmacakraṃ pravartaya /
	āpūrya hi samantāc ca dharmaśaṅkham anuttaram // (2 //)
iti vadet /
sarvāgreti sarveṣāṃ dharmāṇām agra nirāvaraṇatayā niḥsvabhāvatā sphuṭādhyakṣīkriyate bhāvanayā tvam api tāṃ tathā kuru saṃprati punas tadabhimokṣeṇa dharmacakraṃ pravartayeti sūcayati ghaṇṭā / 


		42.2 (p.462)

evaṃ sāmānyānujñāṃ dattvā 'bhyadhikānujñāṃ dātuṃ yathākramaṃ vairocanādirūpaṃ dhyātvā śiṣyam /
	sarvasattvahitārthāya sarvalokeṣu sarvataḥ /
	yathāvinayato viśvaṃ dharmacakraṃ pravartaya // (3 //)
	prajñopāyasvarūpātmā cintāmaṇir ivoccakaiḥ /
	akhinno vigatāsaṅgaḥ sattvārthaṃ kuru sāṃpratam // (4 //)
iti dharmaśabdasthāne vajraratnapadmakarmaśabdaprakṣepāt pañcadhāpāṭhair anujñāṃ dadyāt /
sa vanditvā vadet /
	evaṃ kariṣyāmi yathājñāpayati prabhuḥ //
ity anujñāvidhiḥ /


		43. Āśvāsavidhi
		43.1 (p.463)

tadanu
	dhārayan śirasi cchatraṃ kārayitvā pradakṣiṇam /
	sāñjaliṃ maṇḍaladvāri sacchatraṃ pātayan vadet //
	ayaṃ niveditaḥ śiṣyas tantradhārī bhaviṣyati // (1 //)
iti / evaṃ maṇḍaleśvaram abhyarthya cchatram anyatra nikṣipya śiṣyasya hṛdayaṃgamaṃ vadet /
	adhunā maṇḍalācāryo mantratantradharo bhavān /
	buddhānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ devatānāṃ ca saṃmataḥ // (2//)
	sattvānām anukampārthaṃ vidhinā maṇḍalaṃ tvayā /
	likhitavyaṃ prayatnena tantre yojyāś ca sādhakāḥ // (3 //)
	dṛṣṭvā praviṣṭvā paramaṃ rahasyottamamaṇḍalam /
	sarvapāpair vinirmukto bhavān adyaiva susthitaḥ // (4 //)
	na bhūyaś cyavanaṃ te 'sti yānād asmān mahāsukhāt /
	nivṛttaṃ bhavaduḥkhaṃ te atyantabhavasiddhaye // (5 //)
	adyābhiṣikta āyuṣman sarvabuddhaiḥ savajribhiḥ /
	traidhātukamahārājyasvāmī tvam iti niścitam // (6 //)
	virāgasadṛśaṃ pāpam anyaṃ nāsti tridhātuke /
	tasmāt kāmavirāgitvaṃ na kāryaṃ bhavatā punaḥ // (7 //)
	sarvakāmopabhogais tu rama tvam akutobhayaḥ /
	pañcamāṃsāmṛtaṃ bhakṣyaṃ rakṣo 'nyaḥ samayo 'py ataḥ // (8 //)
	na hi prāṇivadhaḥ kāryaḥ strīratnaṃ na parityajet /
	ācāryas te na saṃtyājyaḥ saṃvaro duratikramaḥ // (9 //)
	nāsti kiṃcid akartavyaṃ prajñopāyena cetasā /
	mā bhaiṣīr nāsti te pāpaṃ tathāgatavaco yathā // (10 //)
	iti kurūta manaḥ prasādavajraṃ svasamayam akṣayasaukhyadaṃ bhajadhvam /
	jagati laghusukhe 'dya vajrasattvapratisamaśāśvatatāṃgatā bhavantaḥ // (11 //)
api ca dharmataiṣā yad yathāvidhyabhiṣiktaḥ priyaputravat prasannair manobhiḥ kalyāṇāyaiva sarvabuddhabodhisattvaiḥ samanvāhriyate / ity āśvāsavidhiḥ / 


		43.2 (p.466)

śiṣyaś caivaṃ labdhābhiṣeka āśvasto hṛṣṭa
	evaṃ kariṣyāmi /
	adya me saphalaṃ janma saphalaṃ jīvitaṃ ca me /
	adya buddhakule jāto buddhaputro 'smi sāṃpratam // (12 //) iti vaded iti / dakṣiṇāṃ ca karituragaratnajātarūparajatavastrālaṃkāragomahiṣadāsadāsīkarmakarādīn priyabhāryāduhitṛputrādīṃś ca yathāśakti vā gurave satkṛtya dadyāt / balihomabhojyādikaṃ ca kuryād iti /
vinirmukta iti pāpākriyāniyamāt susthitaḥ sukhasugatiniyamāt nirvṛttaṃ dharmakāyalābhāt /atyanteti anidhano bhavaḥ saṃbhogakāyo 'sraṃsananityatayā / vajram abhedyam cittaprasādaṃ gurubuddhādiṣu / svasamayaṃ svadevatādikam / alpasukhe bahuduḥkhe jagati jātā api yūyaṃ niravadyamahāsukhanityatāṃ prāptāḥ /


		44. Svasyābhiṣekavidhi 
		44.1
		44.1.1 (p.468)

	iha puṣpapātopalakṣitatathāgatasvabhāvaśiṣyasya prakṛtipariśuddhim uddīpayituṃ śirasi mālayābhiṣecanam /
	avidyāmalakṣālanayogyatādhānāya salilābhiṣekaḥ /
	tathāgatamudraṇasaṃskārāropaṇāyoṣṇīṣaniṣpattiyogyatāyai ca mukuṭābhiṣekaḥ / kleśādiripūnmūlanāya vīrapaṭṭabandho mukuṭasekasya parikaraḥ / kvacid ayaṃ pṛthagabhiṣeka iti vyavahṛtaḥ / kvacit tu paṭṭabandho noktas tadarthasyāśayaviśeṣān mukuṭasekenāpi siddheḥ /
	utpatsyamānābhedyajñānayogyatām ādhātuṃ vajrābhiṣekaḥ / 
	niruttaraśūnyatākaruṇābhinnajñānodayādhipatyadharmodayāyābodhayituṃ dharmodayāsūcakaghaṇṭayā svanantyābhiṣekaḥ /  tad ādhipatyāyābhiṣeka ādhipatyābhiṣekaś cocyate / 
	bhaviṣyanmunīndrapadocitanāmabījam ādhātuṃ nāmābhiṣekaḥ /
	ete ca jalasekādayaḥ pañca yathākramaṃ suviśuddhadharmadhātusamatāpratyavekṣaṇākṛtyānuṣṭhānādarśajñānabījaparipuṣṭyā tadātmakā adhimoktavyāḥ / jalasekasyādarśajñānātmakatvam apy uktaṃ tattvasaṃgrahe 'kṣobhyo 'py ādarśajñānasvabhāva iti ca /


		44.1.2 (p.470)

itaḥ prabhṛti viśuddhayuganaddhabodhim (-bodham Sakurai ed.) adhigantum uddhurībhaveti niyamanākṛtena tatsvabhāvavajradhāraṇaniyamanaṃ vajrasamayaḥ /
caturaśītidharmaskandhasahasradeśanānidānatathatādhigatiniyojanāya sadhvanighaṇṭāsamayaḥ /
prajñopāyamayamahāsukhātmakasambuddhasvabhāvasudṛḍhayogyatādhānāya mudrāsamayaḥ / ata eva samayadvayaparikarito mudrāsamaya eva sambuddhābhiṣeka ukto ḍākinīvajrapañjare / tantrāntare tu samayatrayam ācāryābhiṣekasya parikara uktaḥ / tathā coktaṃ prāk pāṇibhyāṃ tv ityādi / malakṣālanayogyatā tu samayasya vyavasthādvaye 'py astīty avirodhaḥ /
yathā daśamyāṃ (daśabhyāṃ Sakurai ed.) bhūmāv avaivārtikā (avaivartya- Sakurai ed.)mahābodhisattvā daśadiktathāgatair abhiṣicyante / tathāyam api samayatrayaparikaritas tair guruṇā cāparimitasattvarāśer niravadhideśanādibhir ācāryīkartuṃ traidhātukadharmarājye 'bhiṣicyata ity ācāryābhiṣeko 'vaivartikānām ivety avaivartikābhiṣekaś ca / avaivartikatvabījāṃ caivam ādhīyate / 
ata eva tadapekṣayā 'vaivartyāyābhiṣeko 'vivartāyābhiṣeka ity avaivartyaseko 'vivartasekaś cocyate / ata eva
	ācāryākhyas tridhā vajraguhyajñānair ihocyate //
iti mataṃ durmatīnām eva /


		44.1.3 (p.471)

niṣpratyūhatāyai śāntyādisiddhibījādhānāya pāramārthikamantrasiddhikṣetraśuddhaye ca mantrapāṭhanam /
	ajñānapaṭalāpanayena divyacakṣurabhijñotpattaye 'ñjanam /
	tayā ca pratibimbavadviśvadarśanasaṃskāram āropayituṃ darpaṇābhiṣekaḥ /
	caturmāravijayāt sūkṣmatamadharmadhātulakṣyaprativedhabījāropaṇāya śarakṣepaḥ /
	śraddhāprajñākṣetrīkaraṇārthaṃ samayarakṣaṇārthaṃ vākśuddhyarthaṃ ca guhyābhiṣekaḥ /
prakṛṣṭaṃ jñānam asyām iti prajñā bāhyāṅganā tasyāṃ jñānaṃ cittaṃ vikalpāpagamād viśuddhaṃ sahajānandaḥ / prajñājñānābhiṣekaḥ /
tad eva jñānaṃ vaimalyapariśuddhyādhigataṃ (-śuddhyadhi- Sakurai ed.) caturthābhiṣekaḥ /
manaso mahāsukharasena secanād apy abhiṣekāv etau /


		44.1.4 (p. 473)

etatsaṃbaddham eva prajñaiva nirāsravasatsukhasamṛddheḥ sākṣād upāyatvāt prāthamikādyavasthāsv apy aparihāryeti vidyāvratam /
	sopāyaṃ sarvakarmāṇi nirvikalpaś cared yadā /
	nirvikalpena bhāvena vratānām uttamottamam // (1 //)
iti vajraḍāka-bhaṇiteḥ kim anyair vratair iti pañcajñānamayabodhicittavrata evātyantaṃ niyojayituṃ vajravratam /
bodhicittādhigamaś ca na vinā caryayeti śikṣaṇārthaṃ caryāvratam / tasya trayaḥ prakārāḥ /
	tatrādyo 'dhyātmamudrātrayaniyojanaparaḥ / tathā coktaṃ /
	khaṭvāṅgaṃ devatāmūrtiḥ prajñāḍamarukalpitam //
iti
	mantrapānakaroṭakam //
iti ca / devatāśarīram anāhatarūpacaṇḍālīnādo 'dvayamahāsukhānubhavāśrayasāṃvṛtabodhicittaṃ ceti trayapratipādakam /
dvitīyaḥ pañcasuviśuddhadharmadhātujñānādijanananiyojanaparo yoginyāś caryāvratinaś ca /
 tṛtīyaḥ satyāṃ dṛṣṭicatuṣṭayābhijñādiśaktau sattvārthasaṃpādanaparasya lokabahirbhūtasya yogino yoginyā vā 'dhyātmaṃ (bāhyādhyātmaṃ Sakurai ed.) samantābharaṇārthasamarthanaparaṃ śūnyatorukaruṇāmayabodhicittodayaniyojanam /
tathā coktaṃ yoginīsañcāratantre /
	prathamaṃ samāhito yogī śaktim utpādya yatnataḥ /
	paścād utpannasāmarthyo vratacaryāmanepsitam // (2 //)
	pañcavarṇasamācāra ekavarṇaṃ tu kalpitam /
	nirvikalpaikacittātmā bhuñjīta kāmapañcakam // (3 //)
	evaṃ śrīherukajñānī sarvāśāparipūrakaḥ /
	karoti sa mahāprajño 'dvayajñānasuvratam /
	caryāvratapravṛttasya jñeyaṃ yogasuniścitam // (4 //)
iti /

		44.1.5 (p.475)

traidhātukāvyativartidharmatādhigamakramayogyas tvam ity uddīpayituṃ vyākaraṇam /
tathā hi bhūḥ savāyumaṇḍalādiparikaraṃ pātālam / bhuva iti bhūr martyalokaḥ / svaḥ svargo naivasaṃjñānāsaṃjñāyatanaparyantas tattrayam api tvaṃ yatas tatsvabhāvatattvasya samayaḥ pramuditādibhūmikrameṇādhigantāsi yogyatayeti / samayas tvaṃ bhūr bhuvaḥ svar ity asyārthaḥ /
yathāvidhi siddhiṃ prasādhya dharmadeśanādibhiḥ sattvārthaṃ kurv ity anujñā /
kāmān upabhuñjāno 'pi sarvāvaraṇanirmukto buddhas tvam adyaiveti maṇḍalapraveśādikṛtapuṣṭiyogyatābhisaṃdhinā bodhanād āśvāsaḥ /


		44.1.6 (p.476)

ete vajravratādayaḥ pañcāpy ācāryasekāntaraṃ vidyāsekānantaraṃ ca tattanmātrasaṃtuṣṭānām anujñāyante kaiścit / mantrāñjanadarpaṇaśarakṣepāś ca vidyāsekānantaram api / vidyāvrataṃ prajñābhiṣekānantaram api kvacit / kvacit punar mantrādikaṃ caryāvrataṃ sāmānyānujñā ca samayatrayaṃ bhavyatā ca noktā yathāyogam abhiṣekāntareṣu tattadarthāntarbhāvābhisaṃdhinā / kvacid anujñāśvāsāv avivarte 'ntarbhāvitau / iha tu pṛthak sarvam abhihitam /
yad tūktaṃ ḍākinīvajrapañjaratantre
	prathamaṃ toyasekena dvitīyaṃ maulisekataḥ  /
	tṛtīyaṃ vajrasekena svādhipatyaṃ caturthakam // (5 //)
	pañcamaṃ secayen nāmnā ṣaṣṭhaṃ (corr. from ṣaṣṭaṃ) sambuddham eva ca /
	kalaśasekaṃ tu saptamam aṣṭamaṃ guhyasekena // (6 //)
	navamaṃ prajñābhiṣekataḥ // 
	tattvavajraprayogeṇa sarvān vajravrataṃ dadet /
	vyākaroti svayaṃ śāstā eṣa sekavidhikramaḥ // (7 //)
iti / tatra mālāsekasyodakasekādikāraṇatvena mantrādīnāṃ tu yathāyogam ācāryasekasya caturthasekasya kadācid anyasya ca parikaratvena tantrāntaroktitaḥ pratipattavyatvād anabhidhānam /
ata eva coktaṃ śrīsamāje /
	abhiṣekaṃ tridhābhinnam asmiṃs tantre prakalpitam /
	kalaśābhiṣekaṃ prathamaṃ dvitīyaṃ guhyasekataḥ /
	prajñājñānaṃ tṛtīyam vai caturthaṃ tat punas tathā // (8 //)
iti / śrīsaṃpuṭe ca /
	tac cābhiṣekaṃ caturvidham /
	prathamaṃ kalaśābhiṣekam dvitīyaṃ guhyābhiṣekataḥ /
	prajñājñānaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ tat tathā punaḥ // (9 //)
iti / dvikalpatantre ca /
	ācāryaguhyaprajñā ca caturthaṃ tat punas tathā //
iti /
tatra jalamaulivajrādhipatyanāmācāryabhedāt ṣoḍhā kalaśābhiṣekaḥ / sarvatra tathāgatalocanādividyābhiḥ kalaśair abhiṣecanāt / ācāryābhiṣekasya paramopādeyatvena sātiśayasecanāt / kalaśasekaṃ tu saptamam ity uktam / tasyācāryasekasyodayakramakāraṇatvenodakasekādipañcakam apy ācāryābhiṣecanam uktam iti sarvam aviruddham / evam eṣa parasyābhiṣekavidhiḥ /


		44.2 Svasyābhiṣekavidhi (p. 479)

svayam api samayakṣatāv īdṛśam evābhiṣekaṃ yathācāryapraveśavidhau grahaṇam uktaṃ tathā gṛhṇīyāt / kiṃtu yadi sadgurur atidūre durgamārgādyupadravair agamyapradeśe (ayam ya pradeśe Sakurai ed.) vā prativasati nānyathā / sadā samādānatas tu prajñopāyāyaikarasasveṣṭadevatāyogena bhāvitamanomayamaṇḍale maṇḍaleśād udakābhiṣekādikaṃ guhyaprajñājñānacaturthaparyantam āśvāsaparyantaṃ ca gṛhṇīteti svasyābhiṣekavidhiḥ /

		44.3 (p.479)

asya punar vajrasattvasaṃvariṇo dvāv āpattinikāyau mūlāpattiḥ sthūlāpattiś ca te ca vivṛta  [corr,; vivṛte ed.] āmnāyamañjaryām / gurvavajñādidoṣe yathāśaktyā dānaṃ bhojyaṃpuraḥsaraṃ (bhoja- Sakurai ed.) dattvā guroḥ purato deśanāpūrvakaṃ saṃvaram pūrvavad gṛhṇīyāt / iti sāmnāyaḥ saparikaro 'bhiṣekavidhiḥ.


		45. Homavidhi
		45.1 (p.480)

iha pūrvam uktaṃ vignādiśāntyādyarthaṃ hotavyam iti / tato /
	vinā homena saṃsiddhir naiva karmasu jāyate /
	śāntipuṣṭyādisiddhyarthaṃ homakarma samārabhet //
ity ukteś ca yathāvasaraṃ homo vidheyaḥ /
tatra
	sattvabhedād anantāni kulabhedena pañcadhā /
	caturdhā karmabhedena kuṇḍānīty eṣa nirṇayaḥ //
ity uktaṃ bhagavatā /


	45.2 (p.481)

vajrakrodhasamāpattiguhyatantre tu daśottaraśataprakāraṃ kuṇḍaṃ nirdiṣṭaṃ karmabhedena / tad yathā / śāntike parimaṇḍalaṃ / pauṣṭike caturasraṃ / abhicāre trikoṇaṃ / ākarśe 'ṅkuśākāraṃ / vaśīkaraṇevajrākāraṃ / dhanadhānyākarṣaṇe ratnākāraṃ / kāmarūpitve liṅgākāraṃ / antardhāne danuḥśarākāraṃ / ājñāpane khaḍgākāraṃ / papapraṇāśane vṛttaṃ satoraṇākāraṃ / vidyārāgaṇe svakulamudrākāraṃ / ākāśagamane vyomamaṇḍalākāraṃ / vidyottejane sajvālākāraṃ / mahāmaṇḍalasādhane cakrākāraṃ / sarvakarmasu caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ bāhyamaṇḍalaṃ sūtrayitvā pūrvato vajrakhacitaṃ dakṣiṇe ratnakhacitaṃ paścime padmakhacitaṃ  uttare karmavajrakhacitam ityādikam / punas trikoṇaṃ vaśye trikoṇam ardhacandraṃ cābhicāruka iti /


		45.3 (p.482)

susiddhikare vajrāmale vairocanābhisambodhau trisamayarāje samantābhiṣekajanane vajrapāṇigarbhasambhave vajrābhyudaye ca tantre sārvakarmikaṃ caturasraṃ kuṇḍaṃ hastamātraṃ khātam ardhahastapramāṇaṃ kuṇḍasyoparītyādikam uktam /
subāhuparipṛcchāyāṃ padmasambhave supratiṣṭhite ca tantre padmākṛti kuṇḍaṃ sārvakarmikaṃ vartulaṃ hastamātraṃ samantato 'rdhahastaṃ pramāṇaṃ adhaḥ khātam aṣṭapadmaparivāritamadhyapadmaṃ kuṇḍopari caturaṅgulāngaraṃ tyaktvā tiryagucchrayābhyāṃ caturaṅgulā kuṇḍanirgataprotphulladalākārā vedī / vedikābahiḥ padmamālāpariveṣṭitaṃ kuṇḍamadhye dikpadmeṣu vajraratnapadmaviśvavajrāṇi vidikpadmeṣu locanayugaṃ trisūcikavajraṃ padmam utpalaṃ ca / madhyapadme 'ṣṭāracakram.
abhyantare kuṇḍaparyante vajramālāparikṣiptaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sārvakarmikam ityādikaṃ uktam /


		45.4 (p.483)

kālacakre tu śāntau vartulaṃ kuṇḍam ekahastam / puṣṭau caturasraṃ dvihastaṃ / abhicāre dhaurākāraṃ ardhahastaṃ / ākṛṣṭau trikoṇaṃ viṃśatyaṅgulam / vidveṣe pañcakoṇaṃ vṛttapramāṇaṃ / mohane ṣaṭkoṇaṃ triṃśadaṅgulam / vaśye saptakoṇaṃ catvāriṃśadaṅgulam / stambhane 'ṣṭakoṇaṃ ṣaṣṭyaṅgulaṃ / sarvatra kuṇḍārdhamānā khāniḥ sārvakarmikaṃ vṛttaṃ kuṇḍam ityādikam uktam /
śrībuddhakapālatantre tu
	śāntike caturasraṃ kuṇḍam adhordhvaṃ ca vitastikam /
	pauṣṭikaṃ vartulaṃ kuṇḍaṃ adhordhvena vitastitrayam //
	vaśye trikoṇaṃ kuṇḍam adhordhvenāṅgulāṣṭakam /
	abhicāre 'rdhacandrākārakuṇḍam adhordhve hastapramāṇataḥ //
ityādikam uktam /


		45.5 (p.484)

tathā sārvakarmikakuṇḍe śāntipuṣṭivaśyābhicārādīnāṃ siddhāv api pṛthak pratyekaṃ kuṇḍam uktaṃ tantreṣu / tathā śāntyādikuṇḍānāṃ pratyekaṃ karmaṇi sārvakarmikasya ca madhye oṣṭhe vedyāṃ tadbahiś ca saṃsthānavarṇacihnaracanābhedo bhūmiviśeṣo digviśeṣo hotuś cāgnidevatāyāś ca nepathyāsanasaṃsthānadiṅmukhādibhedo homakriyākālaviśeṣaś ca keṣucit tantreṣu pratipāditās tantrānatreṣv anyathā pratipādyante /
dṛḍhādhimokṣasya hi vajrasattvamūrter yogino (yoginyo Sakurai ed.) māyāvacchūnyataikarasaviśvapratibhāsadārḍhyād dayāmayasya parārthaṃ pravṛtteḥ sarvam idam abhimataniṣpattaye prabhavatītyākṛtena vineyāśayavaicitryāc ca vicitrā vyavasthitir iyaṃ dayāmayamūrtīnām /
evaṃ ca sarvam avagamyāsmābhis tattvasaṃgraha-ādiyogayoginītantrānuvṛttyā bahupracāraṃ sāmnāyaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ sphuṭaṃ niṣṭaṅkitaṃ kuṇḍalakṣaṇādikaṃ homavidhānaṃ ca jyotirmañjaryām atas tata eva tat sarvam avadhārya hotavyaṃ kim iha bhūyas tad abhidhānenetīha jñātavyo jyotirmañjarīhomavidhiḥ /


		46. Maṇḍalopasaṃhārādividhi
		46.1 (p.486)

tato yathāvidhi pauṣṭikaṃ śāntikaṃ ca homaṃ kṛtvā maṇḍalaṃ svayaṃ sampūjya sarve yathāśaktitas tathāgatādīn pūjayantv iti śiṣyādīn pūjāṃ kārayitvā praviṣṭāṃś ca bhakṣyabhojyalehyamadanādibhiś cakraniryātitaiḥ saṃtarpataiḥ saha rātrijāgareṇa nṛtyagītādibhir bodhicittapratipattyā ca sampūjya na kasyacid yuṣmābhir atratyavṛttaṃ vaktavyam ity uktvā
	prārthayed dakṣiṇāṃ śiṣyaṃ deyaṃ tenāpi bhaktitaḥ /
	ratnaṃ priyatamāṃ patnīṃ svaśarīraṃ vasundharām //
	saṃkṣepāt tādṛśaṃ kāryaṃ yathā tuṣyati sadguruḥ /
	tuṣṭe gurau bhavet siddhir nānyatheti jagau muniḥ //
	kiṃ tena na kṛtaṃ puṇyaṃ kiṃ vā nopāsitaṃ tapaḥ /
	anuttarakṛdācāryavajrasattvaprapūjanāt //
iti cintayatā /


		46.2 (p.487)

tataḥ śiṣyān prasthāpya bahir vihitadigbalipūjādiko 'ntaḥpraviśya cakraṃ praṇamyārghādikaṃ cakreśāya dattvā kuśalaṃ pariṇamayya maṇḍalaṃ triḥ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya pūrvadvāri sthito bhagavadabhimukhaḥ śatākṣaraṃ triḥ paṭhitvāprāptyā cetyādinā kṣamayitvā oṃ kṛto va ityādi oṃ āḥ hūṃ vajra muḥ iti jñānacakraṃ visarjya svanirmitamaṇḍalam ātmany antarbhāvya oṃ akāro mukhaṃ sarvadharmāṇām ādyanutpannatvāt oṃ āḥ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / oṃ āḥ hūṃ muḥ / ity uccārayan sarvadharmānutpādam adhimuñcan ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan karasthavajreṇa prāgdvāram ārabhya brahmasūtramārgeṇa nāyakasthānaṃ yāval lopayan svaśirasi rajastruṭimātraṃ dattvā padmādikaṃ lopayet / tato dvārāṇi koṇāṃś ca karasthavajrarekhābhir utkiret /
tadanu oṃ vajrakīla utkīlaya sarvakīlān vajradharājñayā hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ hoḥ / iti catur-hūṃ-kāramantreṇa kīlakān utpādya / oṃ ru ru sphuru jvala tiṣṭha siddhalocane sarvārthasādhanani svāhā / iti sāṣṭaśatajaptakṣīreṇa snāpayet / kīlakadevatāś ca visarjayet / garttāṃś cāpūrayet /


		46.3 (p.489)

śāntyādyartham arthine stokaṃ rajo dattvāparaṃ sarvaṃ rajo vijayakalaśe  'nyasmin vā nūtanaghaṭe vastramaṇḍite bhūtvā gajopari dolayā vā dānapatidattavastramaṇḍitayoginyādhṛtaṃ dolāgatasyācāryasya śiṣyasya vā ghaṇṭānādair maṅgalagītavāditracchatradhvajāpūjābhir nītvā mahānadyāṃ mahāhrade gambhīrāmbhasi vā tīre niṣadya gomayalipte sitagandhair maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā padmasya varaṭe vajrasattvaṃ daleṣu nāgān pūrvavat sampūjya nāgabalimantreṇa kṣīrabaliṃ dattvā pūjayitvā nāgeṣu rajaḥ samarpya pravāhayet / nāgaiś ca mahatā satkāreṇa pātālatale nīyamānaṃ cintayet / yatra rajonītaṃ taṃ ghaṭam udakapūrṇaṃ kṛtvā tathaivānāyya tena śāntyarthaṃ maṇḍalagṛhādau secayet / gomayalepite maṇḍalagṛhe kumārīḥ pāyasaṃ bhojayet /


		46.4 (p.490)

acāryeṇa tataḥ sarvaṃ saṃhṛtyaupayikaṃ dhanaṃ
	svayam evopabhoktavyaṃ śiṣyādyair naiva kiñcana /
	garttāpūre pratiṣṭhāyāṃ home cakre ca yad dhanam //
	ācāryasyaiva tat sarvam ity āha varavajrabhṛt //
dānapatis tu pratiṣṭhitapratimādikaṃ cālanārthaṃ vādyādipūjayā svasthāne nītvā pūjayed ācāryaṃ dvārācāryān karmavajriṇaṃ yoginīḥ śilpinaś ca yathārhaṃ yathāśakti vastrādibhis tāmbūlādibhiś ca prīṇayet / saṃghabhojyaṃ gaṇacakraṃ ca dadyāt / dīnānāthāṃś ca tarpayed iti maṇḍalopasaṃhārādividhiḥ /


		47. Mānaso maṇḍalavidhi (p.492)

evam ayaṃ lekhyamaṇḍalavidhiḥ / ayaṃ ca lekhyavidhir manasānuṣṭhitavidhinaiva phalavān iti mānasavidhir eva śreyān ato maṇḍalādhiparūpo bhūmiparigrahādikaṃ pratimādipratiṣṭhāśiṣyābhiṣekavisarjanaśāntikahomaparyantaṃ sarvaṃ manasā kuryāt / ata eva yadā sarvam idaṃ kutaścid vaiguṇyāt kartuṃ na śakyate na yujyate na prāpyate vā tadā dhyātvā kartavyam / saty api hi bāhye vastuni dhyānam eva pradhānaṃ kevalaṃ lokasya darśanadānābhiprasādādinā puṇyavṛddhaye bāhyavidhir iṣṭaḥ / sāmagrīvaikalyāt tu dhyātvaiva sarvo vidhir vidheya ity uktaṃ prācīnācāryaiḥ / tasmād ādikarmiko 'pi sthiracitto manasā nirmitamaṇḍale pūrvavat pratiṣṭhāṃ kuryāt / bhavyajanaṃ cābhiṣiñcet /
	tathā coktaṃ śrībuddhakapālatantre
	prajñākamalodaramadhye koṭiyojanaṃ maṇḍalam /
	tripuṭaṃ tasmin maṇḍalamadhye suśiṣyaṃ secayed budhaḥ //
iti / anyatra coktaṃ
	manasā kvacid eveṣṭā jinaiḥ sanmaṇḍalakriyā //
itīti mānaso maṇḍalavidhiḥ /



		48. Balividhi 
		48.1 Sāmājikasārvabhautikabalividhi 
		48.1.1 (p.493)

atroktavidhiṣu kāryāntareṣu vādāv ante ca vighnopaśāntaye baliṃ dadyāt / tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ / prathamam ācāryo yathālabdhamukuṭādibhūṣitaḥ śrīvajrasattvamūrtiḥ purataḥ piṭakādimahāpātreṣu bhaktāpūpaparpaṭalaḍukājambuḍikādimatsyamāṃsapalāṇḍurasonamadyapānīyakṣīrādikaṃ puṣpādibhir yuktaṃ vitānādimaṇḍitaṃ vāditrādipuraskṛtaṃ bhaktapānīyādimātrakaṃ vā yathālābhaṃ saṃsthāyya bhakṣyabhojyalehyapeyāni śodhayet /


		48.1.2 (p.494)

tatra yaṃ-javāyūpari raṃ-jāgnau āḥ-kārajaśubhrābjabhājanaṃ oṃ-āḥ-hūṃ-jatrimuṇḍasthaṃ tatra bhaktādikaṃ hūṃ-būṃ-āṃ-hrīḥ-khaṃ-bhrūṃ-hūṃ-hrīḥ-tāṃ-kārajatadadhiṣṭhitapañcāmṛtapradīparūpaṃ ha-ho-hrī-kārair yathākramaṃ kṛtaprākṛtagandhavarṇavīryaṃ vāyūttejitajvalitāgnitāpavilīnākṣarādikaṃ tadbāṣpottha-hūṃ-ja-vajrāṅkakhaṭvāṅgasya vilīya tatra triḥ pātenāmṛtībhūtaṃ tadupari oṃ-jacandrastha-oṃ-āḥ-hūṃ-kāraraśmibhir diggatatathāgatānāṃ bodhicittāmṛtaṃ sāgarādisthaṃ ca tryakṣaracandrau ca tatra praveśya tris tryakṣareṇādhitiṣṭhet svacchapāradopamam ity amṛtasādhanaṃ / 


		48.1.3 (p.495)

tadanu piṇḍīkramavidhinā caturaṅgavidhinā vā krameṇa jhaṭiti vā vajradhararūpaḥ purataḥ sugandhādinā kṛtamaṇḍale svamaṇḍaleśādisarvatathāgatādīn sampūjyākṣobhyavajretyādibhiḥ stutvā svahṛdbījamayūkhaiḥ sakrodhadaśārarakṣācakranābhisthitakūṭāgārāntaḥsthamaṇḍalam indrādīn saparivārān nāgān sarvasattvāṃś cākṛṣyendrādīn jhaṭiti prabhāsvarapraveśānantaraṃ saprajñasāmājikadevatārūpān vicintya purataḥ pādyādidānapuraḥsaraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan vajram ullālayan śūnyatākaruṇābhinnabodhicittādhimokṣeṇa trimaṇḍalapariśuddhyā baliṃ / oṃ āḥ amukavajra-iti svacakreśādisumbhāntadevatāḥ pratyekaṃ sambodhya tadbījaṃ coccārya sarvaduṣṭasamayamudrāprabhañjaka mama śāntiṃ rakṣāṃ ca kuru svāhā hūṃ / oṃ āḥ sarvatryadhvajadaśadiglokadhātvanantagaganasamudrameghavyūhaprasaraparamāṇurajomaṇḍalaparamparāntargatasamāpattyavasthitā dharmadhātusamavaśaraṇā ākāśadhātuparyavasānāḥ sarvatryadhvajadaśadiglokadhātvanantameghavyūhaprasaragaganasamāḥ sarvalokapālāḥ sarvasattvāś ca / tad yathā / vajrāyudha-māyāvajra-vajrānala-vajrakāla-vajramuṣala-nāgavajra-vajrānila-vajrabhairava-vajraśauṇḍa-vajrakrodha-vajrakuṇḍali-vajraprabha-maunavajra-vemacitri-pṛthvīdevatāḥ saparivārā imaṃ puṣpadhūpadīpagandhanivedyādisaṃyutaṃ balyupahāraṃ pratīcchyopabhujya mama hiraṇyasuvarṇadhanadhānyāyūryauvanārogyasatsukhāpahārakān sarvavighnavināyakān sarvaduṣṭapraduṣṭān manuṣyāmanuṣyān jambhayata stambhayata bandhayata vidhvaṃsayata mama hiraṇyasuvarṇadhanadhānyāyūryauvanārogyasatsukhāni mahāsukhapravṛddhaye yāvad ābodhimaṇḍaparyantaṃ ḍhaukayata satsahāyatāṃ śāntiṃ rakṣāṃ ca kuruta hūṃ / iti mantrābhyāṃ dadyāt nāgabalimantreṇa ca tāṃś ca svamaṇḍalādhipaprabhṛtīn sumbhāntāṃs tadanv indrādīn saparivārāṃs tadanu nāgāṃs tadanu sarvasattvān hūṃ-jaraktaikaśūkavajrajihvāṃs tadraśminalībhir manasā vākṛṣṭaṃ amṛtam upabhuñjanāt mahāsukhamayān sūnyataikarasān yāvad icchaṃ cintayet /


		48.1.4 (p.497)

ācamanahastaproñchanatāmbūlādikaṃ dattvā sampūjya kāryasampādanaparān kṣamayitvā śatākṣaramantraṃ prāguktam āvartya / oṃ yogaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho 'ham / iti paṭhan kamalāvarttam āliṅganamudrām ca kurvan svadevatācakram ātmani praveśya rakṣācakrasthadaśakrodhān indrādīṃś ca maṇḍalagṛhasya bahir daśasu dikṣu rakṣādikābhimataniṣpādanapravaṇān vyavasthāpayet / maṇḍalakarmaṇa ārambhāt prabhṛti yāvad avasānaṃ rajomaṇḍalavisarjanānantaram tv evaṃ balidānādikaṃ kṛtvā krodhān apy ātmani niveśya cchoṭītrayaṃ dadad indrādīn yathāsthānaṃ visṛjet /


		48.1.5 (p.498)

anyatrāpi pratyahaṃ pratisandhyaṃ vā balidāne evaṃ / imaṃ visarjanamantraṃ /
	oṃ kṛto vaḥ sarvasattvārthaḥ siddhir dattā yathānugā /
	gacchadhvaṃ buddhaviṣayaṃ punar āgamanāya muḥ //
iti / oṃ āḥ hūṃ akāro mukhaṃ sarvadharmāṇām ādyanutpannatvāt hūṃ muḥ iti vā / oṃ āḥ hūṃ vajra muḥ / iti vā paṭhan visarjayed iti / atra śāntyādimukhyakāryabhedaḥ kāladigvarnabhedo boddhavyaḥ /
maṇḍalagṛhādibahiḥ pūrvādidikṣu daśakrodhānāṃ mṛtpiṇdīsamīpe purato balibhaktādikaṃ bhārapiṭakādibhiḥ śarāvair añjalibhir vā dāpayed / mṛtpiṇḍībhyo bahiḥ pañcadaśamṛtpiṇḍīnāṃ tadabhāve maṇḍalānām uparīndrādīnāṃ pañcadaśānām aṣṭadikṣu dāpayet /
indrasya savyapārśve māyāvajrasya viṣṇoḥ / vajrabhairavaḥ kuberas tasya savyapārśve vināyakasya / vajrakrodha īśānaḥ / īśānopendrayor madhye sūryacandrabrahmaṇāṃ / varuṇanirṛtyor antare vemacitripṛthivīdevatayoḥ / pañcadaśapatākāś cendrādīnāṃ svasvavarṇāḥ svasvadiśi / indrādimṛtpiṇḍībhyo bahir aṣṭamṛtpiṇḍīṣu gomayakṛtamaṇḍaleṣu vā nāgānāṃ kṣīraśarāvādīn dāpayet / bahiś ca balibhaktādikaṃ pañca ca ghṛtamadhūdakamadyadugdhadhārāḥ pradakṣiṇataḥ prakiret /


		48.1.6 (p.500)

anyārtham api balipradāne mantre yathāsambhavaṃ me mama-iti vā yathāvasthitam eva paṭhanīyaṃ / sa cātmatvenādhimoktavyaḥ / asyopakāre mamaivopakāro bhavatīty āśayato hi tatkāryasiddhir bhavati / antare ca tadarthaṃ vijñāpayed iti sāmājikaḥ sārvabhautikabalividhiḥ /
dharmadhātusamavasaraṇā-ityādi śūnyataikarasāḥ sūnyatāparyavasānāś cety arthaḥ / atra balividhau daśakrodhānāṃ baliḥ prātisvikamantrais tantroktair dīyamānaḥ sutarāṃ praśasto bhavati / te ca mantrā vistarabhayād atra noktāḥ /


		48.2 Sāṃvarikasārvabhautikabalividhi 
		48.2.1 (p.501)

athavā śrīsaṃvararūpaḥ sugandhādikṛtamaṇḍale svacakraṃ sampūjyāṣṭapadamantraiḥ stutvā svahṛdistha-hūṃ-kāraraśmibhiḥ sakrodhadaśārarakṣācakranābhyantargatakūṭāgārodarasthamaṇḍalaṃ rakṣācakrabahir dikṣv indrādīn saparivārān aparimitasattvāṃś cākṛṣyāmbare lalāṭopari jvālāmudrāṃ kṛtvā hed iti sāṭopaṃ trir uccaryāvāhayen maṇḍalaṃ purataḥ / oṃ kakka kaṭṭana bandha bandhana khakhkha khādana sarvadhuṣṭānāṃ hana hana ghaggha ghāṭaya amukasya śāntiṃ kuru hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ jaḥ svāhā / ity anena tv āvāhyendrādīn jhaṭiti śūnyatāpraveśānantaraṃ saprajñasāṃvarikadevatāmūrtīn vibhāvya pādyādidānapūrvakaṃ pūrvavat trimaṇḍalaviśuddhyā vāmakaratale candrasthita-hūṃ-javiśvavajranābhāv amṛtabhāṇḍam āropya dhyātvā vā vajramuṣṭīkṛtasavyakaraprasṛtatarjanyā taddarśayan bhagavatas tat prajñāyā ḍākinyādīnāṃ kākāsyādīnāṃ ca yathāyogaṃ dikṣu vāmāvartena vidikṣv agnikoṇam ārabhya dakṣiṇāvarttena bhrāmayan / oṃ vajraḍāka imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa hūṃ phaṭ oṃ jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ samayas tvam dṛṣya hoḥ / iti mantreṇaikadvitricatuḥpañcavāroccāritena ḍhaukayitvā tricakradevatānāṃ oṃ kara kara kuru kuru bandha bandha trāsaya trāsaya kṣobhaya kṣobhaya hrauṃ hrauṃ hraḥ hraḥ hoṃ hoṃ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ daha daha paca paca bhakṣa bhakṣa vasarudhirāntramālāvalambine gṛhṇa gṛhṇa saptapātālagatabhujaṅgasarpaṃ vā tarjaya tarjraya ākaṭṭa ākaṭṭa hrīṃ hrīṃ hjoṃ hjoṃ kṣmāṃ kṣmāṃ hāṃ hāṃ hīṃ hīṃ hūṃ hūṃ kili kili sili sili hili hili dhili dhili hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā / iti mantreṇaikavāroccāritena nivedayet /


		48.2.2 (p.503)

tadanu rakṣācakrārasthadaśakrodhānāṃ / oṃ kha vajradhṛk vajrahūṃkāra vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajradaṇḍa vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrānalārka vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrakuṇḍali vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrayakṣa vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrakāla vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajramahābala vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrabhīṣaṇa vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajroṣṇīṣacakravarti vajra hūṃ phaṭ / oṃ vajrapātāla vajra hūṃ phaṭ / iti daśamantrair hūṃ phaḍ ity asya pūrvaṃ imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa amukasya śāntiṃ rakṣāṃ ca kuru iti vidarbhyaikaikavāroccāritair dadyād āvartābhyām ūrdhvam adhaś ca /
tatas tadbahir indrādīnāṃ / oṃ kha kha khāhi khāhi sarvayakṣarākṣasabhūtapretapiśāconmādāpasmāraḍākaḍākinyādaya imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇantu samayaṃ rakṣantu sarvasiddhiṃ me prayacchantu hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā / ity anenāvartābhyām ūrdhvam adhaś ca caturvāroccāritena nivedayet / tāṃś ca maṇḍalādhipaprabhṛtīn sumbhāntān ityādikaṃ prāguktam atrāpi jñeyaṃ /


		48.2.3 (p.504)

śatākṣaraṃ tv ihānyat / oṃ vajraheruka samayam anupālaya herukatvenopatiṣṭha dṛḍho me bhava sutoṣyo me bhava anurakto me bhava supoṣyo me bhava sarvasidhiṃ me prayaccha sarvakarmasu ca me cittaṃ śreyaḥkuru hūṃ ha ha ha ha hoḥ bhagavan vajraheruka mā me muñca heruko bhava mahāsamayasattva āḥ hūṃ phaṭ / iti /
atroktadaśakrodhānām abhidhānottara-uktānāṃ bhujāyudhādikaṃ niṣpannayogāvalyāṃ saṃvaramaṇḍale jñātavyaṃ / vistareṇa tu bhagavataḥ sāmnāyabhāvanākramo 'smābhiḥ saṃvarābhisamayopayikāyāṃ prakaṭita iti sāṃvarikaḥ sārvabhautikabalividhiḥ /


		48. Haivajrikasārvabhautikabalividhi
		48.3.1 (p.505)

athavā hevajrarūpo hṛdaya-hūṃ-kārakiraṇaiḥ sakrodhadaśārarakṣācakranābhyantaḥsthakūṭāgārodarasthamaṇḍalaṃ rakṣācakrabahir dikṣv indrādīn saparivārān aparimitasattvāṃś cākṛṣyendrādīn prabhāsvaraṃ praveśyāvirbhūtasaprajñaherukarūpān vicintya pādyādidānapūrvakaṃ pūrvavac chuddhyā baliṃ / oṃ devapicuvajra imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa amukasya śāntiṃ rakṣāṃ ca kuru hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / iti mantreṇa bhagavato nivedayet /
oṃ āḥ nairātmye ityādināma sambodhya tadbījaṃ coccārya amukasya śāntiṃ rakṣāṃ ca kuru svāhā hūṃ ity anena nairātmyādīnāṃ /


		48.3.2 (p.505)

namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo namo vajramudgarahastāya caṇḍamaṇḍalākṣepakarāya hūṃ phaṭ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo mahādaṇḍadhara vividhasurāsuramardanabhūtān nirmatha hūṃ phaṭ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo hulu hulu mahāpadma amṛtīkruru mahāpadma amṛtīkruru mahāviṣān āḥ / namaḥ samantabuddebhyo namaḥ vajrakrodhāya mahādaṃṣṭrotkaṭabhairavāya vajrasaṃdoha darpāya amṛtakuṇḍali hūṃ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo namo 'cala kāṇa cehu cehu mohu mohu tuhu tuhu gha gha ghāṭaya ghāṭaya hūṃ phaṭ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo ṭakkī hūṃ jaḥ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyaḥ oṃ yamadaṇḍāya nīlāya nīladaṇḍāya turu turu muru muru sarvaduṣṭān māraya hūṃ phaṭ / namaḥ samantabuddhebhyo namo mahābalāya ucchuṣmakrodharājāya sarvanāgānāṃ hṛdayaṃ tāḍaya hūṃ phaṭ / namaḥ samantabuddhānāṃ namaḥ samantadharmānāṃ namaḥ samantasaṅghānāṃ / oṃ sitātapatra oṃ vimala oṃ śaṅkara oṃ pratyaṅgiravajra uṣṇīṣacakravarti sarvayantramantramūlakarma bandhana tāḍana kīlanaṃ vāmamakṛte yena kenacit kṛtaṃ tat sarvam ucchinda ucchinda bhiṇḍa bhiṇḍa ciri ciri miri miri mara mara hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ / oṃ sumbha nisumbha hūṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa hūṃ / gṛhṇāpaya gṛhṇāpaya hūṃ / ānaya ho bhagavan vidyārāja hūṃ phaṭ /
iti daśamantraiḥ pūrvādiṣv aiśānyādiṣu ca dakṣiṇāvartenordhvam adhaś ca yamāryādidaśakrodhānāṃ ḍākinīvajrapañjara-uktānāṃ / oṃ indra jama jalaja khkhabhuva bahni vāḍarakkha canda sujja mādavappa talayatāleṃ aṭṭa sappa edam baliṃ bhuñjājighgha phulla buppa māṃsa biṃha amhakajja savvasā pakṣanti khaṇipheḍagāda svāhā / oṃ akāro mukhaṃ sarvadharmāṇām ādyanutpannatvāt oṃ āḥ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / iti mantreṇendrādīnāṃ /


		48.3.3 (p.508)

indra-ityādisambodhanāni svasvadigaparimitasattvopalakṣaṇāni / gāda-iti gātre / tāṃś ca maṇḍalādhipaprabhṛtīn sumbhāntān ityādikaṃ sāmājikabalividhāv uktam atrāpi jñātavyaṃ /
atratyakrodhamantrāṇāṃ hūṃ-kārebhya āḥ-kārāc ca pūrvaṃ imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa-ity uccārayet / varṇabhujādikaṃ tu krodhānāṃ yathā niṣpannayogāvalyāṃ mañjuvajramaṇḍale / iti haivajrikaḥ sārvabhautikabalividhiḥ /
etac cotpattikrame balividhitrayaṃ / utpannakrame tu prajñopāyānuccalitena cetasā samanvāhāramātrānītebhyaḥ prajñopāyarūpebhya eva sveṣṭamaṇḍaleśādidevatāsahitendrādibhyo jñānarasāvyatiriktasya baler upaḍhaukanaṃ balividhiḥ /
savistaras tu śrīsammpuṭa-uktavajrasattvasaṃvarajñānaḍākinīnāṃ balividhir āmnāyamañjaryāṃ ukto varṇabhujāyudhādikaṃ ca savistaram indrādīnāṃ ceti /


		49. Vighnanivāraṇavidhi (p.509)

iha yadi rajomaṇḍalalikhanādau pātālotthajalānalānilajaladāśaninarāmarasainyagajādivighnopadravo daivakṛto manuṣyādikṛto vā sambhāvyate tadā yathāvidhi vajramayāvaniprākārapañjaraśarajālavitānāntaḥkuharasthārāgrasthirasthitātibhīṣaṇadaśakrodhādhiṣṭhitadakṣiṇāvarttabhramatpītadarśāracakranābhimadhyasthitakūṭagārākāraṃ maṇḍalagṛhaṃ pratimuhuḥ sudṛḍham adhimuñced vajramayatvādibhiḥ sarvavighnā nivāryanta iti ca / athavā pratyupadravaṃ paramāśvādiyogān kuryāt / te ca āmnāyamañjaryāṃ sphuṭaṃ niṣṭaṅkitā itīha nocyante granthavistaratrāsāt /
yaḥ punar aviratam urukaruṇaikarasaśūnyatāsamādhim abhyasyati tasyāparimitā api vighnāḥ praśāmyantīti taṃ prati naiṣa kramaḥ / yo 'pi maṇḍalacakraṃ śūnyataikarasaṃ sudṛḍhaṃ bhāvayati tasya sarve vighnā anye ca doṣāḥ pralayaṃ yānty ayatnataḥ svapne 'pi nābhāsanta it tam api prati nāyaṃ krama iti vighnanivāraṇavidhiḥ /


		50. Vajravajraghaṇṭālakṣaṇādividhi 
		50.1 (p.510)

atra balimaṇḍalabhūśodhanādikriyāḥ sarvāḥ kuliśādidhāraṇapuraḥsarā iti tallakṣaṇam ucyate /
tatra pañcaśūkaṃ vajraṃ tulyatribhāgaṃ tṛtīyabhāgasya tṛtīyabhāgamānena varaṭakam aṣṭāṃśaṃ śūcyaś caturaṃśā natāgrāḥ śucīmadhyādho vartulaṃ madhyaśūcī sūccā caturasrā tīkṣṇā trimekhalāyutā yavagarbhā / asyā agrasya diksūcyagrāṇāṃ cāntaraṃ yavamātraṃ paramparasamāḥ sūcyaḥ sarvāḥ / madhyamā tu kiñcid adhikā / sūcīnām adhaḥ kiñcit kṛśaṃ madhyaṃ tataḥ sthūlam ūrdhvam adhobhāgataḥ kṛśaṃ madhyabhāgasya ca madhyaṃ sthūlam antadvayaṃ tataḥ kṛśaṃ /candrasthatrivalīveṣṭitamūlāṃ madhyasūciṃ vihāya pūrvādisūcyo makarasya dantāntare sthitāḥ / asya nāsā dhānyatuṣārdhordhvamānā makarāsyaṃ sūcīcaturthena bhāgena makaramukhārdhena saraśmicandropariveṣṭanarekhānemiḥ / asyā mekhalāyā madhyabhāga īṣad adhikaḥ kāryaḥ / śeṣabhāgāv anyonyena samau krameṇa dviguṇonnatau / veṣṭanaṃ ca vajrārdhabhāgena / veṣṭanamānadvayaṃ hi dairghyaṃ vajrasya / candrasyādhaḥ padmaṃ padmasyādhaḥ sūkṣmaratnamālāvalayas tadadho mekhalāguṇo raśmis tu yathāyogaṃ drṣṭavyaḥ / tīkṣṇātīkṣṇakarālasaumyabhedena dvividhaṃ / caturaṅgulāt prabhṛti viṃśatyaṅgulaṃ yāvad vajraṃ prasiddhaṃ / yathābhilāṣam iti kecit /


		50.2 (p.512)

ghaṇṭā tulyatribhāgā vajrānurūpamānā tasyā adhas tṛtīyo bhāgo mukhāt prabhṛti śuddhakāṃsyamayaḥ kāryas tad ūrdhvabhāgadvayaṃ sauvarṇādimayaṃ / tatkāṃsyamadhyamākāśaṃ tiryagāyāmayoḥ samaṃ / oṣṭhād ūrdhvaṃ mekhalayor garbhe vajrādimālā / amṛtakumbhasyādhaś caturasrā vedī tadadho valītrayaṃ tadadhaḥ padmaṃ tadadho mekhalayor madhye yathāyogaṃ vajrādimālā / tadaho nānāratnaṃ hārārdhahārāḥ / hāragarbheṣv aṣṭasv aṣṭau cihnāni cakraratnapadmakhaḍgāḥ pūrvādidikṣu / locanaṃ vajraṃ padmam utpalaṃ cāgneyyādividikṣu / yathāśobhaṃ ca sthānasthāneṣu kumudotpalapadmaratnapatrāṅkurādikaṃ / kumbhamānena prajñāmukhaṃ mukhordhvaṃ pūrvavajrārdham iva vajrādhaṃ / iha kācid ghaṇṭā manāg unmīladambhojamukhī kāpi padmā kāpi gomukhī /


		50.3 (p.513)

iha vajrasya madhyapūrvādisūkeṣu varaṭakaparyanteṣv akṣobhyavairocanādīn dhyāyāt / athavā madhye vairocanaṃ pūrvādidaleṣu maitreya-kṣitigarbha-vajrapāṇi-gaganagañja-lokeśvara-mañjuśrī-sarvanivaraṇaviṣkambhi-samantabhadrān / aṣṭāṃśe vajrasattvaṃ / aparapadme pūrvādidaleṣu vajrāṅkuśī-vajrapāśī-vajrasphoṭā-vajrāveśāḥ / āgneyyādiṣu cundā-ratnolkā-vajraśṛṅkhalā-'parājitāḥ / aparāntasūkeṣu madhye jñānaḍākinīṃ pūrve vajraḍākinīm uttare ghoraḍākinīṃ paścime vetālīṃ dakṣiṇe caṇḍālīṃ /
ghaṇṭopary adhomukhapadmadaleṣu dikṣu dakṣiṇāvarttena locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārāḥ  vidikṣu vasudhārā-cundā-bhṛkuṭī-vajramālāḥ / kumbhasya madhye prajñā-pāramitāyāḥ śarīram upari mukhaṃ / tadupari padmaṃ vajraṃ ca pūrvavat / 
āsāṃ cākṣobhyādidevatānāṃ bījacihnabhujādikaṃ niṣpannayogāvalyām uktaṃ /


			50.4 (p.514)

tataḥ samayasattvadevatā niṣpādya hṛdbījaraśminā jñānadevatā ānīya pādyādipuraḥsaraṃ tāsu praveṣya vidhivat pratiṣṭhāpya pūjādikaṃ kṛtvā devatāḥ pariṇamya śūkādirūpeṇa sthitā vajram upāyasvabhāvaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ tu prajñātmikām ubhayam api pāramārthikabodhicittasvarūpam iti sudṛḍham adhimucya oṃ sarvatathāgata siddhi vajrasamaye tiṣṭha eṣa tvāṃ dhārayāmi hiḥ hi hi hi hi hi hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā / iti paṭhan vajraṃ svyābhyāṃ vṛddhānāmikābhyāṃ / oṃ vajraghaṇṭā hūṃ / iti paṭhan ghaṇṭāṃ ca vāmābhyāṃ dhṛtvā tāṃ vāmakaṭyāṃ nyasya vajrasattvādīn rañjayāmīty adhimuñcan hūṃ-kāroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ / soha i vajjam ullālutāri asattva vimokkha dhamma vimokkhye vajja tuṅga vajjaṅ gacchā adharantu / hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ ho ho ho / iti paṭhan vajram ullālayet /
tato vajraṃ dakṣiṇakaṭyām avasthāpyollālayan vā / oṃ vajradharma raṇita praraṇita sampraraṇita sarvabuddhakṣetrapracāline prajñāpāramitānādasvabhāve vajrasattvahṛdayasaṃtoṣaṇi hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ ho ho ho svāhā / iti paṭhan ghaṇṭāmadhyāṣṭadeśeṣu daṇḍaṃ cālayan vādayet / iti / savistaraṃ tu ghaṇṭāvajraprabhedānāṃ lakṣaṇādikam āmnāyamañjaryām abhihitam iti vajravajraghaṇṭālakṣaṇādividhiḥ /


		51. (p.516)

	iti paramamunīnāṃ vāgudadhyatyagādhe &
	śrutim api na parīyuḥ ke 'pi ke 'pi plavante /
	sakṛpamatimahimnāsmābhir antarnirmajjya & 
	amṛtam idam upanītaṃ prītaye te bhajantāṃ // (pratītaye te bhojantām Sakurai ed)
	sukṛtam uditam uccair jyotir antarjvalad yat & 
	prasṛtam iha mahimnām ākarasyāśu tābhyām /
	vilasatu mama vajrapreyasīśarmadhāmni & 
	trijagadabhayabhartur maṇḍale viśvamūrteḥ //
mahāpaṇḍita-abhayākaragupta-racitā vajrāvalī nāma maṇḍalopāyikā samāptā /
